<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">LUK-KUBA PROJECT BIBLE TRANSLATION</book>
  <para style="h">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nswoos musek mubol LUKE</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lk</para>
  <para style="mt2">NSWOOS MUSEK MUBOL</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKE</para>
  <para style="imt">MATETETSH</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Nswoos musek mubol Luk</char> Nswoos musek mubol Luk, nkaan mu motsh mu Luk mul aphiing mikaan miney mi Kot a Yemayeem musatwoot ikaam i mwoony mu Yish Kilist. A nkaan muku mukim, bes’mubok mbel ane “Nswoos musek,” mbok a mbè ane “Lashaang lasek.” Mwooy maku baphuun’dj kabol Mataay, Maak, Luk akol Yoon a mbis iwa i Yish. Luk kaphuun ntshik mu mwoony mubol Yish munamieet mbi, ek amaphuun kamotsh mwooy mambaak bieentsh ba Yish baakel ambis iwa yaan akol mibuum’dj miaan; nkaan mus’baan abok mbel ane BIKELEL bi Batom. Kwa mwoot mbè motsh esayeeph itaang aal’k imbet ikwook iphuun’dj baan Nswoos musek mubol Luk mbi, ek mikaan mibwiik mi kaany misanaph atwoot ane aphuun’dj bos ntshi mu masamashaam’l (70) a mbis mibotsh’dj mi Yish Kilist. Mpuuny Luk, ambaak ngangabuk. Mpuuny’diaan akol ntwoot’diaan bisalak mbè ane Luk ambaak mwoot alwoong mikaan. Luk Ambaak i nyiing aphuun mwooy makwook ma mwoony mu Yish, katwootaan mwooy i mbok akephetsh’dj maan, ikaam i mbè ibiek’dj bamwook busek es’baan abal nkaan mwaan (Luk 1.1-3). Kambaak muna Yuud mbi (Kolosaay 4.10-14) kamotsh ambaak amphuun i lakeny lasek ikaam iyaas bât baaph mbè ka ben a Yuud bamwook. Bisasol a baph’l mbok esaan alak ntwoong’l abol ben a Yuud (Luk 1.8). Nswoos musek mubol Luk musaphwaans i mikaan mi Mataay akol Maak ikaam i mbè misalak mwooy mantshiin kamotsh mesaphwaans. A mikaan miku miset, nkaan mubol Luk musalak busek mbok abotsh’dj baan Yoon Mubatiis. Luk esabotwoot bi bwiik idik di mweeng (a biteny biaan biku 11.4; 17.3-4; 23.34; 24.47) akol ilwoom (a biteny biaan biku 3.21; 5.16; 6.12; 11.1-12; 22.32)</para>
  <para style="iot">Mwooy mel a ngat</para>
  <para style="io1">Matetetsh <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1.1-4</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mibotsh’dj akol bwân bu Yoon Ntaam’s a bât akol a Yish <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:5-2:52">1.5—2.52</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ngun mu Yoon Ntaam’s a bât <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3.1-20</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mitaam’s akol lakieek la Yish <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:21-4:13">3.21—4.13</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ngun mu Yish a ibaantsh i nuung mu Ngaleel <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4.14—9.50</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="io1">To Ngaleel shaang Yelushalem <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:27">9.51—19.27</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Labiing la mom akolakol i Yelushalem <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 19:28-23:56">19.28—23.56</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mibuum’dj, misodjdj akol mibaany mi Kum a dik <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 24:1-53">24.1-53</ref>.</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Nsekieem Teophil: Bât babwiik katetsh baan aphuun mikaan mi mwooy makun mambaak makeph’t aphingiit. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Mbok mintshiin atalwoos’dj baan abol bitieen bât ba bukoos to matetetsh, bamwiphil ben a ngun mu dweey di Ntshièm. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Ntshiin akun, namabok lakeny a ntem, aman miim awuul mwooy makun to matetetsh, kabok miim lakeny ikaam iphuuns i maan a bulodj, ween kum Teophil, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />ikaam i mbè uyeeph ane, mwooy malwoos’dj baan ma makwook.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lashaang la mibotsh’dj mi Yoon-Mubatiis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Itaang imbaak Helood kum a Yudey, ambabaak ntwootsh a Ntshièm a diin di Sakaliy, ambaak akat nsel mu Abiy. Diin diku disalak shin mikim a Palesitine. Mwam’shaan, Elisabeet ambaak ntshwakaan abol Aloon. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Mpween mubaan bambaak bât basek a miish ma Ntshièm, bambaak bamwoom’k i itshiiny mikiètsh mikim baan’i mwooy ma ikin ma Kum. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Ek kabambaak i mwân mbi, ikaam Elisabet ambaak ikut, kamotsh mpween mubaan bambaak baman anun.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Lasu liek’dj, Sakaliy ambaakaan esakel ngun mwaan mu butwootsh a miish ma Ntshièm, ikaam i mbè ambaak phweet a baan akel ngun a nsel mwaan. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Mbok mintshiin ambaak ikelel i batwootsh banen, aan bambaak bansol a mpwim ikaam iying’l a Ntuum mu Kum ikaam ituum ibel, <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />itaang ituum ibel anyem’liin, twoong mikim a bât imbaak isalwoom Ntshièm a mbis buseph bu mbûl a Ntshièm. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Imbet intshiin, ntshol a Ntshièm kasolaan a bol Sakaliy ayeem a lo la ikat la ituum’l i ibel. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Sakaliy amonaan ntshol, butet bumangaat. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Ek ntshol kanwoosaan ane: “Sakaliy, kutshin’k mbi, ikaam Ntshièm awok ilwoomiaa, mwam’sha Elisabet ayekayeek mwân. Umwekamweek diin di Yoon. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Ween ukaal i nshaas mubwiik mwalek’s idik diaan, kamotsh bât babwiik bekaal i nshaas a mibotsh’dj miaan. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.15. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:3">Nb 6.3</ref>.</char></note>Ikaam, aan el’kaal mwoot anen a miish ma Kum. Kelanyo maan aal’k biket bikim bisayaat. El’kaal ayool to i Mween musek a bos bu mbè inanaan kataadj ambot, <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />aan el’kalaat mitem mi bân ba Isaleel babwiik abol Kum, Ntshièm a baan. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.17. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:5-6">Mak 4.5-6</ref>.</char></note>Aan el’kieen a bos bu Kum i mween baan’i bunoon’l bi Eliy, ikaam itshik a motsh bataat akol bân, kamotsh akakakal’l mitem mi ben a bwoom’dj ikaam i mbè baal i bwaany bu bât basek; ikaam ilos Kum bât bel akolakol ikaam inyey.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Sakaliy kawulaan ntshol ane: “Dweey diku nadiyeeph mbony? Miim nde inun, mwam’sheem anaang bwiik.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.19. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 8:16">Dan 8.16</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:21">9.21</ref>.</char>
    </note>Ntshol kankal’laan ane. “Nde Gabiliyel, namwaak a bos bu Ntshièm, amakantom ikaam itwootiaa kamotsh ashaang’s lashaang laku lasek. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Wok, ween ulashaal kil, kulamon mbokatwoot mbi shaang lasu lelayeem’l mwooy maku, ikaam i mbè ween kuyim’sdj mwooy mieem mbi.” <verse eid="LUK 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Bât bambaak besakwoong Sakaliy a buseph; kakam’l baan ikaam i mbè aan, amaman suw ibwik a ngat a Ntuum mu Ntshièm. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Antowaan, kamon mbokatwoot’i baan mbi. Kayeeph baan ane, amamon dweey di makam’l a mbûl a Ntshièm. Ikaam ambaak esatwoot i mio miaan, kashalaan kil.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Ambaakaan aman matu maan ma ngun a Ntuum, kakalaan a mbûlaan. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Mataang makieek ambis akun, mwam’shaan Elisabet kiyaan dieem, aan kadisweyaan a ndieeng a ngwôn itaan, katwootaan ane: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />“Lieenanyeeny busek bumankes Kum.” “Amuk antey bukut bumbaakankel busony a ndieeng a bât!”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntshol esashaang’l mibotsh’dj mi Yish</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />A ngwôn ishaam’l i dieem di Elisabet, Ntshièm katomaan ntshol Gabliel a bol bumotsh bu Ngaleel akat Nazaleet. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.27. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:18">Mt 1.18</ref>.</char></note>Abol ilieeng’i ngaat i mbè kayitshik ayeeph nuung imbaak yeek’l ibol Yosef, ntshwakaan abol Davidj. Diin di ilieeng a ngaat i mbè kayitshik ayeeph nuung akun ambaak Maliy. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Ntshol kiying’laan a bol Maliy, kanwoosaan ane: “Maliy wanum, nkit’l mwaliaa! Mweeng mu Ntshièm mwaaliaa; Kum ediaa!”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Ek lakeny kadiim luun Maliy ikaam i nkieetsh muku, kadiwuusaan ane yum’l iku isalak key. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Ek ntshol kanwoosaan ane: “Maliy kutshiin’k mbi, ikaam mweeng mu Ntshièm mudiaa.” <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.31. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:21">Mt 1.21</ref>.</char></note>Ween ukaal i dieem, ukabot mwân a nuung, Umwekamweek diin di Yish. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.32. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Sam 7.12</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 13:16">13.16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Yesh 9.7</ref>.</char></note>El’kaal mwoot anen. Bambokambok mbel ane: “Mwân abol Kum a dik, Kum Ntshièm amwekamweek bunyim bu ishanaan Davidj, <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />el’kaal kum a yoyoo a ben’a Isaleel, bukum bwaan kabulaal i mom mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Maliy kawuulaan ntshol ane: “Dweey diku dilayeem’l mbony, ikaam i mbè miim yaaph nde ilieeng’i ngaat i mbè kayitshik ayeeph nuung?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Ntshol amankal’l ane: “Mween musek mukakum a dik diaa, bunoon’l bu Ntshièm bukaal’iaa mun ilwimalwim. Ngwoon, mwân elween abot, bambokambok mbel mwân a Ntshièm. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Lieen, Elisabet mwanyo, iyaan edi dieem di mwân a nuung a bunun bwaan; aan ambaak baan abok mbel ane ikut, ek ngwôn aku wey, iyaan anshaam’l a dieem. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.37. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Matt 18.14</ref>.</char></note>Ikaam’i mbè, kwa dweey mbè dimotsh dinek Ntshièm bunoon’l mbi.” <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Iphontshi Maliy kankal’laan ane: “Nde nso abol Kum”, “Bikim bikeph’t mbok antwootween.” A mbis akun Ntshol kanswoolaan, kieenaan.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maliy anyetaan Elisabet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />A mbis matu makieek, Maliy kakataan kieenaan bwaas a bol bu mikwootsh bu Yudey. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Kayiing’laan a mbûl abol Sakaliy, kawuum’laan Elisabet. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Awok’dj Elisabet yum’l ibol Maliy, i mwân kanying’laan a ngat ikuuniaan. I Elisabet kayolaan tô i Mween Musek <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />kabolaan nwool, esatwoot ane: “Ween u ngaat ashaak’s aphiing a baat bakim, i mwân el ikuuniaa wey ashaak’s iyaan! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Ek nde nyeeny ikaam i mbè inaan abol Kumieem indieen? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Ikaam’i mbè itaang imwook miim yum’liaa a mato mieem, mwân amatoph i nshaas mubwiik a ikuunieem. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Nshaas mwaal i mwoot akun amwim’s, ikaam i mbè mwooy makim malwoos’dj baan abol Kum mayekayeem’l!”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lieem lasem’l la Maliy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.46. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 2:1-10">1 Sam 2.1-10</ref>.</char>
    </note>Maliy katwootaan ane:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Ntem mweem musasem’l Kum;<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />ntem mweem mudi nshaas a Ntshièm, mwoot amaphaans,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.48. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 1:11">1 Sam 1.11</ref>.</char>
    </note>ikaam i mbè amuk alieen i mun a ngunaan i nkit’l.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Ntshiin mbè, atetsh to lwool mabotsh makim mambokambok mbel ane udi iteem isek,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />ikaam i mbè Ntshièm a bunoon’l bukim ankes mwooy manen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Diin diaan di di ikin;<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />mweeng mwaan mul’kaal a mabotsh ma bât</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">bakim besatshiin bukum bwaan.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Amaakel mwooy manen i lo laan la bunoon’l;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">amatshaak’dj bât bambaak adiwoot i keny ibey imbaak a mitem mibaan.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.52. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:11">Yob 5.11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:19">12.19</ref>.</char>
    </note>Amakum’s bakun bambaak a buum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">ek amabaans bât bambaak i nkit’l.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Bât bambaak’i ntshal, amabadiees biket bisek;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">ek ben budiy amabakas mio bwaang.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Amayaas mwootaan Isaleel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">kamotsh amayiph’l mweeng mwaan bos a bât besankes ngun,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.55. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:7">Matt 17.7</ref>.</char>
    </note>mbok ambaakaan akel ilak i imuk abol mamiit, Abalapham</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">i bân baan yoyoo!”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Maliy amaatwoos i Elisabet phot’a ngwôn iset, ambis akun kakalaan a mbûlaan.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mibot’dj mi Yoon Mubatiis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Ngwôn ibol Elisabet kayeem’liin ikaam ibot mwân, kabotaan mwân a nuung. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Bambaak akolaan i ben ilwootshaan anyeeph baan ane, Kum alak mweeng idik diaan, kawook baaniaan nshaas.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.59. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lew 12.3</ref>.</char>
    </note>Lasu la inaan, kiy baan ikaam ikel mwân nkaan, bambaak i nyiing amweek diin di Sakaliy, muna ndwey ishanaan. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Ek inanaan kakal’laan ane: “Mbi, diin diaan Yoon.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Bamanwoos ane: “Kwa mwoot a ilwootshiin edi diin diku mbi!” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Kawuul baan ishanaan a bisam ane, usamuk bamweek diin key.<verse eid="LUK 1:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Sakaliy kalwoomaan dibey ikaam iphuun diin, kaphuunaan ane: “Diin diaan Yoon.” I nkimubaan bamakam’l! <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Itaang ikun intshiin, inem ibol Sakaliy katungiin, katetshaan atwoot kamotsh kasem’laan Ntshièm a ngon. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Butet kayaat buun bât bakim bambaak akol a baan; mwooy maku makim bambaak bes’matwoot a mal makim ma mikwootsh mi Yudey. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Bât bakim bawok’dj mwooy makun, katetsh baan adiwuus ane: “Mwân aku elaphil nyeeny?” Ikaam’i mbè bunoon’l bu Kum bumbabaakiaan.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lieem lasem’l la Sakaliy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Sakaliy ishaan abol a Yoon, kayolaan i Mween Musek, katetshaan atwoot mwooy ma bungaang bu Ntshièm ane:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Basem’l Kum, Ntshièm a Isaleel.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">Ikaam anyiyaas bât baan, abaphaans kamotsh.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Aan amanyitalaas kum anoon’l ikaam itaphaans biit</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">bân ba kum Davidj, nsowaan.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Mbok atwootsh’diaan a muny mu bangaang ba ikin ba to kaany<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />ambaak atayeek ilak ane:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">el’katashaang’l a mio mi baphis biit akol bât bes’tabim’l.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Amaalak bamaam biit mweeng mwaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">kayiph’laan malak maan ma ikin.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73-74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73-74" />Mbok mintshiin ambaakaan akel kot i mamiit Abalapham,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:73-74">ane, el’kataphaans a mio mi baphis biit</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:73-74">ikaam inkes ngun i ntem ngon,<verse eid="LUK 1:73-74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />ikaamieen a bos bwaan a bulodj baan’i ikin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">matu miit makim ma mwoony.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.76. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref>.</char>
    </note>“I ween mwânieem, babokabok mbel ane, ngaang a Ntshièm abol Ntshièm anen a dik.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">Ikaam ween ukatieel a bos bu Kum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">ikaam ilodj mbokiaan,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />ikaam ishaang’s bât baan lashaang ane Ntshièm ntshaan esaphaans bât,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">ankas bawok’s mweeng to mbi a bweph bu baan,<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Ikaam’i mbè Ntshièmiit edi mweeng mubwiik.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">Esaal angaam’s a dik diit mwany mu to dik mwaphwaans i itaang i ntshees butu<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.79. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Yesh 9.2</ref>.</char>
    </note>ikaam ingaam’s bât bel a mwim’l akol ba bel a shin ilwimalwim i iwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">ikaam ilaat ma teemiit a mbok edi nkit’l.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Mwân ambaak esienaang, i mween mwaan kanaang muun. Ambaak esatwoos a mandiy maaph bât shaang lasu lambaakaan asol a yol’l abol bât ba Isaleel.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Mibotsh’dj mi Yish</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mataay 1.18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />A matu makun, Kayis Ogust kum anen a ben a Loom kabokaan nkieetsh ane, bât bakim badiphuuns miin a shin mikim a Loom. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Aku, ambaak phweet bukoos adiphuuns miin, a itaang imbaak, Kilinis nguph’lanoph a Suliy. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Bât bakim bamayeen ikaam iphuuns miin mabaan, mun mwoot ilwootshaan.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Ngwoon, Yosef iyaan, amatow a bol bu Nazalet, a nuung mu Ngaleel, kieenaan a Yudey, a Betelephem, a imbet ibotsh’dj baan kum Davidj; ngwoon, iyaan ambaak mun ilwootshaan. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Yosef kieenaan i yeek’liaan Maliy, ikaam adiphuuns miin, Maliy, ambaak i dieem, <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />ambaak baan a Betelephem, matu ma ibotsh kayeem’l maan. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Kabotaan mwânaan bukoos a nuung, kankophaan bishaan, amambey a idieel i nyam, ikaam i mbè a mbûl a bientshambaang kayimbaak imbet mbi.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bantshol basos babek ba phaang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />A yaas ikun intshiin, imbabaak babek ba phaang, bashik a buseph, besabak phaang ibaan butu. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Phweet mintshiin ntshol abol Kum kasolaan akol a baan, buum bu Kum bumabangaam’s, bamanwook butet bubwiik, <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />ek ntshol kabalwoosaan ane: “Kabutshiin’k mbi, ikaam namanyi bulaas nswoos musek mulayeek bât bakim nshaas mubwiik. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Butu bulwool, a bol bu Davidj bamabubos Phaans; ntshaan Kilist Kum! <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Lieen anyeeny ying’t yil’bwiin ato nyeeph: butokatotaan, mwân akoph bishaan, abetsh imbet isadia nyam.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Phweet mintshiin, twoong mayol ma to dik, kakwoom’kiin i ntshol, besasem’l Ntshièm besietwootsh ane:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Buum bwaal abol Ntshièm a dik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">i nkit’l mwaal a shin a maan abol bât besaan amuk!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Bantshol antobaan ikaam ikal a dik, babek ba phaang kadilwoos baan ane: “Tieen anyeeny a Betelephem, tielieen dweey diku dinkeph’t, dimwitalwoos Kum.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Ngwoon kieen baan bwaas, katobaan ataan Maliy baan’i Yosef, i mwân abetsh a idieel i nyam. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Amon baan mwân, katetsh baan abol ntshik mumbaak ntshol abalwoos idik di mwân aku. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Bât bakim bawok’dj mwooy mambaak babek ba phaang besatwoot, kakam’l baan. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Ek Maliy ambaak asuk mwooy maku makim a ntemwaan kamotsh ambaak ambok lakeny labwiik a ntem. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />A mbis akun, babek ba phaang kakaal baan. Katetsh baan asem’l bunen bu Ntshièm, ikaam i mwooy makim mawok’dj baan akol ma mamwoony baan, mbok abalwoos’dj ntshol.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish anyey diin diaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.21. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lew 12.3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:31">Lk 1.31</ref>.</char>
    </note>Amweem’l matu inaan ambis ibotshaan, itaang kayeem’liin ikaam ikel mwân nkaan, kamweek baan diin ane Yish, mbok mintshiin atwoot’dj ntshol a bos bu mbè inanaan kataadiy dieem mbi.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish banak a Ntuum mu Ntshièm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.22. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:6-8">Lew 12.6-8</ref>.</char>
    </note>Matu amweem’l maan ikaam i mbè Yosef baan’i Maliy badikut’l, mbok ambaak nkieetsh mu Moos. Kaphet baan i mwân a Yelushalem ikaam inak abol Kum, <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Eks 13.2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12">12</ref>.</char></note>ikaam baphuun a nkieetsh mu Kum ane: “Mwân a nuung aku nkim a bukoos, bel’kanièm’l abol Kum.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Banaph’dj kalièm’l kamotsh ilaam mbok mintshiin ambaak nkieetsh mu Kum musalwoom, bimbieeng biphey bi bwaany, aal’k bân baphey ba bimbieeng.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Ambabaak nuung maphel a Yelushalem, diin diaan Shimeoon; ambaak mwoot ansek a miish ma Ntshièm, ambaak antshin Ntshièm. Imbaak esakwoong’l mishaang’l mu Isaleel. Mween Musek mumabaakiaan <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Mween Musek kanwoos muun ane, ween kulawa aaph mbè kumwoony Kilist mwân a Kum mbi. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Shimeoon kieenaan a Ntuum a bunoon’l Mween Musek. Itaang imbaak babotsh ba Yish banyiyaan ikaam iyeedj nkieetsh mu Moos, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Shimeoon amansheetsh mwân a mio, kasem’laan Ntshièm, katwootaan ane:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Kum, iphontshi wayeedj ilakiaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">ukwook’dj alieem’l muna ngun mwaa awa a nkit’l.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Ikaam’i mbè miish mieem mamon mwoony mwaa,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />mwoony mumbaakween walodj a bos bu bât bakim:<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:32. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:6">Yesh 42.6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49.6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:10">52.10</ref>.</char>
    </note>Muun mwaany mulalak a malwootsh makim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">mulaal buum bu bât baa ba Isaleel.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Ishanaan baan’i inanaan bambaak besakam’l ikaam mwooy mambaak atwoot Shimeoon idik diaan. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />A mbis akun Shimeoon amabashaak’s, kalwoosaan Maliy inaan abol Yish ane: “Mwân aku abwekabwees kamotsh ankat’l bât babwiik a Isaleel. El’kaal ying’t i Ntshièm ilaswoot miaang aphiing a bât <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />kamotsh atshikatshik a baph’l bwaany bwaswaam a mitem mi bât babwiik. Ek ween Maliy, susudj yil’kakweet a ntem muna mbaam mu ituum.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36-37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36-37" />Ambabaak ngaang a Ntshièm mu ngaat, diin diaan ambaak Ane, mwân abol Fanwel, nshi ilwootsh ibol Ashey. Ambaak inun, ambaak ashaal mitshi shaam’l i nwimiaan ato bulieeng bwaan, ambis akun amashaal ngweel suk mitshi masa inaan biney. Kambaak atow a Ntuum mbi; ek ambaak ankes Ntshièm ngun butu i mwaany, ankin biliees kamotsh anwoom Ntshièm. <verse eid="LUK 2:36-37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Itaang ikun intshiin antwoolaan, katetshaan asem’l Ntshièm. Ambaak anwoos bât bakim dweey di mwân, baku bambaak besakwoong’l mbè Ntshièm aphaans Yelushalem.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babotsh ba Yish bakal a Nazaleet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.39. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 2:23">Mt 2.23</ref>.</char>
    </note>Amaans’dj Maliy i Yosef mwooy makim ma mikieetsh mi Kum, kakal baan bos a nuung mu Ngaleel, a bol bu baan bu Nasalet. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Mwân ambaak esienaang a latok baan’i lakeny. Ambaak ayool tô i bwaany, i mweeng mu Ntshièm mumabaak a dik diaan.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish a Ntuum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />41 <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.41. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Eks 12.1-27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-8">Dtn 16.1-8</ref>.</char></note>Mun ntshi mukim, babotsh ba Yish bambaak bamween a Yelushalem ikaam i nshaas mu Pasak. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yish amwediaan mitshi isheeng miphey, kaphet baaniaan bos a Yelushalem mbok mintshiin ankel’k baan a bol baan idik di nshaas mukun. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Anshil matu ma nshaas, kakal baan, Yish, mwân a baan kashalaan a Yelushalem; ek babotsh baan kabambaak ayeeph mbi; <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />bambaak besaphis mbè ane, Yish elaphiing a bât bambaak i baan a mbok a lieen. Iphontshi katetsh baan answoot aphiing ilwootsh i bakidj baan lasu la ibwoon’k. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Ek kabamon mbi. Ngwoon, kakal baan bos a Yelushalem ikaam inswoot. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />A mbis matu maset, katobaan antaan a Ntuum, ashik aphiing bayeeph mikieetsh, es’bawoom’ka kamotsh amabawuul miwuul. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Bât bakim bambaak besamwoom’k, bambaak besakam’l ikaam i lakeny laan, i mbok ambakaan bakal’l. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Babotsh baan amabaan amon, bamakam’l; inanaan amamuul ane: “Mwânieem, umatakel ngo iyey? Ishô i miim taswoot i yiintsh ibwiik.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Amabawuul ane: “Bumbanswoos key? Kabusayeeph mbè ane, ndel’kaal a mbûl a Tatieeme?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Ek kabawok mbok ambaakaan abalwoos mbi.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Yish kakalaan i baan a Nazalet. Ambaak amabawom’k. Ek inanaan amaasuk mwooy maku makim a ntem mwaan. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.52. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:26">1 Sam 2.26</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:4">Mik 3.4</ref>.</char></note>Yish amanaang. Yenaang’tsh a bwaany, yewoodj butadj, ambaak mwoot ansek a miish ma Ntshièm akol miish ma mwoot aku nkim.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Lashaang la Yoon Mubatiis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mataay 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maak 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoon 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />A ntshi mu ishieeng itaan mu bukum bu Tibelio; Poons Pilaat ambaak nguph’lanoph a nuung mu Yudey, Helood ambaak nguph’lanoph a Ngaleel, mwân a baan Filipooy ambaak kum a Itulaay baan’i Takonitiid, Lusania ambaak kum a Abileen, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Ane baan’i Kayif bambaak batwootsh banen. Dweey di Ntshièm dimanyiy abol Yoon, mwân abol Sakaliy, a imbet aaph bât. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Yoon katetshaan abuung a mangaan makim ma ntshal a Yodan, kabokaan mbek ane: “Kal’lanyeeny mitem miin, taam’lanyeeny, Ntshièm el’kabuwok’s mweeng.”<verse eid="LUK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Yesh 40.3-5</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mbok aphuuny’dj baan a nkaan mu mwooy ma ngaang a Ntshièm Yeshay ane:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Dweey di mwoot esabol nwool a imbet aaph bât ane:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Lodianyeeny mbok abol Kum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">nkesanyeeny mioodj miasheem’t!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Mioph’dj mikim mil’kaal miadiph,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">mikwootsh mikim akol takwootsh takim bikaal shin a shin;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Phwoot ikim ikaal ya sheem’t,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">mbok mikim ibey ikaal yalodj.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Bât bakim bamokamon mweeng mu Ntshièm!’”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.7. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mt 12.34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23.33</ref>.</char>
    </note>Twoong a bât imbaak imwiy abol Yoon ikaam ibataam’s. Ambaak amabalwoos ane: “Bân ba ntshwa!” “Nyeeny amabulak mbok atshiin kaph ibol Ntshièm ilakolakol? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.8. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Yn 8.33</ref>.</char></note>Lak anyeeny bikelel bisalak mbè ane bwakal’l mitem miin, kabutwoot’k a bwinamieet ane Abalapham taatiit mbi. Ikaam ndes’bulwoos mbè ane Ntshièm akwook’dj akal’l mbôk iku imphil bân ba Abalapham! <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.9. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mt 7.19</ref>.</char></note>Ngieem yanyik akolakol ikaam ishieeng mitey to mashin: ntey mukin mwaaph mbè kamusatow ndwoom isek bekamusheeng, kamotsh bamamuphul a tey.” <verse eid="LUK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Bât kamuul baan ane: “Takwok’dj akel mbony?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Kabakal’laan ane: “Wey edi nguum iphey ayeek mwoot aaph iyin motsh; mwoot edi bi bidia akel mbok mintshiin.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.12. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:29">Lk 7.29</ref>.</char>
    </note>Bakweek ba minaam kamotsh kiy ikaam ibataam’s, kawuul baan Yoon ane: “Ntaang’dj, i biit takwok’dj akel mbony?” <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Kabakal’laan ane: “Kabutol’k naam mu mwoot i ntieet mwalek mu musayeem’l mbi.” <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Mayol kakas maan amuul ane: “I biit, takwok’dj akel mbony?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Kabakal’laan ane: “Kabutaaml’k i mwoot iket i ngon mbi, kabubaang’sk mwoot dweey bukal mbi; buyim’sanyeeny ikaphiin i nshaas.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Bât bambaak besakwoong’l miyid miaan, mwoot nkim ambaakaphis ane Yoon ntshaan Kilist. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Yoon kabalwoosaan nkim mubaan ane: “Miim ndek butaam’s i maas, ek wey amandek miim a bunoon’l el’kiy, kandesayeem’l ikaam ituung’l mishing mi masabaat maan mbi. Aan ekibutaam’s i Mween Musek baan’i katey. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Wey asuk ikal a lo laan ikaam isheeph’l shaang. El’kakweek shaang a yaal yaan, ek atukatuum biphwoony bi shaang a katey kaaph mbè kakesanyim mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Ntshiin, Yoon ambaak esalwoos bât nswoos musek, esieneeng mitem mibaan i mwooy miek’dj mabwiik. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3-4">Mt 14.3-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17-18">Mak 6.17-18</ref>.</char></note>Ek Yoon ambaakaan esalak nguph’lanoph Helood bweph bwaan, ikaam i mbè ambaak atweem Helodiaas, mwaam’s a mwa inaan, kamotsh amakel mwooy miek’dj mabey mabwiik. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Helood amakel kamotsh mwooy miek’dj mabey malek’s, kabokaan Yoon a mwaat.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mitaam’l mi Yish</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mataay 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maak 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />A mbis mbè bât bakim baman ataam’l, Yish amataam’l iyaan; ambaak Yish esalwoom Ntshièm, dik dimadiph’l, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.22. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Matt 22.2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Ntm 2.7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Yesh 42.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mt 3.17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mak 1.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Lk 9.35</ref>.</char></note>i Mween Musek kakum muum adik diaan, a iphwa i bwoot, muna phul imbieeng. I dweey dimakum to dik ane: “Ween u mwânieem bukwootsh; lakeny lieem lakim lela ween.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bamaam babol Yish</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mataay 1.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yish ambaak i mitshi akolakol i maseset atetsh’diaan ngun mwaan. Bât bambaak besaphis ane, mwân a nuung abol Yosef, mbè mwân abol Heliy, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />mwân abol Matat, mwân a nuung abol Lewu, mwân a nuung abol Meleki, mwân a nuung abol Yanay, mwân abol Yosef, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />mwân a nuung abol Matatias, mwân abol Amoos, mwân a nuung abol Nahum, mwân a nuung abol Eseli, mwân a nuung abol Nagaay, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />mwân a nuung abol Maat, mwân a nuung abol Matatias, mwân a nuung abol Semey, mwân a nuung abol Yosetsh, mwân a nuung abol Yoda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />mwân a nuung abol Yoanaan, mwân a nuung abol Lesa, mwân a nuung abol Solobabel, mwân a nuung abol Shalatieel, mwân a nuung abol Neli, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />mwân a nuung abol Meleki, mwân a nuung abol Adiy, mwân a nuung abol Kosam, mwân a nuung abol Elamadam, mwân a nuung abol Ele, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />mwân a nuung abol Yoses, mwân a nuung abol Elieseey, mwân a nuung abol Yolim, mwân a nuung abol Matat, mwân a nuung abol Lewu, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />mwân a nuung abol Shimeoon, mwân a nuung abol Yudaas, mwân a nuung abol Yosef, mwân a nuung abol Yonam, mwân a nuung abol Eleyakim, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />mwân a nuung abol Meleya, mwân a nuung abol Mena, mwân a nuung abol Matata, mwân a nuung abol Nataan, mwân a nuung abol Davidj, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />mwân a nuung abol Yishay, mwân a nuung abol Obeday, mwân a nuung abol Boaaz, mwân a nuung abol Salamoon, mwân a nuung abol Nashoon, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />mwân a nuung abol Aminadaab, mwân a nuung abol Admiin, mwân a nuung abol Ani, mwân a nuung abol Heseloon, mwân a nuung abol Pelees, mwân a nuung abol Yudaas, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />mwân a nuung abol Yakob, mwân a nuung abol Isak, mwân a nuung abol Abalapham, mwân a nuung abol Tela, mwân a nuung abol Nashol, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />mwân a nuung abol Seluug, mwân a nuung abol Lagawu, mwân a nuung abol Peleeg, mwân a nuung abol Ebe, mwân a nuung abol Shela, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />mwân a nuung abol Kenaan, mwân a nuung abol Afashaad, mwân a nuung abol Sheem, mwân a nuung abol Now, mwân a nuung abol Lemeek, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />mwân a nuung abol Matusheel, mwân a nuung abol Henook, mwân a nuung abol Yaleed, mwân a nuung abol Malaleel, mwân a nuung abol Kenaan, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />mwân a nuung abol Enoosh, mwân a nuung abol Sheet, mwân a nuung abol Adaam, mwân a nuung a Ntshièm.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Besakieek Yish</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mataay 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maak 1.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yish, ayool tô i Mween Musek, ambaak esitwey to Yodan, mween mumanaat a imbet yaaph bât, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />imbet inkieek’dj baan abol sak’tieem a phaang matu masa maney. Kambaakadia iket matu makun mbi, ambis matu makun, kawokaan ntshal.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Sak’tieem kanwoosaan ane: “Mbè u Mwân a Ntshièm, lwoos mbôk aku iphil diaamp.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.4. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 8:3">Dtn 8.3</ref>.</char>
    </note>Yish kankal’laan ane: “Bamaphuun ane: ‘Mwoot kelaal i mwoony ikaam i diaamp mbi.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Sak’tieem amanaat a ngèl a dik, kanakaan makum makim ma shin a maan itaang intshiin. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Sak’tieem kanwosaan ane: “Nayekayeek bunoon’l buku bukim i buum bu makum maku.” “Ikaam makum maku makim bamampieek imaan, nakwok’dj mayeek mwoot nkim es’miim amuk. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Ek mbè untuk, budiy buku bukim bulaal ibwaa.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.8. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:13">Dtn 6.13</ref>.</char>
    </note>Yish kankal’laan ane: “Bamaphuun ane: ‘Tuk Kum Ntshièmaa, kamotsh nkes anamieet ngun!’”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Sak’tieem kanaataan suk a Yelushalem, kanshikaan a dik di ntwoon mu Ntuum, kanwosaan ane: “Mbè u Mwân a Ntshièm, dibok a shin, <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.10. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Ntm 91.11</ref>.</char></note>Ikaam i mbè bamaphuun ane: ‘Ntshièm atokatom bantshol baan idik diaa, ikaam ibak.’ <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.11. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:12">Ntm 91.12</ref>.</char></note>Kamotsh ane: ‘Basukasuk a mio mibaan, ikaam i mbè iteemiaa kayibal’k a mbôk mbi.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.12. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:16">Dtn 6.16</ref>.</char>
    </note>Yish kankal’laan ane: “Bamaphuun ane: ‘Kukwook’dj akieek Kum Ntshièmaa mbi.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />A mbis mbè amaans mbok akieek Yish a mbok mikim, sak’tieem katowaan akolaan ikaam inkieek itaang yek’dj imotsh.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish atetsh ngun mwaan a Ngaleel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mataay 4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maak 1.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yish kakalaan a Ngaleel i bunoon’l bu Mween Musek. Katetsh baan atwoot nswoos mwaan a minuung mikun mikim. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Yish katetshaan ashaang’l lashaang a mambûl mabaan makim ma Ntshièm mesbaan abok mbel ane shinangoong, bât bakim bambaak besasem’l dweey diaan.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish bambel a Nasalet</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mataay 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maak 6.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yish kieenaan a Nasalet, imbet imbaakaan anaang. Lasu lakit la ben a Yuud lesbaan abok Nsambel ane Nsabat kayiing’laan a shinangoong a mbok ambaak ikeleliaan. Kakataan ikaam ibal nkaan mu Ntshièm <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />kamweek baan nkaan mubol ngaang a Ntshièm Yeshay. Kamubot’laan kamonaan iteny i nkaan impuun baan ane:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.18. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Yesh 61.1-2</ref>.</char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj" closed="false">“Mween mu Kum mul a dik dieem,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">ikaam i mbè aan amaansol kamotsh ankol sediaan ikaam inkes ngun mwaan, kamotsh alwoos bena ntaan nswoos musek.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Aan amantom ikaam ishaang’l bât bel a mwaat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">kamotsh ikaam i bât baaph i miish bamony;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Aphaans kamotsh bât bel akat maphetsh<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />ikaam ishaang’s bât lashaang la ntshi mu mbè ane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:19">Kum, el’kalak mweeng mwaan.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Yish kadiphaan nkaan, kamuyeekaan muna ngun, kashim’kaan a shin. Bakim bambaak a mbûl a Ntshièm kanieen baan bakim miish, <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />katetshaan balwoos ane: “Alwool dweey diku diphuun’dj baan dimwok bwiin diayeem’l.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Bât bakim bamatwoot busek bu Yish, besakaml ikaam i mwooy ma mweeng matwoodj a muny mwaan, kadiwuus baan ane: “Ntshaan mwân abol Yosef, mbè?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yish katwootaan ane: “Dikwook, bumbokambok’s nkwoon ane: ‘Ween ngaangabuk, dibo weenamieet.’ Kamotsh bundwokandwool ane: ‘Tamawok mwooy makim mankelween a Kapeenum, yeedj mwooy makun makim a ndey, a bol bwiin. <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.24. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Yn 4.44</ref>.</char></note>Kamotsh katwootaan ane: “Ikakaam, ndes’bulwoos ane, kwa ngaang a Ntshièm mbè motsh anyeedj baan a bol bu baan mbi.<verse eid="LUK 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.25. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Bk 17.1</ref>.</char>
    </note>Kamotsh, ndes’bulwoos dikwook ane, ambabaak baat bel a bweel babwiik a Isaleel a itaang i Eliy, mbul kayimbaak anow andieeng mitshi miset akol ngwôn ishaam’l mbi, ntshaal ibwiik imaying’l a shin mikim. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.26. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:8-16">1 Bk 17.8-16</ref>.</char></note>Ek kabatom Eliy abol ngaat a bweel aku nkim mbi, ek katomaan Eliy abol ngaat a bweel motsh ambaak ambis buseph bu Nazalet, a Salepta a shin a Sidoon. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.27. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2 Bk 5.1-14</ref>.</char></note>Ambabaak bena badj babwiik a Isaleel a itaang i ngaang a Ntshièm Elish; ek kayimbaak mbè mwoot motsh a ndieeng a baan awok’dj busek mbi, Naman anamieet mun a Suliy ntshaan awok’dj busek.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Bât bakim a mbûl a Ntshièm kawok baan kaph, awok’dj baan mwooy maku. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Kakat baan a shin, kabieeng baan Yish a bol, kieen baaniaan a dik di nkwootsh a imbet iphik’dj baan bol Nasalet ikaam inyuk’l a ibèk, <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />ek kashamaan a ndieeng a baan, kieenaan.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwoot ambaak i mween mubey</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Maak 1.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Lasu liek’dj, Yish kakumaan bos a Kapenum, a nuung mu Ngaleel, katetshaan ashaang’l lashaang lasu lakit la ben a Yuud les’baan abok mbel ane Nsabat abol bât bakim. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.32. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28-29">Mt 7.28-29</ref>.</char></note>Bât bambaak besakam’l mbok ambaakaan esashaang’l lashaang, ikaam ambaak esatwoot i bukum. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />A mbûl a Ntshièm, ambabaak mwoot i mween mu mubey. Katetshaan atwoot dweey dinoon’l ane: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Ayee! Yish muna Nazalet wes’taswoos dweey key? Ween umwiy ikaam itadiaak mbè mbony? Ndesayeeph mbok e ween: u mwoot ikin abol Ntshièm!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yish kaphaang’saan mween mubey buluung ane: “Bak muny, tow a ngat a mwoot aku!” Ngwoon, mween mubey kambwees muun a shin a miish ma bât bakim, katomuun a ngataan aaph anèm’s.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Bât bakim kakam’l baan, kadiwuus baan ane: “Aku dweey key! Mwoot aku edi bunoon’l i mangon butom’s mieen mibey dweey mintow!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Nswoos mwaan mumanyeen a mandodj makim ma yaas ikun.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esabo babieel babwik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mataay 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maak 1.29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yish katowaan a shinangoong, kieenaan abol Simoon. Bô bu ngaat bu Simoon bumbaak i latok tey lanoon’l, kalwoom baan Yish ikaam imbo. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Ngwoon, Yish kaphuum’laan a dik diaan i dweey dinoon’l, kabieengaan bwaal, kashil buun, bô bwaan kawokaan busek, kakataan itaang intshiin a shin, katetshaan bakes ngun.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Amwing’l itaang, bât bakim bambaak’i maal mabwik maasek’s kiy baan ibaan abol Yish. Ambaak anyeeng mwoot nkim mio, kawok baan busek. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Mieen mibey mimatow abol babieel babwiik misiebwek minwool ane: “U mwân a Ntshièm!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Ek Yish ambaak es’miphang’s i dweey dinoon’l, es’mikiny mbè ane kamitwoot’k mbi, ikaam i mbè mimbaak misayeeph ane ntshaan Kilist.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esashaang’l lashaang a shinangoong i Yudey</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mataay 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maak 1.29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Apheen akun kosangiees, Yish katowaan a bol, kieenaan a imbet yaaph bât. Twoong a bât katetshiin a nswoot; antwool baan akolaan, kanaph baan amwing ikaam i mbè katwook akol a baan mbi. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Ek Yish kabalwoosaan ane: “Ndedi dweey dishaang’l lashaang lasek la bunyim bu Ntshièm abol bât a mal mieek’dj kamotsh, ntshiin akun amantom Ntshièm.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Kienaan yeshaang’l lashaang a shinangoong i Yudey.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yish esabok bieentsh ba bukoos mbel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mataay 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maak 1.16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:1-2">Mt 13.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:9-10">Mak 3.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1">4.1</ref>.</char>
    </note>Lasu liek’dj, Yish ambaak ayeem a nkol mu idiph i Genesaleet, twoong a bât kayooliin akolaan ikaam iwok dweey di Ntshièm. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Kamonaan maat maphey a nkol mu idiph, ek babwek ba maloph bambaak baman akoph, besakutul mat mabaan. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yish kabanaan a bwaat bumotsh, bubol Simoon, kanwoosaan ane, sem’s bwaat kakieek kaany i nkol idiph. Yish kashim’kaan a ngat a bwaat, katetshaan ashaang’l lashaang a bos bu twoong a bât.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Amansaan mbok atwoot, kalwoosaan Simoon ane: “Sem’s bwaat a ndieeng maas matadj, ween i bât baa, bokanyeeny mat, ikaam iyaat swey.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.5. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 21:3">Yn 21.3</ref>.</char>
    </note>Simoon kakal’laan ane: “Ntaang’dj, tamayaat ngun munoon’l butu bukim, aaph ayaat iket mbè imotsh mbi. Ek, a dweey diaa, nabokabok kamotsh mat.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.6. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:6">Yn 21.6</ref>.</char></note>Ambok baan mat a idiph, kayaat baan swey ibwiik, i mat katetsh maan ambaantsh. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Ngwoon, kabok baan bambey ba baan bambaak a bwaat bwek’dj mbel i mio ikaam i mbè bibayaas. Baku kiy baan, nkim mubaan, kayoos baan maat mpween mu maan, maat kanaph maan akit a maas. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simoon Petelo amonaan dweey diku, kaswom’taan a shin a bos bu Yish katwootaan ane: “Kum to akolieem, ikaam i mbè nde mwoot ambey!”<verse eid="LUK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Simoon i bakim bambaakaan i baan, kakam’l baan, ikaam i bwik bu swey imbaak baan bayaat. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Mbok mintshiin ambaak bakidj babol Simoon, Shaak baan’i Yoon, bân babol Sebedey. Ek Yish kalwoosaan Simoon ane: “Kwaal’k i butet mbi; atetsh to lwool, bât belween ayaat.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Ntshiin, kakuutsh baan maat mabaan a nkwootsh mu idiph, kaswool baan bikim bimbaak baan’i biin ikaam ilaph Yish.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esabo muna badj</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mataay 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maak 1.40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Ambaak Yish a bol bwek’dj bumotsh, mwoot kiyaan i bwaal bu badj latok lakim. Amonaan Yish, kabwakaan a mateemaan bos aphum’l a shin, kamwoongaan ane: “Kum, mbè umuk, ukwok’dj antey bwaal!”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yish kashem’laan lo laan, kamwam’laan esatwoot ane: “Ndalwoong, wok busek!” Phweet akun mintshiin, bwaal kashil buun. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.14. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lew 14.1-32</ref>.</char></note>A mbis akun Yish kankinyaan ane: “Kulwoos’k mwoot mbè motsh mbi; ek yaak abol ntwootsh, kamotsh ween i naam mutwotsh’dj Moos, ikaam ilak mbè wanwook busek.” <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Ek nswoos mu Yish mumatshiak’dj bwiik; suk itaang imbaak bât bakwoom’k ikaam imwom’k kamotsh ikaam ibabo maal mabaan. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Ek Yish kieenaan a yik’l a mambet maaph bât ikaam ilwoom Ntshièm.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esabo mwoot a alieeng’l</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mataay 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maak 2.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Lasu liek’dj Yish ambaak esashaang’l lashaang. Baphal’s baan’i bayeeph mikieetsh bambaak bashik aphiing a baan; bambaak baanyiy bakim to mal makim ma Ngaleel akol ma ma Yudey baan’i Yelushalem. Bunoon’l bu Kum bumbaak i Yish, buun bumbaak busabow bât bambaak’i maal. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Baluung biek’dj katwool baan i mwoot alieeng’l abetsh a ikal’baatsh; bambaak besaswoot mbokamwing’s a mbûl ikaam imbey a bos bu Yish. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Mbok aku mbè kabamon bwaany bumwing’s ikaam i twoong a bât. Kabaan baan a dik di ntwoon mu shaam, kasok’l baan mbuus, kamwing’s baan to dik, i ilakiaan aphiing a bât, a bos bu Yish. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yish amwonyaan yim’s i baan, kalwosaan mbieel ane: “Nkidieem, bweph bwaa, bwashil.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Bayeeph mikieetsh i baphal’s katetsh baan abok lakeny ane: “Mwoot key aku esatwoon Ntshièm mishing ngo? Nyeeny akwok’dj adim’s bweph bu mwoot, mbè ka Ntshièm anamieet!” <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yish kayeephaan lakeny labaan, kabawuulaan ane: “Busabok keny idik di mwooy mango ikaam i yey? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Bi bwool ikaam itwoot mbè ane: ‘Bweph bwaa, bwashil’, aal’k ikaam itwoot ane: ‘Kat a shin yaake?’ <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Ek ndedi i nyiing mbè buyeeph ane: Mwân a Mwoot edi bukum bu dim’s bweph bu mwoot a shin itaang!” Ngwoon, kalwoosaan mbieel ane: “Ndesalwoos ane, kat a shin, tol ikal’baatshaa, kal a bol bwaa!” <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Phweet akun mintshiin, mbieel kayeem’taan a bos bu bât bakim, katolaan ikal’baatshaan, kieenaan esiesem’l Ntshièm.<verse eid="LUK 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Nkim mubaan bambaak besakam’l. Kasem’l baan Ntshièm i nshaas, besatwoot ane: “Alwool taamon mwooy ma makam’l!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esabok Lewi mbel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mataay 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maak 2.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />A mbis akun, Yish antowaan, kamonaan nkweek minaam, diin diaan Lewi, ashik a imbetiaan i ngun. Yish kanwoosaan ane: “Ya windeph.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Lewi iyaan kakataan, kaswoolaan biket bikim, kanaphaan.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />A mbis akun, Lewi kalam’saan Yish bi bidia bibwiik a mbûlaan; bakweek minaam babwiik akol bât biek’dj bambaak besadia ibaan a meens. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.30. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1-2">Lk 15.1-2</ref>.</char></note>Ek baphal’s i bayeeph mikietsh bambaak a yaas ibaan, bambaak bes’diwuus ane: “Busadia kamotsh busony i bakweek minaam baan’i bât babey ikaam i yey?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yish kabakal’laan ane: “Bât bedi bunoon’l bu latok kabaaph i nyiing a mwoot ikaam i bow mbi, ek ba bedi maal baan bediaan i nyiing. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Kandiidj ikaam i mbè bât basek bakal’l mitem mibaan mbi, ek namwiy ikaam i bât babey bakal’l mitem mibaan.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dweey disalieen bikin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mataay 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maak 2.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Bât biek’dj Kalwoos baan Yish ane: “Bieentsh ba Yoon Mubatiis mbok mintshiin i bieentsh biit, bamwaak bankin bi bidia, banwoom kamotsh Ntshièm phweet ibwiik, ek bieentsh baa, baan besaal bandia kamotsh banyiow.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yish kabakal’laan ane: “Busaphis ane bukwook’dj akiny bakidj ba nwim a ngaat bi bidia bi nshaas, mbè yaaph nwim elaphiing a baane? Mbikwook! <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Ek matu mayekayeem’l mel’baan atey nwim akol a baan; a matu makun bakikakin bi bidia.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yish kababok’saan nkwoon ane: “Mwoot kakwok’dj abaan yees’l i ndel mu ngaang ikaam imutum i ndel mwaman anun mbi; mbè bukal ndel mu ngaang mukabantsh, i yees’l ingaang kayinaal yaphwaans i ndel mwanun mbi. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Mwoot mbè motsh kakwook’dj abok maan ma ngaang a ngat a inun i ngieem mbi, mbè bukal maan ma ngaang mel’kabaan ngieem, mantshaak’dj a shin. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Ek maan ma ngaang bamak matshik a ngieem mu ngaang! <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Kamotsh mwoot kaaph i nyiing’a maan ma ngaang ambis mbè amanony maan ma kodj mbi, ikaam batokatwoot ambis akun ane: ‘Maan ma kodj mephiim.”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yish ntshaan Kum Nsabat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mataay 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maak 2.23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.1. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:25">Dtn 23.25</ref>.</char>
    </note>Lasu liek’dj la Nsabat, Yish ambaak esiesheem a mangwoon ma shaang. Bieentsh baan bambaak besakun shaang, bamayishiing’l ikaam idia. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Baphal’s biek’dj kabawuul baan ane: “Bwiin busakel mwooy ma ikin a lasu la Nsabat ikaam i yey?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.3. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam 21.1-6</ref>.</char>
    </note>Yish kabakal’laan ane: “Bwiin kabubal dweey dimbaak Davidj akel, lasu liek’dj ambaak’i ntshaal akol ba bambaakaan’i baan mbè? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.4. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Lew 24.9</ref>.</char></note>Kayiing’laan a mbûl a Ntshièm, katolaan maamp ma ikin, kadiawaan, kamotsh kayeekaan ba bambaakaan’i baan; idim mbè nkieetsh mwiit musalak ane, batwootsh ba Ntshièm ba bambaak bidia.”<verse eid="LUK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yish kabalwoosaan kamotsh ane: “Mwân a Mwoot ntshaan Kum a lasu la Nsabat.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esabo mwoot a lo lalieeng’l</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mataay 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maak 3.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Lasu liek’dj la Nsabat, Yish kayiing’laan a mbûl’a Ntshièm, katetshaan ashaang’l lashaang. Ambabaak andaan mwoot i lo la ikat lalieeng’l. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Bayeeph mikieetsh i baphal’s kalieen baan Yish pholoo, ikaam imon mbè Yish akwook’dj abo mwoot lasu la Nsabat, ikaam i mbè bambaak besaswoot dweey dinswoong’l idin. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Ek Yish ambaak esayeeph lakeny labaan, kalwoosaan mun’a lo lalieengl ane: “Kat a shin, shaam a bos bu bât.” Ngwoon, kakataan, kayeem’taan andaan. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />A mbis akun Yish kabalwoosaan ane: “Ndes’buwuul ane, nkieetsh mwiit musatwoot mbony ikaam i lasu la Nsabat: akel mwooy masek mbè, akel mwooy mabey, aphaans mwoony mu mwoot mbè, enekey adiaake?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Yish kabalieenaan nkim mubaan, ambis akun kalwoosaan mwoot akun ane: “Sheem’l lo laa.” Kakelaan ngwoon, lo laan kawok luun busek kwook.<verse eid="LUK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Ek bayeeph mikieetsh i Baphal’s kawok baan kaph ibwiik, katetsh baan adiwuus banamieet ane, iket key mbè bakwok’dj akel Yish.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish aasol bieentsh ishieeng baphey</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mataay 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maak 3.13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />A itaang ikun, Yish kaphetaan a nkwootsh ikaam ilwoom Ntshièm; kalwoomaan Ntshièm butu bukim. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Anyeem butu, kabokaan bieentsh baan mbel; kabasolaan isheeng baphey, kabayeekaan diin di bantom. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simoon, ayeek’diaan diin di Petelo, i mwayinaan Andeel, Shaak i Yoon, Filipooy i Batolomay, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Mataay i Tomaas, i Shaak, mwân abol Alafaay, i Simoon (ambaak baan abok mbel ane, muna yiintsh), <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />i Yuud mwayinaan abol Shaak, i Yudaas Isakaliot, akun ambaak alièm’l Yish.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esalwoong’s kamotsh ambo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mataay 4.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Itaang ibaak Yish akum to nkwootsh i bieentsh baan, kayem’taan adik di indwoon. Twoong minen a bieentsh baan imbaak andaan, i bât babwiik bambaak banyiy to yaas i Yudey, i Yelushaleem, i bât ba to mwiidj mu Tiil i Sidoon; <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />bambaak banyiy ikaam iwok dweey diaan, kamotsh ikaam ibo maal mabaan. Bât bambaak i mieen mibey bamanwook busek. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Bât bakim bambaak besaswoot mbok amwaam’l, ikaam i mbè bunoon’l bumbaak busato to latok laan, bumbaak bumaans maal ma bât bakim.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nshaas i buphol</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mataay 5.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yish kalieenaan bieentsh baan, kabalwoosaan ane:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Nshaas mwaaliin, bwiin ben a nsak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">ikaam i mbè bunyim bu Ntshièm i bwiin!<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Nshaas mwaaliin bwiin bedi ntshal iphontshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">ikaam i mbè bwiin bubikabiim!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Nshaas mwaaliin bwiin busalel iphontshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">ikaam i mbè bwiin busèkasèy!<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.22. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 4:14">1 Pet 4.14</ref>.</char>
    </note>Nshaas mwaaliin mbè bât babubim’l, mbè babubieeng, mbè babutwoon mishiing, mbè babubaang’s, batak asès’l diin diaa muna nshiing ikaam bwayim’s Mwân a Mwoot! <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.23. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2 Kul 36.16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Bik 7.52</ref>.</char></note>Aalanyeeny i nshaas itaang ilakeph’t mwooy makun kamotsh tophanyeeny i nshaas, ikaam ikaph inen is’bukwoong a dik. Mbokambaak bamaam ibaan besaphetsh bangaang ba Ntshièm ngwoon kamotsh.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Ek buphol bwaaliin, bwiin badiy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">ikaam i mbè bwiin bumaman amon nshaas mwiin!<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Buphol bwaaliin, bwiin bumbim iphontshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">ikaam i mbè bul’kaal’i ntshal! Buphol bwaaliin bwiin busasèy iphontshi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Ikaam’i mbè bul’kaal i buphol;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">kamotsh bulekalel!<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Buphol bwaaliin a mbok es’baan atwoot busek bwiin abol bât bakim, ikaam mbokabaak bamaam ibaan besakel i bangaang babey.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imuk ikaam i bashaang’dj</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mataay 5.38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7.12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />Ek ndes’kabulwoos bwiin busampwoom’k ane: “Mukanyeeny bashaang’dj biin, kesanyeeny baphis biin busek, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />shak’sanyeeny ba bes’bubok mbaan, ba bes’buphetsh, balwoom’sayeeny Nthièm. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Mbè mwoot akwook lakas a itam imotsh, mweek itam yeek’dj kamotsh; mbè mwoot ataam’l ndel mwaa, nieem’dj atol kamotsh nguumiaa. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Mwoot nkim esalwoom iket, mweek, mbè mwoot atol iketiaa, kunwoom’k iyin kamotsh mbi. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.31. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:12">Mt 7.12</ref>.</char></note>Kesanyeeny bât busek mbok es’bwiin amuk mbè ba bukes ibwiin busek.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Mbè bwaal busamuk ba bes bumuk, bulakwoong’l mbè ba bukes busek mbony? Aal’k bakedj a mwooy mabey besamuk ba bes’bamuk! <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Mbè bwaal busakel busek a ba bes’bukes busek, bulakwoong’l mbè ba bukes busek mbonye? Aal’k bakedj a mwooy mabey besakel ngwoon bwiik! <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Mbè bwaal mbè busasweem biket abol bât bes’bwiin akwoong’l ane babukas, bulakwoong’l mbè babukes busek mbony? Aal’k bakedj a mwooy mabey besakel mbok mintshiin! <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Ek bwiin, mukanyeeny baphis biin, bakesanyeeny busek, basweem’sanyeeny bukal. Bumokamon ikaph inen kamotsh bul’kaal bân ba Ntshièm a dik, ikaam Ntshièm mwoot ansek a bol ben mitem ngon akol ben isoph. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Aalanyeeny i mweeng mbok mintshiin e Taatiin a dik i mweeng.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuluum’sk mwoot</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mataay 7.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Kabuluum’sk mwoot ikaam Ntshièm kabuluum’s ibwiin mbi. Kabuphul’k mwoot ibwaak mbi, ikaam Ntshièm kabuphul’k ibwiin ibwaak mbi; wok’sanyeeny ibiek’dj mweeng i Ntshièm abuwok’buwok’s mweeng. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Ley anyeeny i Ntshièm abuyek’buyeek. Babokabok lieedj lasek a ngat a saphiin, lwasak, lwayool saph a saph. Ikaam’i mbè lieedj lantshiin les’bwiin aphiks ibieek’dj, bel’kabuphik’s iluun.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.39. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:14">Mt 15.14</ref>.</char>
    </note>Yish kababok’saan kamotsh bieentsh baan nkwoon muku, es’balwoom ane: “Mwoot anow miish akwook’dj alak mwoot anow miish ngo aan mboke? Mbi! Mbè bukal, bel’kabwaak a mbieem mpween mubaan. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.40. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24-25">Mt 10.24-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Yn 13.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15.20</ref>.</char></note> Mweentsh kalek’dj ntaang’dj mwaan mbi; ek mweentsh aku nkim edi buyeeph el’kaal muna ntaang’dj mwaan.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Usalieen itieet il a diish di mwân a nyo, kusalieen ntey munen mul’a diish diaa idik di yey? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Bwaany key busween awuul mwanyo ane: ‘Mwân a mey, ya natey itieet a diish diaa,’ kusalieen ntey munen mul a diish diawe? Mun a mas maphey, manatey ntey munen mul a diish diaa, ntshiin uneph amon bwaany butey itieet yil a diish di mwanyo.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntey i ndwoom i muun</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mataay 7.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12.33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Ntey musek kamuntwook ndwoom ibey mbi, kamotsh ntey mubey kamuntwook ndwoom isek mbi. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Ntey muku mukim bamak muyeeph ka ndwoom i muun; bât kabakwook’dj aphaph’l ndwoom a nfiink a ntey mu kieeng mbi kamotsh kabakwook’dj akun ndwoom i nviny a misweey mbi. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.45. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mt 12.34</ref>.</char></note>Mwoot ansek antieek biket bisek akat kweem misek to ntem mwaan; i mun isoph antieek biket bibey to ntem mwaan mubey. Ikaam bwiik bu mwooy mel a ntem ma mesatow a muny.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpik a mbûl a mwaany baan’i mpik a mbûl a yeeny</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mataay 7.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Ikaam’i yey busambok mbel ane: ‘Kum, Kum,’ ek kabusakel mbok es’miim bulwoos mbi? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Ndel’kabulak iphwa i mwoot esaphwaany i wey eliy a miim, mwoot akun esawoom’k mwooy mieem kamotsh amamatshik a ikelel. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Emuna mwoot ampik mbûl; antshim ngiin a shin, aneph atetsh mabieen i mbôk. Amwiy ngus munoon’l, kabodj muun a mabieen ma mbûl, ek kamuyeedj mbok miphuk’l mbi, ikaam imbaak yaphik busek. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Ek mwoot aku nkim esawok mwooy mieem, kes’matshik a ikelel e muna mwoot ampik mbûl a ibuutsh yaaph mbôk a ngiin ayin. Amwiy ngus munoon’l, kabodj muun a mbûl kaphukiin bwaas!” Mbwoong’dj ayiin imbaak minen!”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yish esabo nso abol kum mayol ato Loom</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mataay 8.5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />A mbis a mbè Yish aman mbokalwoos twoong a bât imbakamwom’k, Yish kieenaan bos a Kapenum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Andwoon, ambabaak kum yeek’dj a mayol, ambaak i muna ngunaan ambakaan amuk bwiik; muna ngun ambaak i bwaal bunoon’l bu iwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Awok’dj kum mayol besatwoot dweey di Yish, kantom’saan bakom’l bakieek ba to Yuud ikaam imwoong mbokabo muna ngunaan. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Antwool baan akol a Yish kamwoong baan a ngon ane: “Tes’kalwoom mbè ungaas. Mbok mintshiin esaan alwoom. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Ikaam’i mbè esamuk bol bwiit, ntshaan amataphik’s mbûliit a Ntshièm.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Ngwoon Yish kieenaan i baan. Antwoolaan akolakol, kum mayol katomaan bambey baan ikaam inwoos ane: “Kum, kuwaak i nyeen mbi. Kandesayeem’l ikaam i mbè uyiing’l a mbûlieem mbi, <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />ntshiin akun ambel miim mbokiy a bol bwaa. Ek twoot dweey dimotsh ikaam i mbè muna ngunieem awok busek. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Minamieet ndesatuk mikieetsh mi bakum bieem kamotsh ndedi mayol mel a shin mikieetsh mieem. Mbè nalwoos imotsh ane: ‘Yaak!’ El’kieen; mbè nalwoos iyiek’dj ane: ‘Ya!’ El’kiy, kamotsh mbè nalwoos mun’a ngunieem ane: ‘Kel ngo!’ Es’kakel.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yish awok’diaan mwooy maku, kakam’laan bwiik idik di kum mayol. Kakaph’diaan bos a twoong’a bât ambakienaph ane: “Ndes’bulwoos anu kanatshikamon yim’s imbot aku mbi, aal’k akat Isaleel mbi!”<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />A mbis akun, bantom kakal baan a mbûl abol kum mayol, katobaan ataan mun’a ngun busek.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esabuum’l mwân a nuung abol ngaat a ngweel to iwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Aphieen akun, Yish kieenaan bos a bol bu Nayin; bieentsh baan i twoong a bât bambabaakiaan. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />A itaang insem’s baan akol ikwiik i mabieen ma bol buku, ambabaak bât besilaatsh ndju ikaam imuley, ambaak mwân a nuung motsh abol ngaat a ngweel. Ntshey a bât babwiik ba bol buku bambabaakiaan. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Amamon Kum, mweeng mumangaat kalwoosaan ngaat a ngweel ane: “Kulel’k mbi.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />A mbis akun kasem’saan, kawam’laan ital; bât bambaakienaatsh kayem’t baan. Yish katwootaan ane: “Ilanuung, ndes’kalwoos mbè, wuum a shin!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Ilanuung kawuumiin, katetshiin mbok atwoot itaang intshiin. Yish kamwekaan inanaan.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Bakim kawook baan butet; kasem’l baan Ntshièm bietwootsh ane: “Ngaang a Ntshièm anen asol aphingiit; kamotsh Ntshièm anyiyaas bât baan!”<verse eid="LUK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Yudey mikim akol mangaan ma kolakol kawok baan nswoos mu Yish.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bantom ba Yoon Mubatiis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mataay 11.2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Bieentsh babol Yoon kabos baan ntang’dj mubaan ntshik mukun mukim. Yoon kabokaan bieentsh baphey mbel <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />kabatomaan abol Kum ikaam imuul mbè ane: “Ntshween weliy mbè key telakwoong mwoot yeek’dj?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Antwool baan akol a Yish, kanwoos baan ane: “Yoon Mubatiis amakatatom ikaam iwuul mbè ane, ntshween weliy mbè key telakwoong mwoot yeek’dj.” <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Itaang ikun intshiin, Yish kabowaan bât babwiik bambaak i maal, akol bitwiim, kabateyaan mieen mibey, bambaak i miish mawa kamon baan. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.22. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5-6">Yesh 35.5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61.1</ref>.</char></note>Ngwoon, kakal’laan bantom ba Yoon ane: “Yaak anyeeny bwelwoos Yoon bimon bwiin akol bi bimwook bwiin ane: bât baaph i miish bamon, bitwiim biayem’t, ben badj banwook busek, babieel bashaam’dj, bât baaph i mato besawok, midju miabuum to iwa, ben a ntaan bawok lashaang lasek. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Nshaas mwaal abol mwoot akun mbè kensambok miaang mbi!”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Amween bantom babol Yoon, Yish katetshaan mbok alwoos twoong a bât dweey di Yoon ane: “Bumwem bos imbet yaaph bât ikaamiemon yey? Ikaam ilieen ntet’l mus’baan anyiing abol muung, mbè mbony? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Ek buniphiemon key? Mwoot adiing mindel miseke? Ek bakun besadiing mindel mi ngaang besatwoos ka mambet masek bantwoos’k kamotsh a ngat a mambûl ma bakum! <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Ek buniphiemon key? Ngaang a Ntshièm mbè? Ikakaam, ndes’bulwoos mbè ane, aan wey alek ngaang a Ntshièm. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.27. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref>.</char></note> Ikaam’i mbè idik di Yoon aphuun’dj baan ane: ‘Ndekatom antom i mikieetsh a bos bwaa, ikaam ilodj mbok.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Ndes’bulwoos mbè ane: “Andieeng a bât babotsh’dj baan abol baat, kabatshik abot mwoot anen ngo Yoon mbi; ek mwân ankieek a bunyim bu Ntshièm wey alek Yoon bunen.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:32">Mt 21.32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:12">Lk 3.12</ref>.</char>
    </note>Bât bakim bambaak besawoom’k Yish, aal’k bakweek minaam awok’dj baan mwooy makun, kayim’s baan ane Ntshièm wey akwook, kabataam’s baan abol Yoon. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Ek baphal’s i bayeeph mikieetsh kabel baan imuk i Ntshièm kamotsh kabel baan ikaam iditaam’s abol Yoon.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yish katwootaan kamotsh ane: “Ndes’buwuul mbè ane, bât ba nkil muku besaphwaans i nyeeny? Bemun banyeeny? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Bemuna bân bakieek bashik a imbwoom, besabok bakidj ba baan bietwootsh ane: ‘Tabubiees ngom i nshaas, ek kabusamin mbi. Tabuyeem’s ntshieem i mashièy kabusalel mbi!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />A ntwootsh’dj misek, Yoon Mubatiis amwiyaan, kambaak adia diaamp, kambaakony maan, kanwool bwiin ane: ‘Edi mween mubey!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Mwân a Mwoot amwiyaan, kadiawaan kamotsh kanyowaan, kanwool bwiin ane: ‘Lienanyeeny mwoot aku idièy inen, inywey inen, nkidj bakweek minaam baan’i bakedj a mwooy mabey!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Ek bakim bamwim’s bwaany bu Ntshièm besayieeph ane bu bukwokwook.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish abol Simoon Muphal’s.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Lasu liek’dj muphal’s kabokaan Yish mbel ikaam idiayaan. Ngwoon, Yish kieenaan a mbûl abol muphal’s, kashim’kaan a meens ikaam idia. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.37. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:7">Mt 26.7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3">Mak 14.3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:3">Yn 12.3</ref>.</char></note>A bol bukun, ambabaak ngaat nkedj a mwooy mabey anen. Amwookaan ane Yish esadia a mbûl abol muphal’s, kiyaan i nwoon muyool tô i mananaansh ma ngaang a ngat <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />kayem’taan ambis a Yish, a mateem maan. Ambaak esalel yenyok’s mateem ma Yish i bios’dj biaan; ambis akun abinum’l i phu yaan, anyut mateem ma Yish, amankol mananaansh. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Mufal’s ambaak abok Yish mbel amonaan ngwoon, katwotaan a ntemwaan ane: “Tshik mbè mwoot aku aal ngaang a Ntshièm akwokwook, anaph’kayeeph mbè ane ngaat key aku esampwaam’l, ankasayeeph kamotsh ane ngaat aku amampwaam’l, wey ambey!”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yish kalwoosaan Simoon ane: “Simoon ndedi dweey dilwoos.” Simoon kankal’laan ane.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">“Ntaang’dj ndwoos i diin.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yish katwootaan ane: “Mwen bungangaang ambaak i ben a mbatiaan baphey; motsh anaph’dj kamweek phas kam itaan imbaak i ngaang abwiik, iyek’dj phalaang masataan. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Mbok aku mbè mpween mubaan kabambaak i phas imweek mbi; ngwoon, kabawok’saan mweeng. Mwoot key a mpween mubaan elabomuk bwiik?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simoon kakal’laan ane: “Ndesabok lakeny mbè ane, wey akun edi mbat abwiik.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Yish kanwoosaan ane: “Wasuw.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />A mbis akun kakaph’diaan bos a ngaat, kalwoosaan Simoon ane: “Wamon ngaat akuwe? Namaying’l abol bwaa, kumpieek’dj maas mawool’l mateem mieem mbi. Ek aan, amampwees mateem i bios’dj biaan kamotsh abinum’l i phu yaan. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Ween kuntshieedj muna nkidiaa mbi, ek aan to taan amwing’l miim ayè, kesalèy mbokanyuut mateemieem mbi. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Ween kunkoodj sedj a ntshwey mweem mbi, ek aan amankol mananaansh a mateemieem. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Ntshiin es’miim alwoos mbè ane, bweph bwaan bukim ndabudim’s, ikaam i mbè alak imuk ibwiik. Ek mwoot akun es’baan awok’s mweeng mukieek esalak imuk ikieek.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Yish kalwoosaan ngaat ane: “Bweph bwaa bwashil.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Bât bambaakiaan a meens katetsh baan mbokatwoot banamieet ane: “Mwoot key aku esadim’s bweph?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Ek Yish kalwoosaan ngaat ane. “Yim’shaa yaphaans, yaak i nkit’l.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Baat bambaak kienieentsh i Yish</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />A mbis akun, Yish kieenaan a mangaan baan’i mal ikaam ishaang’l nswoos musek mu bunyim bu Ntshièm. Bieentsh baan ishieeng baphey bambaak besienieentshaan, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.2. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:55-56">Mt 27.55-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:40-41">Mak 15.40-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:49">Lk 23.49</ref>.</char></note>ngwoon baat bieek’dj bambaak baphaan a mieen mibey, kamotsh bambaak bawok busek: Maliy (ambaak baan abok mbel ane Maliy ma Magadala) akun atwoodj mieen mibey shaam’l; <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />yek’dj ambaak Yoaan mwam’s a Tshusa, ambaak esabak biket bibol kum Helood; Susaan akol ibiek’dj bamotsh babwiik. Baat bakun bambaak besakel ngun ikaam iyaas Yish akol bieentsh i biket bibaan.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkwoon mu nshaang’l a shaang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mataay 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maak 4.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Bât bambaakiy abol Yish to mal makim. Twoong minen a bât kakwoom’kiin akolaan, Yish kabokaan nkwoon muku:<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Mbieetsh mangwoon kieenaan ikaam ishaang’l shaang. Esaan ashaang’l, shaang ikieek kabwaakiin a ndieeng a mbok: kayinyak baan mateem i phul kayitwoot’liin. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Shaang iyiek’dj kabwaakiin a shin a mbôk: ameniin, kalieeng’liin ikaam i mbè shin kayimbaak busek mbi. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Shaang iyiek’dj kabwaakiin adik di kieeng, kameniin itaang intshiin i minaam, kakoph’tiin minaam mikun. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Ek shaang iyiek’dj kabwakiin a shin misek; kameniin kamotsh katoyiin ndwoom: naam mukun mumbaak munto ndwoom phweet kam.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Amanaan atwoot ngwoon, Yish katwootaan angon ane. “Tak mwoot edi mato ikaam iwuok, awok!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esabobok mikwoon ikaam i yey</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mataay 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maak 4.10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Bieentsh kamuul baan Yish ikaam iyeeph mbokesatwoot nkwoon mukun, <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.10. </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Yesh 6.9-10 (LXX).</char></note>Yish kabakal’laan ane: “Bamaabulwoos mbok ayeeph mwooy ma bunyim bu Ntshièm mashwuèy; ek abol bât biek’dj kabia ngwoon mbi. Bikun bes’balwoos ibiin a mikwoon, ikaam i mbè bedi miish kabesamon mbi, bedi mato kabeswook mbi.<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esalak nkwoon mu nshaang’l a shaang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mataay 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maak 4.13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Wokanyeeny mbokesatwoot nkwoon muku: shaang, isalak dweey di Ntshièm. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Shaang ibwaak’dj a ndieeng a mbok; bât baswok dweey di Ntshièm, ek diabol amwiy ikaam itey dweey di Ntshièm a mitem mibaan antshik lakadj’k ikaam i mbè kabayim’sk kamotsh kabamon’k mwoony mu yoyoo mbi. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Shaan ibwaak’dj a shin a mbôk, bât besaal mbè bawok dweey di Ntshièm bamadinyey i nshaas; ek dweey di Ntshièm kadisaphik miidj a mitem mibaan mbi, bamwim’s itaang ikieek, ambis akun bamwa yim’s phiim a itaang i maphetsh. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Shaang isabwaak a dik di kieeng isalak bât besawok, ek besashaam’s itaang a mwooy mabwiik ma shin a maan, a budiy bu shin itaang, ek kayisato ndwoom isek mbi. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Shaang isabwaak a shin misek, isalak bât besawok dweey di Ntshièm i ntem musek, bamadisuk, banto ndwoom a yiintsh ibaan.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkwoon mi mbwoon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Maak 4.21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.16. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mt 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Lk 11.33</ref>.</char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj" closed="false">Mwoot mbè motsh kakwok’dj atieem’s mbwoon ikaam imukwiik a shin a nsheet aal’k a shin ilak mbi. Ek, bamwaak bamutshik a dik di meens, ikaam i mbè bât besaying’l bamon baph’l.</char>
    <verse eid="LUK 8:16" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.17. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mt 10.26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Lk 12.2</ref>.</char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj" closed="false">“Mwooy makim ma busweem matokatow a baph’l, i mwooy makim ma nkaan matokatow a baph’l kamotsh melaal ka ndieeng a mwaany.</char>
    <verse eid="LUK 8:17" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.18. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:29">Mt 25.29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Lk 19.26</ref>.</char>
    </note>
    <char style="wj" closed="false">“Ngwoon bwaalanyeeny i bwaany a mpwok’liin! Ikaam’i mbè mwoot edi iket, bekamweek kamotsh iyiek’dj; ek mwoot aaph iket, batakantaam’l aal’k bukieek bulaan ibuun.”</char>
    <verse eid="LUK 8:18" />
  </para>
  <para style="s1">Inaan akol babinaan ba Yish</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mataay 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maak 3.31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Inaan akol babinaan ba Yish kiy baan bosaan, ek kabamon mbok atwool akolaan mbi ikaam i ntshey a bât. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Mwoot kalwoosaan Yish ane: “Nyo akol bananyo bayeem a buseph, bedi nyiing amon.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Ek Yish kankal’laan ane: “Meey akol banameey, ba besawook dweey di Ntshièm bamaditshik a ikelel.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish aayeem muung munoon’l</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mataay 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maak 4.35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Lasu liek’dj, Yish kabanaan a bwaat akol bieentsh baan es’balwoos ane. “Tasaphanyeeny a yaas iku imotsh i idiph.” Kasaph baan. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Ambaak baan eyeentsh, Yish ambaak abetsh ntweeng. Itaang intshiin, muung munoon’l i maphaak bimatetsh anyiing idiph, maas mamatetsh aying’l a bwaat, bambaak a maphetsh ma iwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Bieentsh kasem’s baan akol Yish besamuum’l i minwool ane: “Ntaang’dj, Ntaang’dj tel’kawa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yish amuumaan, kaphaang’saan muung akol maphaak ma maas; kataam’t biin. Kashaal biin phol. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Yish kawuulaan bieentsh ane: “Yim’shiin ikwey?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">A butet i baan i makam’l, kadiwuus baan banamieet ane: “Aku mwoot key? Antom’s muung i maas dweey bimamwoom’k!”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esabo mwoot ambaak i mieen mibey</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mataay 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maak 5.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yish i bieentsh baan antwool baan i bwaat bu baan a shin a Gelaseen a yaas i idiph, bialieens i Ngaleel. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Yish ankumaan to bwaat, nuung a to bol buku kiyaan a bos bwaan, ambaak i mieen mibey mibwiik. To kaany kambaak adiing mindel mbi kamotsh kambaak abet a mbûl mbi, ek ambaak ambet aphiing a biaan bi midju. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Amonaan Yish, kabokaan nwool, kabwakaan a bos bu mateemaan, katwootaan i dweey dinoon’l ane: “Usanswoos dweey key, Yish Mwân a Kum a dik? Ndawoong kuntshaak i nyeen mbi!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Yish katom’saan mween mubey dweey ikaam i mbè mutow a latok la mwoot aku, mween muku mumampetsh phweet ibwiik. Bambaak bamankaan mio i mikol ikaam insuk, ek ambaak ambat’l misuk miaan i mween mubey mumanaat a mandiy maaph bât.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yish kamuwuulaan ane: “Diin dia unyeeny?” Nkakal’l muun ane.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">“Diin dieem nde ‘Twoong.’” Ikaam’i mbè, mieen mibwiik mimbaak miayiing’l a mwoot aku to kaany. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />I mieen mibey miku kawoong miin Yish ikaam i mbè kamitom’k a mbieem mitadj yaaph i mom.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Andaan ibambaak twoong a ngul isaswoot bi bidia a nkwootsh. Mieen mibey kawoong miin Yish ikaam bamitom a ngul. Yish kamitomaan. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Itaang intow mieen mibey to mwoot aku, kayiing’l miin a ngul. Ngul ikim kawooph’diin mbaang to dik di nkwootsh shaang a ndieeng a maas kaleph’tiin.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Bât bambaak besabak ngul amwoony baan dweey diku, katshiin baan mbaang, kieen baan i nswoos bos a bol baan’i mal miek’dj ma nkol mukun. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Bât kieen baan ikaam imon mwooy mankeph’t. Antwool baan akol a Iish, kato baan ataan mwoot akun atieedj baan mieen mibey, ashik a mateem ma Yish pholoo, adiing mindel, kamotsh ambaak i lakeny lasek. Bât bakim kawok baan butet. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Bât bamwoony mwooy maku makim, kabol baan ntshik mbok atwoodj mween mubey to mwoot i mbok awok’diaan busek. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Ntshiin bât bakim ba bol bu Gelaseen bamwoony mwooy makun, kalwoom baan Yish ikaam i mbè atow a bol bubaan, ikaam i mbè bambaak i butet bubwiik. Ngwoon, Yish kabanaan a bwaat kieenaan. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Mwoot akun atieedj baan mieen mibey kawoongaan Yish ane: “Namuk mbè tieniaa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:38">Ek Yish kabelaan esanwoos ane: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Kal a bol bwaa, welwoos bât bakim mbok amakes Ntshièm.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Mwoot kieenaan ikaam yelwoos bât ba bol bukim mbok ankes’dj Yish.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwân a ngaat abol Yayilo akol ngaat awaam’dj Yish a ndel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mataay 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maak 5.21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Itaang inkal Yish bos a yaas iyiek’dj i idiph, twoong a bât kanyeyiin i nshaas, ikaam bât bakim bambaak besankwoong’l. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Mwoot iyiek’dj diin diaan Yayilo katwoolaan. Ambaak motsh a bakum ba mbûl a Ntshièm. Kabwakaan a mateem ma Yish kamwoongaan ikaam i mbè yeen a mbûlaan, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />ikaam mbè ambaak i mwân a ngaat amotsh, ambaak i mitshi akolakol i ishieeng miphey, ambaak akolakol iwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Itaang imbaak Yish yesheem bos a bol bu Yayilo, twoong a bât kayoliin biaas bikim. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Imbabaak ngaat yeek’dj i bwaal bu makel to mitshi ishieeng miphey. Ambaak akaph bikim bimbaakaan i biin abol ba ngangabuk, ek mwoot mbè motsh kayeedj mbokamaans bwaal bukun mbi. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Kasem’saan akol a Yish ambisaan, kamwaam’laan a mindel miaan. Itaang intshiin makel kabat maan. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yish kawuulaan ane. “Nyeeny amampwaam’l?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Bakim katon baan, ek Petelo kanwoosaan ane: “Ntaang’dj, twoong a bât kayiy yayool i mbis i bos bwaa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Ek Yish katwootaan ane: “Mwoot amampwaaml, ikaam i mbè ndawok ngon yatow to miim.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Ngaat akun amonaan mbè ane bansol’l. Kiyaan i butet bukim, kabwakaan a mateem ma Yish. Esanwoos a bos bu bât bakim, mbok ambaakaan amwaam’l kamotsh mbok amwokaan busek imbet intshiin. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yish kankal’laan ane: “Mwânieem a ngaat; yim’shaa yaphaans. Yaak i nkit’l.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Mbok aku mbè Yish ambaak esatwoot kamotsh, ntom motsh a ben a mbûl a shinangoong kiyaan to bol kum Yayilo, kalwoosaan mwoot aku ane: “Mwânaa amawa,” “lieem’l akas adiaak Ntaang’dj i nyeen.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Ek Yish kamwookaan, kalwoosaan Yayilo ane: “Kwaal’k i butet mbi, yim’s bukal, mwânaa aphakaphaan.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Itaang intwool Yish a mbûl a Yayilo, kalwoong ikaam iying’l i mwoot mbè motsh mbi, atey Petelo, Yoon, Shaak akol ishaan a mwân i inanaan babol mwân a ngaat. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Bakim bambaak besalel kamotsh bamwaaph idik di mwân. Yish kabalwoosaan ane: “Kabulel’k mbi. Mwân kaweedj mbi, abetsh ntweeng!”<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Ek bât kansèy baan, ikaam bambaak besayeeph ane mwân amawa. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Ek Yish kayaataan mwân a lo, katwootaan i dweey dinoon’l ane: “Ilieeng a ngaat, wuum a shin!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />I lakeny kiy luun ikadj, mwân kawuumaan itaang intshiin a shin. Yish kabalwosaan ikaam bamweek bishim. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Babotsh baan kakam’l baan, ek Yish kabakinyaan ane kabulwoos’k mwoot mbè motsh mwooy mankeph’t mbi.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yish atom bieentsh ishieeng baphey</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mataay 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maak 6.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yish kakwekaan bieentsh isheeng baphey, kabayekaan bonon’l akol bukum bu bieeng mieen mikim mibey kamotsh ikaam ibow maal. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Kabatomaan ikaam ishaang’l lashaang lasek la bunyim bu Ntshièm kamotsh bambo maal, <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Lk 10.4-11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:51">Bik 13.51</ref>.</char></note>kabalwoosaan ane: “Kabutol’k iket mbè imotsh ikaam i lieen mbi: aal’k mbè phaang, mbè saph, mbè diaamp, mbè phalaang mbi, kabwaal’k i nguum iphey mbi. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Imbet ikim yil’baan abunyey, twoosanyeeny a mbûl akun mintshiin suk el’bwiin atow a imbet ikun; <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />imbet ikim yil’baan abel mbok bunyey, butow anyeeny a bol bukun, bukumanyeeny muus mu mateem miin, elaal muna ying’t ikaam i maphetsh mabaan.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Bieentsh kieen baan a mal makim, bieshaang’l nswoos musek kamotsh biebow bambaak i maal a imbet ikim imbaak baan yesheem.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lakeny Helood lalèl</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mataay 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maak 6.14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.7. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mt 16.14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mak 8.28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Lk 9.19</ref>.</char>
    </note>Nguph’lanoph Helood a nuung mu Ngaleel amwookaan nswoos mukun, lakeny kanèl luun, ikaam i mbè ibiek’dj bambaak besatwoot ane Yoon Mubatiis amabuum to iwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Ibiek’dj bambaak besatwoot ane Eliy ntshaan ansol, ibiek’dj kamotsh ane motsh aphiing bangaang ba kaany amabuum to iwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Ek Helood katwootaan ane: “Miim namaabat’l Yoon ntshwey. Iphontshi, nyeeny esakel mwooy makus mes’miim awok?” Katetshaan aswoot mbokamon Yish.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish adiees bât sen’l itaan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mataay 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maak 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoon 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Bantom ishieeng baphey amwiy baan ikadj, katetsh baan abos Yish ntshik mu mwooy makim mambaak baan bakel. Yish kabalaataan a yik’l akolakol i nuung mu Betsayid. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Twoong a bât amwokiin, kanaph baan. Yish kabanyeyaan, kabalwosaan dweey di Bunyim bu Ntshièm, kamotsh kabowaan ba bambaak i nyiing ibow.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />A mataang ma ikwok’l, bieentsh ishieeng baphey kasem’s baan akol a Yish besanwoos ane: “Tom bât baku bakim, ikaam bieen a mangaan i mandiy mel akolakol ikaam iswoot imbet itwoos akol bi bidia, ikaam tel a imbet yaaph bât.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Ek Yish kabalwoosaan ane: “Bayeekanyeeny bwinamieet biket bidia!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Kankal’l baan ane: “Tedi i maamp mataan akol swey iphey bukal. Walwoong mbè ane tieswoom bi bidia ikaam i bât bakime?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />(Imbabaak andaan, baluung phot sen’l itaan.)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yish kalwoosaan bieentsh baan ane: “Bashikanyeeny a makweek ma bât masataan masataan.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Bieentsh baan kakel baan ngwoon, i bât kashim’k baan, <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yish katolaan maamp makun mataan akol swey iphey kasheen’laan miish a dik, kakasaan lakeeng abol Ntshièm. Ngwoon, kabishik’laan biteny, kayeekaan bieentsh baan ikaam ikaph’s twoong a bât. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Mwoot nkim kadiawaan phot a ntshaliaan. Bieentsh kakweek’baan bishaas bi maamp a makwoom ishieeng maphey bimbaak biashaal.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo ayeeph ane Yish ntshaan Kilist.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mataay 16.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Maak 8.27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Lasu liek’dj, Yish ambaak esalwoom Ntshièm anamieet a isek i bieentsh baan. Kabawuulaan ane: “Bât besatwoot mbony idik dieem?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.19. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:1-2">Mt 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-15">Mak 6.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-8">Lk 9.7-8</ref>.</char>
    </note>Kankal’l baan ane: “Ibiek’dj besatwoot ane: “U Yoon Mubatiis”, ba bamotsh ane: “U Eliy, babamotsh kamotsh ane u motsh a ndieeng bangaang ba kaany ambuum.” <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.20. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:68-69">Yn 6.68-69</ref>.</char></note> Yish kabawuulaan ane: “I bwiin akey busatwoot ane nde nyeeny?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Petelo kankal’laan ane: “Ween u Kilist abol Nsthièm.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esatwoot idik di maphetsh maan akol iwayaan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mataay 16.20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30">Maak 8.30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9.1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yish kabakinyaan bieentsh baan angon ane, kabulwoos’k mwoot mbi. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />A mbis akun, katwootaan kamotsh ane: “Mwân a Mwoot amokamon bimweeny bibwiik, bakom’l, batwootsh banen akol bayeeph mikieetsh bambekambel; bandiakandiaak, ek lasu lanseet abukabuum to iwa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.23. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mt 10.38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Lk 14.27</ref>.</char>
    </note>A mbis akun kalwoosaan bât bakim ane: “Tak mwoot edi nyiing andaph, adiwaphiim anamieet, asheetsh ntey mu kek lasu laku lakim indeph. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.24. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mt 10.39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Lk 17.33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yn 12.25</ref>.</char></note> Ikaam i mbè, mwoot aku nkim esamuk aphaans mwoony mwaan el’ka mudim’s, ek mwoot akun esamuk adim’s mwoony mwaan idik dieem, el’kamuphaans. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Bilayaas mwoot ka yey mbè ayeem’l anamieet a nkwootsh muku, ek aneph adim’s mwoony mu yoyoo, bil angaas ka yey? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Mbè mwoot ampwook busony i mwooy mieem, Mwân a Mwoot amwokamwook busony, itaang ilanyiy a buum bwaan, akol buum bu Ishanaan aal’k bu bantshol ba ikin. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Ikakaam ndes’bulwoos, bakieek bel aphiingiin ayè, kabelawa a bos bu mbè kabamwoony bunyim bu Ntshièm mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mikaph’dj mi Yish</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mataay 17.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Maak 9.2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.28. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 1:17-18">2 Pet 1.17-18</ref>.</char>
    </note>A mbis matu inaan mbè Yish aman atwoot ngwoon, katolaan Petelo, Yoon akol Shaak, kieenaan ibaan a nkwootsh ikaam ilwoom Ntshièm. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Itaang isaanalwoom Ntshièm, bos bwaan kakaph’dj buun, i mindel miaan kangaamiin yeem misababadj. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Itaang intshiin, bât baphey katetsh baan atwoot i Yish andaan. Bât baku ambaak Moos akol Eliy, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Bambaak basol a buum. Katetsh baan atwoot i Yish ikaam i lieen akol mwooy manaph’dj ankeph’s a Yelushalem, ikaam iyeedj mwooy maphuun’dj baan idik diaan. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Petelo akol bambèy baan kabet baan ntweeng munoon’l; ek amuum baan, kamon baan buum bu Yish akol bât baphey bambaakiaan. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Itaang imbaak bât baku banam’s i Yish, Petelo kalwosaan Yish ane: “Ntang’dj, bibusek mbè taal ayè! Taphik mituum miset; motsh imwaa, motsh mubol Moos, imweek’dj mubol Eliy.” (Ek Petelo kambaak esayeeph bimbaakaan atwoot mbi.)<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Itaang ibaakaan atwoot ngwoon, isheem kasoliin, kabadiphiin. Bieentsh kawok baan butet amwoony baan mbok ambaak isheem ikun yabadiph. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.35. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1">Yesh 42.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mt 3.17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12.18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mak 1.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Lk 3.22</ref>.</char></note>Dweey katow diin a isheem ane: “Aku Mwânieem ansol miim. Mwoom’k anyeeny!”<verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Amwok baan dweey diku, kamon baan Yish anamieet. Bieentsh kashaal baan phol, a matu makun kabalwoos mwoot mbè motsh dweey dimwoony baan mbi.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esabo mwân ambaak i mween mubey</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mataay 17.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Maak 9.14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Lasu lakun lamotsh, Yish akol bieentsh baset kakum baan to nkwootsh. Twoong a bât kiyiin imoons i Yish. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Aphiing a bât andwoon mwoot kabolaan nwool ane, “Ntaang’dj, ndes’kawoong ikaam i mbè uyaas mwânieem a nuung ntshiin motsh! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Mween mubey kangaat muun, itaang intshiin kabolaan nwool, mumanyiing angon, antey laphul a muny; mumampetsh, kamusanieem’l bwaas mbi! <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Namalwoom bieentsh baa ikaam ibieeng mween muku, ek kabayeedj mbi. <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yish katwootaan ane: “Bwiin bu bât ba nkil muku mubey baaph i yim’s! Suk itaang key yil miin ashaaliin? Mataang mbadj key kamotsh mel miim atol budit’l bwiin? Yalaatsh mwânaa ayè.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Itaang insem’s mwân akol Yish, mween mumakas ambwees a shin kamotsh kanyiing muun angon. Ek Yish kaphaang’saan mween mubey, kabowaan mwân, kamwekaan ishanaan. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Bakim kakam’l baan bunoon’l bu Nthièm.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yish esalak kamotsh dweey di iwa yaan</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mataay 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maak 9.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Mbok aku mbè mwoot nkim ambakakam’l mwooy mambaak Yish akel, ek aan kalwoosaan bieentsh baan ane: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Bakanyeeny busek mwooy mes’miim bulwoos iphontshi ane: “Mwân a Mwoot bekanièm’l a mio mi bât.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Ek baan kambabaakawok mbok ambakaan balwoos mbi, dweey diku dimbaak diakaan a mpwok’l a baan, kamotsh bambaak i butet bumuul dweey dikun.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyeeny anek ibiek’dj a bunyim bu Ntshièm?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mataay 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maak 9.33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.46. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Lk 22.24</ref>.</char>
    </note>Bieentsh baan katetsh baan adiwuus banamieet ane, ikaam iyeeph ane nyeeny anek bakim aphiing a baan. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yish kayephaan lakeny labaan. Katolaan mwân, kantshikaan akolaan, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.48. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mt 10.40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Lk 10.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yn 13.20</ref>.</char></note>A mbis akun Yish kabalwosaan ane: “Mwoot elanyey mwân aku i imuk a diin dieem, amantshey miim, mwoot elantshey miim, anyey wey amantom. Ikaam’i mbè, mwa ilieeng aphiingiin bakim, ntshaan nuung anen.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwoot mbè kaaphiin i bushaang’dj, ek a yaashiin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Maak 9.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yoon kalwoosaan Yish ane: “Ntaang’dj tamamon mwoot esabieeng mieen mibey a diin diaa, tamanaph ankiny, ikaam i mbè kaaph a ikweekiit mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Ek Yish kankal’laan ane: “Kabunkiny’k mbi, ikaam i mbè mwoot mbè kaaphiin i bushaang’dj, ek a yaashiin.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bol bweek’dj bu Samaliy bwabel mbok anyey Yish</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Itaang anaph’dj abaan Yish a dik antwoliin akolakol. Kabokaan lakeny lieen bos a Yelushalem. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Katomaan ben mikieetsh a bos bwaan. Ben mikieetsh katieel baan, kayiing’l baan a bol bu motsh bu Samaliy ikaam inos indiy ibet. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Ek bena bol kabel baan mbok anyey ikaam ambaak esieyeentsh bos a Yelushalem. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.54. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:9-16">2 Bk 1.9-16</ref>.</char></note>Ek itaang inyeeph bieentsh baan ngwoos, Yoon i Shaak, kalwoos baan Yish ane: “Kum, wamuk mbè ane tatom dweey katey kakum to dik kabatuum nkim mubaane?”<verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Ek Yish kakaph’diaan bos a baan, kabaphaang’saan. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Iphontshi Yish i bieentsh kieen baan bos a bol bweek’dj.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntwoong’dj alaph Yish.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mataay 8.19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Ambaak baan a mbok, mwoot kiyaan ilwoos Yish ane: “Ndalakalaph imbet ikim ilwenieen.” <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yish kankal’laan ane: “Mingieeng midi mabweel mamiin, i phul i dik idi mayaantsh mayiin, ek Mwân a Mwoot kaaph i indiy itwoos mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Kalwoosaan mwoot yeek’dj ane: “Iya windeph.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Ek mwoot akun kankal’laan ane: “Kum, nkwoong namanieley taat.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yish kankal’laan ane: “Lieem’l midju midiley minamieet; ek ween yaak weshaang’l lashaang la bunyim bu Ntshièm.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.61. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 19:20">1 Bk 19.20</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mwoot yek’dj katwotaan ane: “Kum, nalakalaph, ek yim’s mbè ane ndieles’l i ilwootsheem.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yish kanwosaan ane: “Mwoot esatetsh abuun’l shin, ankas alieen kamotsh a mbis, kaaph i ngaang mbè mimotsh a Bunyim bu Ntshièm mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yish atom bieentsh masamasham’l i baphey</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />A mbis akun, Yish kasolaan batom masamasham’l i baphey. Kabatomaan baphey baphey a bos bwaan, a mangaan i mandiy makim manaph’diaan ayeen. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.2. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:37-38">Mt 9.37-38</ref>.</char></note>Kabalwosaan ane: “Ngwoon i bunen, ek ben a ngun be bukieek.” Ngwoon, lwoomanyeeny Kum a ngwoon ikaam atom ben a ngun babwiik. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.3. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:16">Mt 10.16</ref>.</char></note>Yaakanyeeny! Ndes’butom muna bân ba phaang andieeng mimbol mibwaaph. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.4. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Mt 10.7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mak 6.8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Lk 9.3-5</ref>.</char></note>Kabutol’k anyeeny phas idia a mbok mbi, mbè saph aal’k masabaat, kabuyeem’tek anyeeny a mbok ikaam iwuum’l mwoot mbi. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Phweet mikim el’bwiin aying’l a mbûl, twootanyeeny ane: ‘Nkit’l mwaal a mbûl aku.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Mbè a mbûl akun yaal mwoot a nkit’l, nkit’l mwiin mul kaaliaan; mbè bukal nkit’l mukal a bwiin. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.7. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1 Kol 9.14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Tim 5.18</ref>.</char></note>Bushaalanyeeny a mbûl akun, budianyeeny kamotsh bunyo anyeeny ikim yil’baan abuyeek, ikaam i mbè mun a ngun aku nkim amwa i ikaphiaan. Kabwen’kanyeeny mun mbûl mun mbûl ikaam i biket bidia mbi. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />El’bwiin aying’l a bol, mbè babunyey, dianyeeny ikim yil’baan buyeek, <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />bowanyeeny babieel bel a bol bukun, bubalwoos anyeeny ane: ‘Buum bu Ntshièm bwanyik akolakol.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.10. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Bik 13.51</ref>.</char></note>Ek el’bwiin aying’l a bol mbè kababunyeedj mbi, yaakanyeeny a tamioodj ta bol bukun bulwoos bakim ane: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Taakum muus mu bol bwiin mumatabak’t a mateem miit, kamotsh tabukas i muun ikaam i buyeeph’l. Ek buyeeph anyeeny mbè ane bunyim bu Ntshièm bwanyik akolakol!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Ndes’kabushak’s mbè ane, lasu lelashaam’l Ntshièm makaam ma bât, Sodom bel’kanum’s busek biasek’s i ben a bol bukun!<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mal mesabel mbok ayim’s Yish.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mataay 11.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.13. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Yesh 23.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Esk 26.1—28.26</ref>; <ref loc="JON 3:4-8">Yon 3.4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Am 1.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Sak 9.2-4</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Iteem ibey key ikaam i bwiin, ben a Kolasin, iteem ibey key bwiin ben a Betsayid! Ikaam’i mbè mwooy ma makam’l mambaak makeph’t abol bwaa tshik mbè mambaak makeph’t a Tiil akol Sidoon, bât ba baan banaphaal ka ishieey to kaany, banaph’diaal badiing bibweem bamadikol butok, kamotsh banaphaal bakal’l bikelel bibaan! <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Ntshiin mbè, lasu lashaam’l makaam, Tiil baan’i Sidoon bekabalum’s busek babulek bwiin. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.15. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Yesh 14.13-15</ref>.</char></note>I bwiin, bât ba Kapenum, busaphis ane, bukieen shaang a dike? Bakukakum’s a shin suk a indiy i midju!”<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.16. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mt 10.40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mak 9.37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Lk 9.48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yn 13.20</ref>.</char>
    </note>Yish kalwoosaan kamotsh bieentsh baan ane: “Mwoot es’bunyey, amakantshey; mwoot kabunyeedj mbi, kantsheedj miim mbi, wey mbè kantsheedj miim mbi, kanyeedj wey amantom mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bieentsh masamashaam’l i baphey banyikadj</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Bieentsh masamashaam’l i baphey kiy baan ikadj i nshaas, besatwoot ane: “Kum, aal’k mieen mibey mis’tawoom’k es’biit mitom’s dweey a diin diaa!”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yish kabakal’laan ane: “Namamon mbok ambaak sak’tieem abwaak muna nkaam mu ntshetsh to dik. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.19. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:13">Ntm 91.13</ref>.</char></note>Wokanyeeny! Namabuyeek bukum bunyak ntshwa akol kot kamotsh ashas’l bunoon’l bukim bu nshaang’dj, kwa iket mbè imotsh yil bukel bweph mbi. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Ek kabwal’k i nshaas ikaam i mbè mieen mibey miabuwoom’k mbi, ek aalanyeeny i nshaas idik di mbè ane miin miin bamamaphuun a nkaan mu mwoony.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish awok nshaas mubwiik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mataay 11.25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13.16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Mataang makun mantshiin, Yish ambaak i nshaas mubwiik i Mween Musek katwootaan ane: “Taat, Kum a shin i dik! Ndaakas lakeeng labwiik abol bwaa ikaam walak babilieeng binsweey ween ben a bwaany baan’i bayeeph. Ndayim’s Taat ikaam i mbè wamuk mbè biaal ngwoon.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.22. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:35">Yn 3.35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10.15</ref>.</char>
    </note>Yish katwootaan ane: “Taatieem amampieek biket bikim. Mwoot mbè motsh kesayeeph Mwân aaph mbè kayeeph’dj Taat, kamotsh mwoot kakwok’dj ayeeph Taat mbè kayeeph’dj Mwân mbi, akol wey akun esaan amuk alak mwooy maswaam.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />A mbisakun Yish kakaph’diaan bos a bieentsh baan, es’balwoos a banamieet ane: “Bwees bwaal i bât besamon mwooy maku mes’bwiin amon! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Ikaam’i mbè, ndes’bulwoos mbè ane, bangaang babwiik akol bakum bamaaswoot mbokamon mwooy mamon bwiin, ek kabamamon mbi, kamotsh bamaswoot mbokawok mwooy mamwook bwiin, ek kababamawok mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkwoon mu muna Samaliy a mweeng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.25. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:35-40">Mt 22.35-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mak 12.28-34</ref>.</char>
    </note>Nyeeph mikieetsh kieenaan ikaam ikieek Yish. Kamuulaan ane: “Ntaang’dj”, “nakwok’dj akel mbony ikaam namon mwoony mu yoyoo?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yish kamuulaan ane: “Bampuun mbony mikieetsh? Usawok mbony esween abal?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.27. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lew 19.18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:5">Dtn 6.5</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mwoot kakal’laan ane: “ ‘Muk Kum Ntshièmaa i ntem mwaa mukim, i ngoniaa ikim, i bwoot bwaa bukim, i bwaany bwaa bukim,’ kamotsh: ‘Umuk mwanyo mbok mintshiin esween dimuk.’”<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.28. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lew 18.5</ref>.</char>
    </note>Yish kankal’laan esanwoos ane: “Wakal’l busek. Kel ngwoon, ul’kaal i mwoony mu yoyoo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ek nyeeph mikieetsh ambaak i nyiing atwoph’l. Ngwoon, kawuulaan Yish ane: “Mwanameey nyeeny?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yish kankal’laan ane: “Mwoot ambakikum to Yelushalem bos a Yeliko. Ambaakaan a mbok, kanaph baan ituum abol biphaang’t, kansok’l baan mindel, kambol baan busudj, kieen baan, kaneph baan anieem’l a shin akolakol iwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Phwetieek’dj, ntwootsh a Ntshièm kashamaan ambok akun mintshiin. Amonaan mwoot akun anèm’l, kashamaan a nkol mu mbok, kieenaan lieen laan. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Mbok mintshiin, muna Lewi antwoolaan a indiy ikun, kamonaan mwoot akun, kashamaan a nkol mu mbok kieenaan. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.33. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:15">2 Kul 28.15</ref>.</char></note>Ek mun a Samaliy, ambaak a lieen, katwoolaan akol mwoot akun. Amaan amon, mweeng kangaat muun. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Kasem’saan akolakol, kankolaan sedj baan’i maan a phot, kabakaan phot ikun. A mbis akun kanyeengaan adik di kameel, kanaataan bos a mbûl a bieentshambaang, katolaan budit’l bu ibo yaan. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Aphieen akun, kateyaan phas iphey i ngaang, kayeekaan mun a mbûl, esanwoos ane: ‘Tol budit’l bwaan,’ ‘el’miim ikadj, nayekayeek ikim ilween atey idik diaan.’”<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Ngwoon, Yish kawuulaan nyeeph mikieetsh ane: “A lakeny laa, a ndieeng bât baku baset, nyeeny ambaak akol a mwoot aku ayaat abol biphaang’t?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Nyeeph mikieetsh kankal’laan ane: “Wey akun amankes busek.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yish kanwoosaan ane: “Yaak, i ween ukel mbok mintshiin.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish a mbûl abol Maat baan’i Maliy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.38. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 11:1">Yn 11.1</ref>.</char>
    </note>Itaang imbaak Yish baan’i bieentsh baan a mbok, kayiing’laan a bol bweek’dj, ngaat a diin di Maat, kanyeyaan a mbûlaan. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Maat ambaak i mwayinaan a ngaat, diin diaan Maliy, ambaak ashik a mateem ma Kum, esawom’k dweey diaan. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Ek Maat ambaak i mingun mibwiik mi mbûl. Kiyaan akol a Yish esanwoos ane: “Kum, kabisaphetsh ikaam i mbè mwanameey esanswool minamieet ikaam ikel ngun? Nwoos ikaam i mbè ingaas!”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Kum kankal’laan ane: “Maat, Maat, usawok nyeen ikaam i mingun mibwiik milween i miim, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />ek iket imotsh yin idi ngaang. Maliy kasolaan iket imbaak busek, yaaph mbè kabakwok’dj antaam’l mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yish esalwoong’s bieentsh baan mbokalwoom Ntshièm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mataay 6.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Lasu liek’dj, Yish ambaak esalwoom Ntshièm a imbet yeek’dj. Amaans’diaan mbok alwoom Ntshièm, motsh a ndieeng a bieentsh baan kamuulaan ane: “Kum, talwoong’s mbok alwoom Ntshièm, mbokanwoong’s Yoon bieentsh baan.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yish kabakal’laan ane: “Es’bwiin alwoom Ntshièm, twootanyeeny ane:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Taatiin el a dik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">diin diaa diaal i phaam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">bunyim bwaa bwiy. Mweeng mwaa mwaal mbok mintshiin amukween mbè bikeph’t a shin baan’i dik.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Watayeek bishim bidia bi matu makim.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Utawok’s mweeng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">mbok mintshiin es’biit awok’s babamatakes bweph.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">Kamotsh kutalieem’k mbè takel bweph mbi, ek taphaans a bweph.’”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Yish kabalwoosaan kamotsh ane: “Mbè motsh a ndieengiin aal i nkidiaan, yeen andieeng butu a bol bwaan ikaam inwoos ane: ‘Mbèyieem, ndes’kalwoom ngaas i maamp maset. <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Ikaam i mbè nedi nkidieem amatwool a bol bweem, ek kanday iket i nyey i yin mbi!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Ek mbè biaal mbè mbèyaan ankal’l a ngat’a mbûl ane: “Lieem’l ampetsh! Namaman adiph ikwiik, bân bieem i miim tabetsh; kanakwok’dj awuum ikaam iyek maamp mbi.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Ndes’bulwoos dwey dikwook, mbè kawuum’dj a shin ikaam imweek, ikaam i mbèyaan, awukawuum amamweek iliees isaan alwoom ikaam i mbè esabombok latwoot labwiik.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />“Ek miim ndes’bulwoos mbè, lwoom anyeeny babuyekabuyek; swoot anyeeny bumokamon; kumanyeeny ikwiik babudikabudiph’l.<verse eid="LUK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Ikaam mbè mwoot aku nkim esalwoom bes’kamweek, mwoot esaswoot es’kamon, wey esakum ikwiik bes’kandiph’s. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Mbè mwoot motsh andieengiin aal ishaan a bân, akwok’dj ayeek mwânaan ntshwa mbè esanwoom sweye? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Kamotsh amwekamweek kot mbè esanwoom ikele? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Bwiin bât babey, busayeeph mbokayeek bân biin biket bisek. Ek Taat el a dik elabel mbok buyeek mween musek abol ba besanwoom mbony!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish baan’i Belsebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mataay 12.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Maak 3.20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Lasu liek’dj Yish ambaak abieeng mween mubey mumbaak mwayis mwoot kil. Atwoodj mween mubey, mwoot katetshaan mbokatwoot. I twoong a bât katetshiin mbok akam’l, <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.15. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mt 9.34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10.25</ref>.</char></note>ek bât bieek’dj bakieek aphiing a baan, katwoot baan ane: “Bik a ngon ibol Belsebul, Kum a mieen mibey, esaan abieeng mieen mibey.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.16. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mt 12.38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1">16.1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mak 8.11</ref>.</char>
    </note>Ibiek’dj, kaswoot baan mbok ankotsh ilwoong, besamuul ikaam i mbè abalak ying’t isalak ane bukum bwaan bu bu Ntshièm. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Ek Yish ambaak esayeeph lakeny labaan; kabalwoosaan ane: “Mbè bunyim bwaal ituum bunamieet, kabulieen a bos mbi, mbè bât ba ilwootsh imotsh baal a masey, ilwootsh ikawa. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Mbè sak’tieem aal’i bushaang’dj anamieet bukum bwaan bukwok’dieen a bos mbony? Ndesatwoot ngwoon ikaam i mbè bumatwoot ane kandesabieeng mieen mibey i bunoon’l bu Belsebul. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Yiin mbè ndesabieeng mieen mibey i bunoon’l bu Belsebul, nyeeny esayeek bieentsh biin bunoon’l bu bieeng mieen mibey? Bieentsh biin banamieet besalak mbè buk a ibwaak!<verse eid="LUK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Ek mbè ndesabieeng mieen mibey a bunoon’l bu Ntshièm, mbok a mbè ane bunyim bu Ntshièm bwatwool suk a phingiin.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Mbè nuung anoon’l aal biket bikim bi ituum, esaan abak mbûlaan, budiy bwaan bukim bu bwabak busek. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Ek mbè nuungieek’dj anek bunoon’l, anaph ituum, ambol, antam’l bingom bisaan atshik ntem, akakaph’s biket bikun bintolaan.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.23. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mak 9.40</ref>.</char>
    </note> Mwoot aaph mbè kaapheem, nshaang’dieem; wey aaph mbè kesakweekieem mbi, es’katshaak’dj.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mieen mibey mianyikadj</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mataay 12.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Esatow mween mubey a latok la mwoot, mus’kakal a mandiy maaph bât, munswoot indiy itwoos, ek mbè kamumwoony indiy itwoos mbi, mul’katwoot munamieet ane: ‘Ndel’kakal a mbuliem, kotsh akun ambaak miim.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />El’muun ikadj, muntotaan mbûl yawoom, yalodj busek. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />A mbis akun, munswoot mieen miek’dj mimotsh shaam’l mianekaan bunoon’l; mimwiy imbet imotsh a mbûl mimwishim’k. Mom a mom, mwoot akun aneph aphil ambey alek matetetsh maan.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nshaas mukwokwook</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Itaang imbaak Yish aatwoot ngwoon, ngaat antshak katwootaan angon aphiing a twoong a bât esatwoot ane: “Nshaas mwaal’i ngaat ambaak abotween, kamotsh ambaak anyoom’s mabieel!”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Ek Yish kankal’laan ane: “Nshaas mubwiik mudi bât besawom’k dweey disatwoot Ntshièm, kamotsh bamamatshik a bikelel bibaan!”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilwoom i dweey di makam’l</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mataay 12.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.29. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:4">Mt 16.4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mak 8.12</ref>.</char>
    </note>Itaang imbaak twoong a bât yayool akol a Yish, Yish katetshaan mbokatwoot ane: “Ben a nkil muku bât babey; besalwoom dweey di makam’l di to dik, ek kabel amon dweey di makam’l mbè dimotsh mbi, dilaal dweey dikun dintshiin di Yonaas. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.30. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:4">Yon 3.4</ref>.</char></note>Ngwoon, mbok mintshiin ambaak Yonaas akel dweey di makam’l ikaam ben Niniwe, i Mwân a Mwoot elaphil dweey di makam’l ikaam i nkil muku. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.31. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1 Bk 10.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Kul 9.1-12</ref>.</char></note> Lasu lalum’s bât, Ineem i to Sela, iyiekayeem’t a bos bu nkil muku, amabaswoong’l, ikaam i mbè amwiy to minuung mi itaan ibwiik mi shin a maan ikaam iwoom’k mwooy mayool to i bwaany bu Soloom. Kabesayeeph mbè ane iket yalek Soloom yil ayè mbi. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.32. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:5">Yon 3.5</ref>.</char></note> Lasu laluum’s bât, bashi Niniwe bayekayeem’t a bos bu nkil muku bamabaswoong’l, ikaam i mbè bena Niniwe bamaakal’l bikelel bibaan awok’dj baan Yonaas esashaang’l lashaang lasek. Kabesayeeph mbè ane e mwoot alek Yonaas bunen ayè!<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Diish amwaak mbwoon a latok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mataay 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6.22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.33. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mt 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mak 4.21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Lk 8.16</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Mwoot mbè motsh kakwok’dj atieem’s mbwoon ikaam imukwiik a shin a nsheet aal’k a shin ilak mbi. Ek, bamwaak bamutshik a dik di meens, ikaam i mbè bât besaying’l bamon baph’l. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Diish diaa diin mbwoon a latok laa: mbè diish diaa diaal busek; latok laa lakim lek a mwaany, ek mbè diish diaa diaal i bwaal; ngwoon latok laa lakim lek a mwim’l. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Ek ngwoon, aal’i bwaany ikaam i mbè mwaany mwaa kamuphil’k mwim’l mbi. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Mbè latok laa lakim laal a mwaany, mbè kwa iteny imotsh yil’a mwim’l mbi, ngwoon, lel’kaal lakim a ndieeng a mwaany, mbok mintshiin esaal mbwoon imangaam’s.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish aswoong’l bayeeph mikieetsh baan’i Baphal’s</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mataay 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maak 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Itaang imaans’dj Yish mbok atwoot, mufal’s motsh kambokaan mbel a bol bwaan ikaam idiayaan. Yish kieenaan, katwoosaan a meens ikaam idia. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Mufal’s kakam’laan ikaam i mbè Yish kambaak awok maas a mio a bos budia mbi. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Kum Yish kanwosaan ane: “Lieen mbokebwiin, bwiin bafal’s: busakut’l mbis buseph bu ikoph baan iloong, ek a ngat ayin, bubabayool to i bweem baan’i isoph. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Bwiin bât baaph i bwaany! Ntshièm amwaang mbis buseph, kawaang’dj kamotsh ngate? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Yeekanyeeny ben a ntaan biket bil a ngat makoph i maloong miin, ambis akun bikim bikaal baph’l idik diin.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.42. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lew 27.30</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Ek, iteem key ibey bwiin bafal’s, ikaami mbè busayeek Ntshièm iteny ishieeng i iket imotsh i kas i maphidj; akol kas yeek’dj i sol idia kamotsh, ek kabuwaak phiim bulodj akol imuk i Ntshièm: biin binaph bwiin akel, kubulieem’l bi binshaal mbi.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Iteem key ibey bwiin baphal’s, bwamuk ashim’k a maphaat ma bukum a shinangoong, kamotsh busamuk mbè babuwuum’l a mandiy makim ma bol. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Iteem key ibey bwiin bafal’s! Bwe muna biaan bi midju biaaph mbè kabisasol, bât kabes bimon mbi, bamanyak mateem.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Motsh aphiing bayeeph mikieetsh katwotaan ane: “Ntang’dj, esween atwoot ngwoos, us’katatwoon i biite!”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yish kankalaan ane: “Iteem key ibey bwiin bayeeph mikieetsh! Busanyeeng madit’l a tok i bât ikaam ishieetsh, ek kabusanying nyieem mbè mu motsh ikaam ibayaas mbi. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Iteemiin ibey key bwiin bafal’s! Busaphik biaan bisek ikaam i bangaang badiaak’dj baan abol bamaamiin. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Ngwoon busalak bikelel bi bamamiin, ikaam i mbè bamadiaak bangaang bes’bwiin aphik’s biaan! <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Ntshiin Ntshièm, a bwaany bwaan, esashaang’l ane: ‘Ndabutokabutom’s bangaang baan’i bieentsh; badiakadiaak ibiek’dj aphiing a baan, kamotsh baphekaphetsh ibiek’dj.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Ek ngwoon, bât ba nkil muku bashakashaal i budit’l bu iwa idiak’dj baan bangaang bakim to itaang iwaang’dj baan nkwootsh, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.51. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Matt 4.8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20-21">2 Kul 24.20-21</ref>.</char></note>to makel ma Abel suk iwa ibol Sakaliy, adiaak’dj baan aphaang imbet ilièm’s ilaam baan’i indiy i ikin. Ikakaam, ndes’bushaak’s mbè ane, nkil muku, mul’kashieetsh maphetsh ma iwa iku i bât bakim!<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Iteemiin ibey key bwiin bayeeph mikieetsh! Bwatey laphuung’dj lesadiph’l ikwiik i buyeeph, bwinamieet kabusaying’l mbi, bunkasaphetsh ba bedi nyiing aying’l!”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Itaang intow Yish to mbûl akun abol mufal’s, bayeeph mikieetsh baan’i bafal’s katetsh baan amwok’s kaph, biemuudj mwooy mabwiik, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Bambaak besankieek ikaam i mbè bamon dweey di ngaat idiin.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Bwaal anyeeny i manyaang a bos bu ben laniaany</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mataay 10.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.1. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:6">Mt 16.6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:15">Mak 8.15</ref>.</char>
    </note>A itaang ikun, makweek ma bât babwiik mambaak mayol a indiy imotsh besadinyak’s a mateem. Yish katetshaan alwoos bieentsh baan ane: “Buyeeph anyeeny, kabuyim’skanyeeny lweven la Baphal’s lusaphil lanyaany. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.2. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mak 4.22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Lk 8.17</ref>.</char></note>Kwa iket yaswaam yaaph mbè kayilatow a baph’l mbi, aal’k iku ikim il a busweem bayekayeeph. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Ntshiin mbè, iku ikim is’bwiin atwoot a mwim’l bel’ka iwok a baph’l, kamotsh iku ikim is’bwiin aluung’s a i to a ngat a mbok ilak, bel’ka itwoot a ngon a ibaantsh.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwoot atshiin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mataay 10.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Ndes’bulwoos, bwiin bakidj bieem: kabutshiin’k bisadiaak latok mbi, ambis akun, kabisakel dweey mbè dimotsh mbi. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Ek ndek bulak wey mbè bukwook’dj atshiin: tshiin anyeeny mwoot edi bukum budiaak kamotsh buphul a imbet imaphetsh ma yoyoo. Ikakaam, ndes’bulwoos mbè, ntshaan mbè butshiin!<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />“Kabakwook’dj akaph mashaphodj mataan a dik di phas ipheye? Buyeeph anyeeny, Ntshièm kesawa iket mbè imotsh phiim mbi. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Aal’k phu i ntshwey mwaa iyabal ikim. Kabutshiin’k mbi: budi ngaang yalek mashaphodj mabwiik!<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayim’s baan’i abel Kilist</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mataay 10.32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12.32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10.19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Ndes’bulwoos ane: “Mwoot aku nkim elatieen diin dieem aphiing a bât, Mwân a Mwoot antiekantieen a bos bu bantshol ba Ntshièm. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Ek mbè mwoot anton a bos bu bât ane, kesantsheeph, Mwân a Mwoot antokanton iyaan a bos bu bantshol ba Ntshièm.<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.10. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:32">Mt 12.32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:29">Mak 3.29</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Wey aku nkim esatwoot bweph bos a Mwân a Mwoot bamwokamwook’s mweeng; ek wey akun esatwoon Mween Musek kabel a mwook’s mweeng mbi.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.11. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">Mt 10.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:11">Mak 13.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:14-15">Lk 21.14-15</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Itaang yil’baan abulaat a bos bu bât ikaam ibulum’s a shinangoong, aal’k a bos bu bayeeph ba mikieetsh baan’i bakum banen, kabwaal’k i butet ikaam iswoot mwooy mel’bwiin aluum’l mbi, aal’k mwooy mel bwiin atwoot mbi. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Ikaam Mween Musek mul’kabulwoong’s itaang ikun intshiin mbok el’bwiin atwoot.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkwoon mu ndiy aaph i bwaany</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Mwoot aphiing twoong a bât kalwoosaan Yish ane: “Ntaang’dj, lwoos mwânameey takaph’shaan budiy bwiit bu lakit butaswoos’dj taatiit.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yish kankal’laan ane: “Mbèyeem, nyeeny amantshik muna kom’liin ikaam ishaam’l malaang miin, aal’k ikaam ikaph’s budiy bwiin?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />A mbis akun, kalwoosaan bakim ane: “Buyeeph! Bwaalanyeeny i bwaany a bos bu budiy, ikaam i mbè mwoot kaaph i mwoony a dik di budiy mbi, aal’k mbè aal ndiy anen.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Yish kababok’saan kamotsh nkwoon ane: “Ndiy yeek’dj ambaak i ngwoon, imbaak isatwoos biket bibwiik bisek. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Kabokaan lakeny es’diwuus anamieet ane: ‘Kanday i imbet ikweek biket bieem biku bikim mbi. Ndel akel mbony? <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Katwootaan kamotsh ane, lieenanyeeny mbokel’miim akel: ‘Ndel abwoong’l madik mieem makim, ndel aphik madik malek mango bunen, nanyoos shaang akol biket bieek’dj. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />A mbis akun, naneph dilwoos minamieet ane: ntem mweem, udi biket bibwiik ikaam mitshi mibwiik; kit a shin, dia, nyo kamotsh aal i nshaas a nkwootsh!’<verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Ek Ntshièm kanwoosaan ane: “Yeeny ibey! Butu bulwool bel’kalwoom mwoony mwaa. Ngwoon, biket biaa bishaal inyeeny?’”<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yish kamomaan ane: “Ntshiin mom mu mwoot edi budiy bubwiik bu anamieet, ek a miish ma Ntshièm kaaph i budiy mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayim’s Ntshièm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mataay 6.25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />A mbis akun, Yish kalwoosaan bieentsh baan ane: “Ntshiin es’miim abulwoos mbè: kabusuum’s lakeny idik di mwoony mwiin ikaam i biket bidia, aal’k idik di latok liin ikaam i mindel midiing mbi. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Ikaam mbè mwoony mudi ngaang mwalek biket bidia, kamotsh latok ledi ngaang lalek mindel midiing. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Lienanyeeny mayophaang: kamesawoon iket idia, kamesatwoos iket mbi, kamaaph i budik mbi, aal’k indiy ishwey iket mbi. Ek Nsthièm esamadiees! Bwiin budi ngaang yalek phul! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Nyeeny a ndieengiin a maphetsh maan akol mwooy manoon’l, akwook’dj amanyeeng matu mieek’dj a mwoony mwaan ikaam i lakeny lesaan abok? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Mbè kabwaaph i bwaany bukel iket ikieek, busasuum’s lakeny idik di matu maku manshaal ikaam i yey? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.27. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1 Bk 10.4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2 Kul 9.3-6</ref>.</char></note>Lieen anyeeny mbok esamen bisam bi mangwoon: kabisakel ngun mbi, kabisatwoong mindel mbi. Ek, ndesabushaak’s mbè aal’k kum Solomoon i budiy bwaan bukim bumbakaan i buun, kadiing mindel misek mun isam mbè imotsh mbi. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Ngwoon, mbè Ntshièm esadiing itieet ngo, isaal akat a ngwoon alwool, a phieen bamayituum tey, akwook’dj anyieens abuding mbony, bu bât ba yim’s ikieek!<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />“Kabusuum’s lakeny idik di iket idia baan’i iket inyo mbi. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />(Ikaam i mbè bakedj a mwooy mabey ba nkwootsh muku baan besabok lakeny ngwoon matu makim.) Ek bwiin, Ishiin esayeeph mbè budi nyiing a biin. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Ek swotanyeeny a bukoos bunyim bu Ntshièm, biku bimotsh bis’bwiin aswoot, Ntshièm el’kabuyeek i biin.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Budiy bu dik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mataay 6.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Kwal’k i butet mbi, ween twoong a phaang mikieek! Ikaam mbè Ishiin alwoong mbok buyeek Bunyim bu dik. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Kaphanyeeny biket biin, buyekanyeeny ben ntaan phas ikun. Aalanyeeny i phas yaaph mbè kayisawoontsh mbi, kwekanyeeny madiy a dik maaph mbè kamanshil’k mbi, bieem kabakwok’dj asem’s akol a maan, aal’k sen’l kayikwok’dj idia mbi. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Ikaam’i mbè, imbet ikun i budiy bwaa, ntshiin imbet i ntem mwaa kamotsh.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muna ngun manyaang.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mataay 24.45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.35. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:1-13">Mt 25.1-13</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Diinganyeeny mindel mi ngun, bwaal akolakol i mbwoon yatieem, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.36. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:34-36">Mak 13.34-36</ref>.</char></note> aalanyeeny muna ben a ngun besakwoong’l ntang’dj mubaan suk itaang ilaanikadj to bulaatsh, ikaam indiph’s ikwiik a itaang ilaan atwool. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Bwees bwaal i ben a ngun bakun bel’baan atotaan basweeng abol kum abaan, itaang ilaan atwool! Ikakaam ndes’bushak’s mbè: ayakayaas ben a ngun belaal akolakol itaang ilaan atwool, amabayeek indiy isek, ikaam bakes ngun. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Bwees bwaal abol ben a ngun bakun basweeng, mbè kum yikadj a ndieeng butu aal’k a ndekandek a butu, el’kato bataan basweeng! <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.39. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43-44">Mt 24.43-44</ref>.</char></note>Busayeeph bwiinamieet, tshik mbè kum a mbûl es’kayeeph itaang iliy mweem, el’kashaal asweeng, kelaliem’l mweem ikaam mbè alus’l ibieen mbi. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Aalanyeeny busweeng i bwiin, ikaam mbè Mwân a Mwoot el’kiy muna mweem a itaang yaaph mbè kabusayeeph mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muna ngun ansek akol muna ngun ambey</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mataay 24.45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Ngwoon Petelo kawuulaan Yish ane: “Nkwoon muku us’tabok’s biitamieet mbè mu mu bât bakime?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Kum kankal’laan ane: “muna ngun a manyaang baan’i muna ngun a bwaany nyeeny? Wey akun es’baan asol abol kumaan ikaam ibak mbûlaan, amweek ibiek’dj iteny ibaan i bi bidia a bos bu itaang. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Bwees bwaal i muna ngun el’baan ato taan esakel ngun mwaan elikadj kumaan a bol bwaan! <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Ikakaam ndes’kabushak’s ane: kumaan amwekamweek budit’l bu biket biaan bikim. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Ek mbè muna ngun atwoot ane: “Kumieem aman su ikaamiy, atetsh abol ben a ngun baku bamotsh, baluung i baat, andia, kamotsh anyo angwa maan, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />ngwoon kum el’kiy lasu laaph mbè muna ngun kambak’dj ayeeph mbi, a itaang i mbè kasayeeph mbi; amambieeng kamotsh amamweek ikaph i ben a ngun baaph i mbak’tsh.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />“Muna ngun esayeeph mbokesamuk kumaan, mbè kesakel mbokesalwoong kum, abokabodj mikaph mibwiik. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Ek, muna ngun akun aaph mbè kesayeeph mbok esamuk kumaan, ankel mbokaaph mbè kumaan kesalwoong mbi. Abokabodj mikaph mikieek. Balwokalwoom bibwiik abol wey amweek baan bibwiik, kamotsh babokabolwoom a ngon bibwiik abol wey amweek baan bibwiik bialek’s.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish mwiidj munam’l bât</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mataay 10.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Namwiy ikaam inem tey a shin a maan kamotsh ndesaswoot mbè, namon tey tanam’t! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.50. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:38">Mak 10.38</ref>.</char></note> Ek ndel’kaal i dweey ditaam’l, ek phweet mbadj key is’biin aman su ikaamiyeem’l! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Busabok lakeny ane ndiidj ilaatsh nkit’l a shin a maane? Mbi, ek namwiy ikaam ibunam’l. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Atetsh to lwool aku, mbûl a bât bataan yil’kabaantsh, bât baset kabelawok’s i baphey mbi, kamotsh baphey kabelawok’s i baset mbi. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.53. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 7:6">Mik 7.6</ref>.</char></note>Taat kelawok’s i mwânaan a nuung kamotsh mwân a nuung kelawok’s i ishanaan mbi, inaan kelawok’s i mwânaan a ngaat, kamotsh mwân a ngaat kelawok’s i inanaan, bô kelawok’s i mwam’s a mwânaan a nuung, mwam’s a mwân a nuung kelawok’s i bô bwaan bu ngaat mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayeeph bing’t bi itaang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mataay 16.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yish kalwosaan twoong a bât ane: “Es’bwiin amon isheem i mbul yakat to makit’l ma itaang, busatwoot itaang ikun intshiin ane, mbul el’kanow, bisakeph’t ngwoon. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Esaphuuph muung muto makit’l ma itaang, busatwoot ane, mwaany mu bunoon’l, bisakeph’t ngwoon. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Ben a lanyaany! Budi lakeny lawok mwooy ma dik baan’i ma ma shin; ngwoon, kabusawook mbokesashaam mwooy ma nkil mulwool idik di yey?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Awok’s i nshaang’diaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mataay 5.25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Kabusaswoot bwinamieet mwooy makel idik di yey? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />A itaang ilwenieen i nshaang’diaa a bos bu bakom’l, kel bwaany bu mbè buwok’siaan a mbok, mbè bukal nshaang’diaa el’kalaat a bos bu bakom’l, mwoot aku el’katshik a mio mi baphuluus, bamaphul a mwaat. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Ndesalwoos mbè ane kulatow to ndwoon mbè kulieedj mbat akun suk laphas lakieek mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Akal’l bikelel’l bibey mbè bukal awa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />A itaang ikun inaa, ibambaak bât biek’dj aphiing baan kiy baan ibos Yish ntshik mbok ambaak Pilaat adiaak ben a Ngaleel itaang imbaak baan alieem’l minaam abol Ntshièm. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yish kabakal’laan ane: “Busabok lakeny ane ben Ngaleel baku badiaak’dj baan, bedi bweph bwalek bât ibiek’dj bakim ba Ngaleel, ikaam i mbè bamon maphetsh mangwoone? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Ndes’bulwoos mbè mbi! Ek, mbè kabusamuk akal’l ntwoong’liin mibey mbi, buwakawa bakim mbok mintshiin. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Mbok mintshiin i bât baku ishieeng inaan baweedj a shin ibieen i mbûl itadj i Silow, busabok lakeny ane bambaak bât babey baalek bakim bel a Yelushalem? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Ndes’bulwoos mbè mbi! Ek, mbè kabusamuk akal’l ntwoong’liin mibey mbi, buwakawa bakim mbok mintshiin.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkwoon mu ntey mwaaph’i ndwoom.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Yish kababok’saan nkwoon muku: “Mwoot ambaak i ntey mu fiink muwoonydiaan a ngwoon a nviny. Amwiyaan iswoot ndwoom, kamon mbi. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Iphontshi, kalwoosaan mun a ngun mu ngwoon a nviny ane: ‘Lieen, bisho biset biashaam, namwaak namwiy ikaam iswoot ndwoom a ntey muku, kanamon’k mbi. Musheeng anyeeny! Musadia indiy i bukal idik di yey?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Ek mun a ngun kankal’laan ane: ‘Ntaang’dj, man mulieem’l ntshi muku kamotsh; ndel’katshim a mashin ma muun, nambok biket. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Ngwoon, phweetiek’dj mutokato ndwoom, mbè bukal umamusheeng.’”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish abo ngaat ikuny lasu la Nsabat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Lasu lamotsh la Nsabat, Yish ambaak esalwoong’s a mbûl a Ntshièm. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Andwoon, ambabaak ngaat a ntshak i bwaal aakel bisho ishieeng inaan, ambaak ikuny, kambaakamon bwaany busheem’t mbi. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yish amonaan ngaat akun, kambokaan mbel esanwoos ane: “Ngaat, bwaal bwaa bwashil!” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Ngwoon, kanyeengaan mio miaan a latok laan, itaang ikun intshiin, bwaal kashil buun, kasheem’taan katetshaan mbok asem’l Ntshièm. <verse eid="LUK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.14. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:9-10">Eks 20.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:13-14">Dtn 5.13-14</ref>.</char></note>Ek kum a mbûl a Ntshièm kawokaan kaph ikaam Yish abo mwoot lasu la Nsabat. Kalwoosaan twoong a bât ane: “Matu me mashiaam’l ikaam ikel ngun; iyanyeeny budibo matu makun, ek lasu la Nsabat mbi!”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Kum kabakal’l ane: “Bu bât ba mas maphey! Lasu la Nsabat, mwoot aku nkim kantieek ngweemiaan a nkoph ikaam inyoos maase. <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Ek ngaat aku, ntshwakaan abol Abalapham, ankaan baan abol sataan andieeng mitshi ishieeng inaan, kabimbaak’dj busek antuung’l a mwaan muku lasu la Nsabate?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Itaang imbaakaan esatwoot ngo, bashaang’dj kawok baan busony bubwiik; ek twoong mikim imbaak i nshaas ikaam i mwooy masek mambaakaan akel.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkwoon mu lashaang la ntey mu mutaal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mataay 13.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maak 4.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yish kawuulaan ane: “Bunyim bu Ntshièm busaphwaans i yey? Nakwok’dj buphwaans i yeye? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Bumun lashaang la mutaal lakieek, lantol baan abol mwoot alabok a ngwoonaan: lamen, lampil ntey munen, i phul insol mayaantsh a phak i muun.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkwoon mu lweven</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mataay 13.33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yish katwoot kamotsh ane: “Bunyim bu Ntshièm busaphwaans i yey? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Busaphwaans i lweven lantol baan abol ngaat a ntshak antuph’s i phuuph abwiik a budit’l bu mashaphey shaam’l, suk elaphet ntok mukim.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikwiik ikieek</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mataay 7.13-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:23">21.23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yish ambaak esiebwing a maal baan’i mangaan, yelwoong’s kamotsh yenieentsh bos a Yelushalem. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Mwoot kamuulaan ane: “Kum, bât bakieek babel aphaane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yish kabakal’laan ane: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Kelanyeeny mbok mikim ikaam iying’l a ikwik ikweek; ikaam, ndes’bushaak’s mbè, babwiik bakiekakieek mbokaying’l ek kabelayeedj mbi. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Itaang ilakat kum a mbûl, elaan kaang ikwiik i seph, bulaal ka buseph, butekatetsh mbokakum a ikwik buntwoot ane: ‘Kum, tadiph’s ikwiik i mbûl!’ El’kabukal’l ane: ‘Kandesayeeph kotsh es’bwiniy mbi!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Ntshiin, bwiin bunwokanwoos ane: ‘Tamadia kamotsh tanyo yaa, umalwoong’s a mioong’l mi mal miit!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.27. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Ntm 6.8</ref>.</char></note>El’k bukal’l kamotsh ane: ‘kandasayeeph kotsh es’bwiiniyi mbi. Tow anyeeny akolieem, bwiin bakedj a mwooy mabey!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.28. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:13">Mt 22.13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25.30</ref>.</char></note><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.28. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:11-12">Mt 8.11-12</ref>.</char></note> Ntshiin itaang yil’bwiin alel kamotsh bumadisum’s miin, itaang yil’bwiin amon Abalapham, Isaak, Yakob akol bangaang a bunyim bu Ntshièm, ek andaan bwiin babuphul a buseph! <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Ntshey a bât bel’kiy to matwoodj ma itaang baan’i makit’l ma itaang, to tieen baan’i ngèl banshim’k i Ntshièm a nshaas mu bunyim bwaan. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.30. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mt 19.30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:16">20.16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mak 10.31</ref>.</char></note>Ngwoon, ibiek’dj bel a mbis, bel’kaal ba ba bukoos, kamotsh ba ba bukoos, bel’kaal ba ba mbis.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esalel idik di Yelushalem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mataay 23.37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />A itaang ikun, bafal’s bakieek kasem’s baan akol a Yish besanwoos ane: “Tow a imbet iku, yaak a kotsh iyiek’dj ikaam Elood esaswoot mbok adiaak.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yish kabakal’laan ane: “Yaakanyeeny bwelwoos ngieeng mukun ane: ‘Ndesabieeng mieen mibey kamotsh nambo bât alwool baan’i phieen, lasu lanseet namaans ngun mweem.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Ek, alwool aku ndel’kakel ngun mweem, aphieen baan’i lasu lakun lamotsh, ikaam kabisayem’l mbè ane badiaak ngaang a Ntshièm a indiy yek’dj yaaph mbè ka Yelushalem mbi.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Yelushalem, Yelushalem, ween usadiaak bangaang ba Ntshièm kamotsh undiaak bât bantom baan abol Ntshièm i mbôk! Phweet mbadikey inaaph’miim akweek bân akolieem, mbok mintshiin amwaak kok ankweek bân baan a shin a maam maan, ek ween kumuk’dj alwoong mbi! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.35. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Ntm 118.26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:5">Yel 22.5</ref>.</char></note>Lieen, mbûliin ilashaal bwaang. Ndes’bulwoos mbè: ‘Kabulakas ambon shaang lasu leliy itaang yil’bwiin atwoot ane: “Ntshièm ashak’s mwoot eliy a diin di Kum!’”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yish esabow mwoot awuul lakok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Lasu la Nsabat, Yish kieenaan a mbûl a kum motsh a baphal’s ikaam idia. Bât bambaak andaan, bambaak besalieen Yish pholoo. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Imbabaak mwoot i lakok lawuul, ayeem a bos bwaan, <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yish katetshaan atwoot, esawuul bayeeph mikieetsh akol baphal’s ane: “Mikieetsh miit mikwook’dj ayim’s mbè babo mwoot lasu la Nsabate?” <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Ek kashaal baan phol. Ngwoon, Yish kawaam’laan mbieel, kambowaan ambis akun, kantomaan.<verse eid="LUK 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.5. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:11">Mt 12.11</ref>.</char>
    </note>Iphontshi kanephaan balwoos ane: “Mbè motsh aphiingiin aal i mwân a nuung aal’k ngweem abwaak a mbieem a maas, kelantey bwaas a bwaas, aal’k mbè lasu la Nsabate?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Kabamon mbok ankal’l Kum mbi.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adikum’s akol anyey bât</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yish amamon mbokambaak bât besaswoot mambet masek. Kababok’saan nkwoon ane: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.8. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:6-7">Mik 25.6-7</ref>.</char></note>“Mbè mwoot abok mbel a iliees i bulaatsh, kutwoos’k a imbet isek mbi. Ikaam, akwook’diaal abok mwoot aalek ween bunen mbel, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />i wey akun amabubok mbel mpween mwiin aneph ilwoos ween ane: ‘Kat a shin sek mwoot aku yaak wetwoos a mbis bakim.’ Ngwoon ul’kaal i busony ikaamietwoos a mbis bakim. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Ek mbè bukal, mbè babok mbel, yaak wetwoos a imbet ikieek, ikaam andaan itaang eliy mwoot, amabok mbel, amalwoos ane: ‘Mbeyeem, twoos a iphaat inen.’ Ul’kaal nshaas a miish ma bât belween i baan a meens. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.11. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mt 23.12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">Lk 18.14</ref>.</char></note> Ntshiin, mwoot es’dibaans, bel’kankum’s, i mwoot es’dikum’s bel’kambaans.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Iphontshi Yish amalwoos mwoot ambaak baan babok mbel ane: “Itaang isween ayeek bât iket idia mwaany aal’k i ikwook’l, kubok’k bananyo akol babotsh baa mbel mbi, mbè bakidj baa, mbè badiy bel akolaa mbi; ikaam i mbè kababok’k iween mbel lasu liek’dj lamotsh mbi. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Ek esween ayeek bât bishim bi nshaas, bok ben a ntaan mbel, bitwim, bât ba bukal baan’i bât bawa miish; <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />wel’kaal i nshaas, ikaam baan kabakwook’dj akas ibiin mbi. Ntshièm akakakas itaang ilabuum bât basek.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkwoon mu iliees inen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mataay 22.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Aman baan awok mwooy makun, mwoot motsh ambaak i baan a meens kalwoosaan Yish ane: “Bwees bwaal i mwoot eladia ilieesiaan a bunyim bu Ntshièm!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yish kambok’saan nkwoon muku: “Mwoot ambaak alaam ilieesiaan inen, kabekaan bât babwiik mbel. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />A itaang idia iliees, katomaan mun ngunaan ikaam ibok bât babok’diaan mbel: ‘Yanyeeny, ikaam iliees yatwool akolakol!’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Ek nkim mubaan, mun mwoot nkim, katetsh baan asek. Mwoot a bukoos kalwoosaan mun ngun ane: ‘Namaswoom ngwoon, bi busek mbè ndie ilieen; ndes’kawoong mpwok’s mweeng.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Iyek’dj kanwosaan ane: ‘Namaswoom mashin mieem ma balwim ba ngweem mataan, ndel’kamanieen ikaam imakieek; ndes’kawoong mpwok’s mweeng.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Iyek’dj kamotsh kanwosaan ane: ‘Ndes’kitweem ngaat iphontshi, ntshiin mbè kandelamon bwaany bwiy mbi.’<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />“Mun a ngun kakalaan abol kumaan kanwoosaan mbok ankal’l baan. Kum a mbûl kawokaan kaph, kalwoosaan mun a ngunaan ane: ‘Yaak bwaas a mandiy baan i mioong’l mi bol, yalaatsh ben a ntaan, bitwiim, bât ba bukal baan’i bât bawa miish akol ba besabwootsh.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />A mbis itaang, mun a ngun kiyaan itwoot ane: ‘Kum, mayeedj mikieetsh miaa, ek yaaph imbet ilangat.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Kum kanephaan alwoos mun a ngunaan ane: ‘Yaak a mbok i bol, a mikol mi ntshiaan, kasaneeng dweey ikaam bât baying’l kamotsh, ikaam i mbè mbûlieem iyool. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Ndes’bulwoos ane, kwa mwoot mbè motsh a bât babok’dj baan mbel, kabeladia iliesieem mbi!’”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mikieetsh misek ikaamiaal mweentsh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mataay 10.37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Lasu liek’dj, twoong a bât imbaakieyeentsh i Yish a mbok. Kakaph’diaan, es’balwoos ane: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.26. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:37">Mt 10.37</ref>.</char></note> “Mwoot aku nkim eliy abol bweem edi dweey diampuk miim bialek ishanaan, inanaan, mwam’shaan, bân baan, babinaan, aal’k mwoony mwaan. Mbè bukal, kenaal muntsheem mbi. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.27. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mt 10.38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24">16.24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mak 8.34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Lk 9.23</ref>.</char></note> Mwoot akun nkim esabel mbokasheetsh ntey mwaan mu kek ikaam indaph miim, kenaal mwentsheem mbi.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />“Mbè mwoot a ndieengiin aal i nyiing aphik mbûl, amwaak aman alieen bwiik bu phas ikaam imaans ngun. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />A mbokieek’dj, mbè atetsh aphik mbûl aaph phas imaans ngun, bakim el’baan amon ngwoon bekatetsh ansey. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Bietwootsh ane: ‘Lienanyeeny mwoot aku amanatetsh aphik mbûl, ek kaneph’dj amaans ngun mbi!’<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />“Mbok mintshiin, mbè kum anaphieen bos ituum i kumieek’dj, amwaak aman ashim’k ashin ikaam ilieen mbè ane, mbè ndaal’i mayol sen’l ishieeng, akwook’dj amanaan i mpisaan edi mayol sen’l mashaphey. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Mbè kaaph i ngon, antom batom abol kumieek’dj, mbè yaaph e kaany, ikaam imuul mikieetsh miaan mi nkit’l. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Ntshiin akun, Yish kakasaan atwoot ane: “Mwoot mbè motsh andieengiin kakwook’dj ashaal mweentshieem, mbè kesamuk alieem’l biket biaan bikim.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngèl mwatwiph</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mataay 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maak 9.50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Ngèl iket isek. Ek mbè mutwiph, telakel mbony ikaam i mbè mukasaal i phia. <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Ngwoon kamwabusek ikaam i shin aal’k ikaam i ngwoon mbi, bel’kamuphul a bwaany. Tak wey edi mato ikaam iwok, awek!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Nkwoon mu phaang adiim</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mataay 18.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.1. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:29-30">Lk 5.29-30</ref>.</char>
    </note>Lasu ilieek’dj bakweek minaam baan’i biphaang’t bibwiik kakwoom’k baan akol a Yish ikaam imwoom’k, <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />ek baphuuny mikaan baan’i bafal’s bambaak besaluung’s ane: “Mwoot aku esanyey bât babey andia i baan kamotsh!” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Iphonsthi, Yish kakasaan babok’s nkwoon ane:<verse eid="LUK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Mbè mwoot motsh a ndieengiin aal i phangiaan kam, mbè motsh adiim, kakwook’dj alieem’l iku imotsh kamadiph i idiph ikaam yeswoot motsh aku adiim shaang elaan amone? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Itaang ilaan amon, edi nshaas mubwiik. Ansheetsh phaangaan a manyak <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />ankal a bol bwaan, ambis akun ambok bambèy baan mbel akol ba bel akolaan, amabalwoos ane: ‘Taalanyeeny i nshaas, ikaam ndamon phaangieem ambaak adiim!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Mbok mintshiin, ndes’bulwoos mbè, nshaas mubwiik mul’kaal a dik ikaam i mwoot motsh ambey asakal’l ntem mwaan, a ntshwey mu bât kamadiph i idiph baaph mbè kabesamuk akal’l ntem mbi.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkwoon mu laphas la ngaang ladiim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Mbè key, ngaat mbè aal i phas i ngaang ishieeng, mbè adiim’s laphas lamotsh, kelatieem’s tey, amwoom mbûl antetsh aswoot busek shaang elaan lamone. <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Itaang ilaan lamon, ambok bakidj baan mbel akol ba belaan ibaan akolakol, amabalwoos ane: ‘Taalanyeeny i nshaas, ikaam ndamon laphas lieem la ngaang lambaak ladiim!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Mbok mintshiin, ndes’bulwoos mbè, nshaas mul aphiing bantshol ba Ntshièm ikaam mwoot a mbey esaan akal’l ntem.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkwoon mu mwân adiim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yish katwootaan kamotsh ane: “Ambabaak mwoot ambay i bân baan baphey ba baluung. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Mwân ankieek kalwoosaan ishanaan ane: ‘Taat, mpieek ikaphieem i budiy bwiit.’ Iphontshi taat kakaph’saan i bân baan baphey budiy bwaan. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />A mbis matu makieek, wey aku ankieek kakaphaan biket biaan bikim, kieenaan i phasiaan ikaam yetwoos a bol bweek’dj bumbaak kaany. Andwoon, kabutshiaan bikim bimbaakaan i biin i bât ba ntshak. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />A mbis a mbè aman biket bikim, ntshal ibwiik kayiing’liin a bol bukun, katetshaan amon maphetsh. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Kaphilaan mun ngun mu mwoot a bol bukun, ambaak esantom a mangwoon maan ikaam ibak ngul. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Ambaak esamuk adia iyaan ndwoom imbaak ngul india, ek mwoot mbè motsh kambaak amweek i biin mbi. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Ntshiin akun, katetshaan abok lakeny a bimweeny bimbaakaan amon, katwootaan ane: ‘Ben a ngun bakim babol taat besadia, basony busek, ibiek’dj binshaal, miin ndesawa i ntshal a ndey! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Ndekakal abol taat, namanwoos ane, taat namaakel bweph a bos bu Ntshièm akol a bos bwaa. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Ngwoon, kandesayeem’l kamotsh mbè umbok mbel ane mwânaa mbi. Ntshik muna nde motsh a ndieeng a ben a ngun baa.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Kakalaan abol ishanaan. Itaang imbaakaan mbè yaaph el a kaany i mbûl, ishanaan kamonaan, kashisaan, mweeng kangaat muun:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Kieenaan mbaang ikaam inyey, kambutaan angon kamotsh kanyutaan muny. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Mwân kanwoosaan ane: ‘Taat, namaakel bweph a bos bu Ntshièm akol a bos bwaa, kandesayeem’l kamotsh mbè umbok mbel ane mwânaa mbi.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Ek ishanaan kalwoosaan ben a ngun baan ane: ‘Yanyeeny bwaas i ndel musek, ndiing anyeeny; mbok anyeeny ikèt a nyeem akol masabaat a mateem. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Yanyeeny i mwân a ngweem ansek, ndiak’s anyeenyaan; telakel dweey di nshaas! <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Ikaam’i mbè mwânieem a nuung aku ambaak aman awa, ek kweey edi mwoony kamotsh, ambaak adiim, ek asol.’ Ngwoon, mamatetsh awok nshaas.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“A itaang ikun, mwân bukoos abol taat aku ambaak el ngwoon. Amwiyaan ikadj, antwoolaan akol mbûl, kawokaan ntshieem akol mamin. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Kabokaan mun a ngun motsh mbel, kamwuulaan ane: ‘Dweey key dinkeph’te?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Mun a ngun kankal’aan ane: ‘Mwânyo amanyikadj, ishô amandiak’s mwân a ngweem ansek, ikaam i mbè amamon mwânaan anyikadj i latok lasek.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />“Mwân bukoos kawokaan kaph, kabelaan mbok aying’l a mbûl. Ishanaan katowaan buseph ikaam imwoong mbè aying’l a mbûl. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Ek, mwân kakal’laan ishanaan ane: ‘Lieen, mitshi mialek’s mi mamiim akes ngun aaph mbè kanambel’k mikieetsh miaa mbi. Ek, kutshik ampieek mbè mwân a kam’dj ikaam nakel i miim dweey di nshaas i bakidj bieem mbi! <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Ek mwânaa aku amwiyaan ikadj, aan aman budiy bwaa i baat ba bikelel bibey, usandiak’s mwân a ngweem ansek!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Ishaan kanwoosaan ane: ‘Mwânieem,’ ‘ween umwak ntshieem andey, biku bikim bimiim i biin ibiaa. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Ek tanaph kakel dweey di nshaas, tamwok nshaas, ikaam i mbè mwânyo aku ambaak aawa, ek kweey edi mwoony, ambaak adiim, ek kweey aasol.’”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Nkwoon mu mbèk a manyaang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yish kalwoosaan bieentsh baan ane: “Mun budiy amabaak i mbèk biket biaan, kiy baan inwoos ane, mwoot akun esabuutsh biket biaa, <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />ntshiin, kumaan kambokaan mbel, esamuul ane: ‘Mwooy mes’miim awok besatwoot a dik diaa? Ndek mbok asween asuk biket, ikaam i mbè kulakas asuk biket bieem mbi.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Mbèk biket kadiwuusaan ane: ‘Kumieem el’kantaam’l ngun mweem. Nakwok’dj akel mbony? Abuun’l shin mbè, abieetsh ngwoon mbè, alwoom bât biket mbè, kandelayeedj mbi. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Mayee! Ndesayeeph mbokel miim akel! Mbè nadiim’s imbetieem, bi busek mbè bât bantshekantshey abol baan!”<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />“Katetshaan abok mun mwoot nkim mbel, bakim bambaak i mbat ikom abol kum. Kawuulaan mwoot bukoos ane: ‘Wedi mbat a mbadj key ikom abol kumieem?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Kankal’laan ane: ‘Nedi mbat a mbieen i sedj a oliiv kam iphey,’ mbèk biket kanwoosaan ane: ‘Lieen bwiik bu mbat iween iyin; twoos a shin bwaas, phuun kam.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Kawuulaan mwoot ampieen ane: ‘Ween udi mbat a mbadj keye?’ Kankal’laan ane: ‘Nedi mbat a bibweem bi shaang lasen’l lamotsh.’ Mbèk biket kanwoosaan ane: ‘Lieen bwiik bu mbat iween iyin,’ ‘phuun kam inaan.’”<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />“Iphontshi, kum kakasaan mbèk a manyaang lakeeng ikaam i manyaang maan. Bât ba shin itaang iku, bedi manyaang mabwiik a ntwoong’l a baan akol ibiek’dj, kaba mbok mintshiin i bân ba mwaany mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Ek miim ndes’bulwoos ane: “Aal anyeeny bukidj i ben budiy bu shin itaang iku, ikaam i mbè a itaang yil’buun ashil, bek bunyey a mambûl ma baan yoyoo. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Mwoot aku nkim edi imuk a biket bikieek, edi imuk kamotsh a biket binen; ek mwoot aaph mbè keyi imuk a biket bikieek, kaaph i kamotsh i imuk a biket binen mbi. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Mbè bwaal mbè kabumbaak ayeeph mbok atwoong i budiy bu makuus bu shin, nyeeny akwook’dj buyeek budiy bukwokwook? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Mbè kabumbaak ayeeph mbok atwoong i budiy bukan, nyeeny akwook’dj buyeek bi bisaal ibiin?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.13. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mt 6.24</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Kwa muna ngun mbè motsh akwook’dj akes bakum iphey ngun mbi; ikaam, abakabak’t motsh ambel iyeek’dj. Kabukwok’dj akes phas baan’i Ntshièm ngun mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phwa i twootsh ibol Yish.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mataay 11.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maak 10.11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Baphal’s bambaak amuk phas, amwook baan mwooy makun katetsh baan mbok asey Yish. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yish kabalwoosaan ane: “Bwiin, bât bes’ditol muna bât basek a miish ma bât, ek Ntshièm esayeeph mitem miin. Ikaam’i mbè bis’baan amon mun bi binen, kabiaaph i ngaang a miish ma Ntshièm mbi.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.16. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mt 11.12-13</ref>.</char>
    </note>“A itaang i mikieetsh mi Moos akol mikaan mi bangaang ba Ntshièm mimashaal suka nkil mu Yoon Mubatiis. To itaang iku mikim, lashaang lasek la bunyim bu Ntshièm bamalashaang’l a bât, mwoot aku nkim ambaak esanaan ikaam iying’l a bunyim bu Ntshièm. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.17. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:18">Mt 5.18</ref>.</char></note>Ek, bi bwool ikaam i mbè dik baan’i shin binshaam, ek kwa dweey mbè dimotsh di nkieetsh mu Moos diladiim mbi.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.18. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mt 5.32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1 Kol 7.10-11</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Nuung aku nkim esabel mwaam’shaan ankas atweem yeek’dj, asawoodj shaas, kamotsh nuung esatweem ngaat abieeng abol nwimiaan esawoodj shaas iyaan.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkwoon mu ndiy baan’i Lasalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Ambabaak ndiy a phas ambaak andiing mindel mi ngaang abwiik, kamotsh ambaak antwoos a mandiy ma ngaang matu makim, andia biliees bi ngaang. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Muna ntaan ambaak ambet abos bu mbûlaan diin diaan ambaak Lasalo. Latok laan lambaak layool i phot ibwiik. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Lasalo ambaak i nyiing adia biket bimbaak abwaak a meens ma ndiy. Kamotsh mboswoong imbaak imwiy alieeng photiaan.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />“Lasu liek’dj, muna ntaan kawawaan, bantshol kanaat baan akol Abalapham. Ndiy aku kawawaan, kaney baan. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Ek kamonaan imweeny a katey ka yoyoo; ankat’laan miish kamonaan Abalapham baan’i Lasalo akolaan. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Ngwoon ndiy a phas kabokaan dweey: ‘Taat Abalapham, mpwook’s mweeng! Tom lasalo, anwim sos a nyeem mwaan a maas ikaam inkitsh inem, ikaam ndesamon imweeny a tey tuku!’<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />“Ek Abalapham kankal’laan ane: ‘Mwânieem, yiph’l mbokambaakween i budiy bubwiik a nkwootsh, ek itaang ikun Lasalo ambaak i maphetsh mabwiik. Ek alwool aku, edi nshaas ayè ngo, ek ween wamon imweeny inoon’l. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Kamotsh, aphaang a biitiaa, e ibèk itadj; ngwoon, ba besamukieen to wony bos a ndwoon aal’k to ndwoon bos a wony, kabakwook’dj ashaam a ibèk iku mbi.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Mun budiy kanwoosaan ane: ‘Taat, ndes’kawoong, tom lasalo a mbul a taat, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />ndedi bân ba meey bataan, lasalo abalwoos ikaam i mbè kabiik ibaan a imbet iku imaphetsh mbi.’<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />“Ek Abalapham kankal’laan ane: ‘Bân ba nyo bedi Moos baan’i bangaang ba ntshièm, babawoom’k.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Muna budiy kanwoosaan ane: ‘Mbi taat Abalapham, kabisayeem’l mbi. Ek mbè mwoot motsh abuum to ilweem, bel’kakal’l mitem mibaan.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Ek Abalapham kanwoosaan ane: ‘Mbè bananyo kabamuk’dj awoom’k Moos baan’i bangaang ba ntshièm aal’k mbè mwoot abuum to ilweem kabel amwoom’k mbi.’”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Ilwoong i Yish idik di bikelel bibey i mweeng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mataay 18.6-7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:22">21.22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Maak 9.42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yish kalwoosaan bieentsh baan ane: “Ekaal mwooy mesatshitsh mwoot ikaami mbè akel bweph. Ek maphetsh maal abol mwoot esaswoot mbè ibiek’dj bakel bweph! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Bi busek mbè; bamankaan mbôk minen a ikool’l, baneph mbok a ntshal aneph’t ikaam i mbè kaal’k itwoom’t i motsh a ndieeng a bân bakieek bakun mbi. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.3. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mt 18.15</ref>.</char></note>Buyeeph anyeeny mbok dibak!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Mbè mwânyo aal’k pheengaa akel bweph, mweek ilwoong. Mbè akal’l ikeleliaan ibey, umwok’s mweeng. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Mbè akes bweph phweet shaam’l a lasu lantshiin, kamotsh mbè yikadj phweet mikim amwilwoos ane: ‘Nakal’l bikelel bieem,’ ween umwok’s mweeng.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilwoong idik di yim’s</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Batom kalwoos baan Kum ane: “Phet’l yim’siit.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Kum kabakal’laan ane: “Mbè bwaal i yim’s ikieek muna lashaang la mutaal, bunaph kalwoos ntey munen mu fiink muku ane: ‘Diphuun’l, yaak wediwoon a idiph!’ Mumabuwoom’k.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dweey dikel di mun ngun mu Ntshièm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Mbè biaal mbè ane, motsh a ndieengiin edi mun a ngun esabuun’l shin, ambak twoong a nyamiaa. Itaang esaan ikadj to ngwoon, ukwook’dj anwoos ane ya bwaas wishim’k a meense ikaam idia? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Kabiangwoos mbi, aan anwokanwoos ane: ‘Ndaam’s biket bidia, kamotsh, sek’s mindel ikaam i mbè umpieek bi bidia, itaang is’miin adia, nanyo; ambis akun, udiakadia, unyo iween a phweetaa.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Akwook’dj akas lakeeng abol nso akun ikaam awom’k mikieetsh miaane? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />I bwiin kamotsh bu mbok mintshiin; el’bwiin akel bikim bil’miim butom, twoot anyeeny ane: ‘Te basow ba bukal; tamaakel ngun mwiit.’”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esabo ben a badj ishieeng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yish ambaak esieyeentsh bos a Yelushalem, kashamaan a phaang minel mi Samaliy baan’i Ngaleel. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Amwing’laan a bol ibweek’dj, ben a bwaal bu badj ishieeng kiy baan imoonsiaan. Kayeem’t baan a kaany <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />kamotsh katetsh baan abok mbel angon ane: “Yish! Ntaang’dj! Tawok’s mweeng!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17.14. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lew 14.1-32</ref>.</char>
    </note>Ama aan bamon, kabalwoosaan ane: “Yaakanyeeny abol batwootsh ba Ntshièm.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Itaang imbaak baan bienyeentsh, kawook baan busek. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Motsh a ndieeng a baan amonaan ane awok busek, kiyaan ikadj a esasem’l Ntshièm i dweey dinoon’l. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Kadibokaan a mateem ma Yish, bos aphum’l a shin, esankas lakeeng. Mwoot akun ambaak mun’a Samaliy. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yish kamuulaan ane: “Bakun bakim ishieeng kabawok’dj buseke; ibiek’dj bamotsh diph bakwey? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Kway ibiek’dj bamotsh bamwikas lakeeng abol Ntshièm, atey mweentshambaang aku?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />A mbis akun Yish kanwoosaan ane: “Kat a shin yaak, yim’siaa yaphaans.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpwiidj a bunyim bu Ntshièm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mataay 24.23-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">24.37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Baphal’s kawuul baan Yish ane, bunyim bu Ntshièm buliy itaang key? Aan kabakal’laan ane: “Bunyim bu Ntshièm kabuliy muna iket isamon bât i miish mbi. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Kabel atwoot ane: ‘Lieen anyeeny el ayè’ aal’k: ‘Ela yeenaa,’ ikaam i mbè, yeephanyeeny ane, bunyim bu Ntshièm bul a ndieengiin.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />A mbis akun, Yish kalwoosaan bieentsh baan ane: “Matu mel’kiy mel’bwiin awok nyiing amon lasu lamotsh la Mwân a Mwoot, ek kabul amon mbi. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Bât bel’bulwoos ane: ‘El ayenaa!’ Aal’k ane: ‘El ayè!’ Ek kabween’k mbi, kabween’k mbaang ambis a bât baku mbi. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Mbok mintshiin angaam’k ntshetsh a dik, angaam’s to mbwoom baan’i mbwoom, ntshiin mbok elaal Mwân a Mwoot a lasu laan. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ek bi busek mbè amanamon maphetsh mabwiik kamotsh bamambiim’l a bol bât ba nkil muku. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.26. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Matt 6.5-8</ref>.</char></note>Mwooy makephetsh’dj a itaang ibol Now mekakeph’t mbok mintshiin a matu ma Mwân a Mwoot. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.27. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:6-24">Matt 7.6-24</ref>.</char></note>Bât bambaak adia, banyo, bantweem baat, bantom bân ba baan a malaatsh shaang lasu lambaak Now aying’l a bwaat: mbul a nwiim kanowaan, ngus kadiaak muun bât bakim. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.28. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20-19:25">Matt 18.20—19.25</ref>.</char></note>Bimbaak mbok mintshiin a itaang i Loot. Bât bambaak adia, banyo, banswoom kamotsh bankaph, bambieetsh, bamwoon kamotsh bampik mambûl. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Ek, lasu latwoodj Loot a Sodoom, katey baan’i mbôk i tey kanow biin to dik muna mbul, kadiabiin bât bakim. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Bil’kakeph’t mbok mintshiin a lasu lel dilak Mwân a Mwoot.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17.31. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:17-18">Mt 24.17-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:15-16">Mak 13.15-16</ref>.</char>
    </note>“A lasu lakun, mwoot akun elaal a dik di mbûl kamotsh edi biket biaan a ngat a mbûl, kakum’k ikaam yebiswoot mbi! Mbok mintshiin, mwoot elaal a ngwoonaan, kelamon mbok akal a mbûlaan mbi. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.32. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:26">Matt 19.26</ref>.</char></note>Buyiph’lanyeeny mwaam’s abol Loot! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.33. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mt 10.39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16.25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mak 8.35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Lk 9.24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yn 12.25</ref>.</char></note>Mwoot akun elaswoot mbok aphaans mwoony mwaan el’kamudiim’s; ek mwoot akun eladiim’s mwoony mwaan el’kamuphaans. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Ndes’kabulwoos, a butu bukun, bât baphey belaal a ilak intshiin: batokatol motsh banieem’l iyek’dj. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Baat baphey belaal a idiing besatow shaang: batokatol motsh banieem’l iyeek’dj. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Baluung baphey belaal a ngwoon: batokatol motsh banieem’l iyeek’dj.”<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Bieentsh kawuul baan Yish ane: “Kum, bilakeph’t kakwey?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Yish kabakal’laan ane: “A imbet ikun ilaal ndju, ntshiin imbet ilakwoom’k mayophaang.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Nkwoon mu ngaat a bweel baan’i kom’l ambey</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yish ambaak ababok’s nkwoon muku ikaam i mbè abalak ane bambaak i dweey dilwoom Ntshièm itaang ikim, kabakal’k a mbis mbi. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Kabalwoosaan ane: “Ambabaak kom’l a bol ibwek’dj, kambaak es’ditshik a mwooy ma Ntshièm mbi, kamotsh kambaak atshiin mwoot mbè motsh mbi. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Ambabaak kamotsh a bol bukun buntshiin ngaat a ngweel ambaak amwinwoos phweet mikim ane: ‘Mbas ikaam i mpisieem aku!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />To kaany aku mikim, kom’l ambaak ambel, ntshiin akun kadilwoosaan ane: ‘Dikwook, ntem mweem kamusatshiin Ntshièm mbi, kamotsh kandesamuk aal i mwoot akolieem mbi, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />ek mbok aku mbè ngaat aku a ngweel esambok latwoot, ndekakel mbokesaan alwoom, ikaam i mbè kiik kamotsh imbok latwoot mbi!’”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Ngwoon Kum katwootaan kamotsh ane: “Woom’k anyeeny mbok esatwoot kom’l aku ambey. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />I Ntshièm kakwook’dj atwoos bât bansolaan itaang is’baan alel butu i mwaanye? Akwook’dj aman su ikaam ibayaase? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Ndes’bulwoos ane: el’kabatwoos mbaang. Ek, itaang ilikadj Mwân a Mwoot, atokatotaan ben yim’s a shin a maane?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkwoon mu mufal’s baan’i nkweek minaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Bât bambakayeeph ane tesakel imuk i Ntshièm, bankas abètsh ibiek’dj, Yish kabok’saan nkwoon imweek’dj ane: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Bât baphey kieen baan bos a Ntuum ikaamielwoom Ntshièm: motsh ambaak mufal’s, iyiek’dj ambaak nkweek minaam.<verse eid="LUK 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />“Mufal’s ambaak ayeem a dik a isek esalwoom Ntshièm ngo: ‘Maye! Ntshièmieem, ndes’kakas lakeeng ikaam i mbè kandaaph muna bât baku bakim bamwaak: bieem, bât babey akol biphaang’t. Ndesakas lakeeng kamotsh ikaam i mbè kandaaph muna nkweek minaam aku mbi. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Namwaak nankin biket bidia matu maphey a ndieeng labiing kamotsh ndesayeek iteny imotsh i ishieeng i biket bieem bikim bi miim ibiin.’<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />“Nkweek minaam kayem’taan kaany, kambaak ayeem’l asheen’l miish a dik mbi, ek ambaak amadibak lo a laang la tol esatwoot ane: ‘Ntshièmieem, mpwook’s mweeng, ikaam i mbè nde mwoot ambey!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.14. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mt 23.12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Lk 14.11</ref>.</char></note><char style="wj" closed="false">Yish kabalwoosaan kamotsh ane: “Ikakaam, Ntshièm amawok’s nkweek minaam mweeng, ikaam ambaak mwoot ansek a miish ma Ntshièm, kakalaan a bol bwaan. Ek Ntshièm kawok’s muphal’s mweeng mbi. Ntshiin akun, mwoot es’diwoot bankukankum’s, ek mwoot es’dikum’s bampekampet’l.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esashaak’s bân bakieek</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mataay 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maak 10.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Bât bambaak bamwiy i bân abol Yish ikaam i mbè abashaak’s. Bieentsh amwoony baan ngwoon, katetsh baan abaphaang’s buluung, <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />ek Yish kabokaan bieentsh baan mbel, kabalwoosaan ane: “Lieem’l anyeeny bân bakieek biy a miim! Kabubakiny’k mbi, ikaam i mbè bunyim bu Ntshièm bu bu bât besaphwaans’i bân bakieek. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Ikakaam, ndes’bulwoos mbè, mwoot esabel mbok anyey buum bu Ntshièm muna mwân ankieek, kelaying’l mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndiy a ilanuung</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mataay 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maak 10.17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Motsh a ndieeng a bakum ba Yudey kawuulaan Yish ane: “Ntaang’dj ansek, nakwok’dj akel mbony ikaam imon mwoony mu yoyoo?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yish kankal’laan ane: “Usambok mbel ane, mwoot ansek ikaam i yey?” “Kwa mwoot ansek mbè motsh a shin itaang mbi, Ntshièm anamieet ntshaan mwoot ansek. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.20. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Eks 20.12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Dtn 5.16-20</ref>.</char></note><char style="wj" closed="false">Usayeeph mikieetsh mi Ntshièm miku: ‘Kukwook’dj akel buphaang’t mbi, kukwook’dj adiaak mwoot, kukwook’dj asheen, kukwook’dj abaang’s mwânyo, utshiin ishô baan’i nyo.’”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Mwoot kankal’laan ane: “Namaatshik mikieetsh a ikelel to bulieeng bweem.” <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yish awok’diaan ngwoon, kanwoosaan ane: “Wanyeen dweey dimotsh kamotsh: kaph biket bikim bi ween i biin, ukaph’s ben a ntaan, ntshiin mbè ukaal’i ikaph inen a dik; ambis akun, ya windeph.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Ek mwoot amwookaan mwooy maku, kawokaan buphol, ikaam i mbè ambaak ndiy anen.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yish amonaan mbè awok buphol, katwootaan ane: “Bi ngon ikaam i mbè bât bedi budiy baying’l a bunyim bu Ntshièm! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Ek bi bwool ikaam i nyam anen mun kameel ashaam a diish ndwoong a ntshwey mu ndiy aying’l a bunyim bu Ntshièm.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Bât bambaak amwoom’k kamuul baan ane: “Ek iphontshi, nyeeny akwook’dj aphaan?” <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yish kabakal’laan ane: “Dweey di bunoon’l a miish ma bât, di bwool a miish ma Ntshièm.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Petelo kanwoosaan ane: “Wom’k, talieem’l bikim bimbaak biit i biin ikaam ilaph.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yish kankal’laan ane: “Ikakaam,” “ndes’bulwoos dweey dikwook mbè mwoot aku nkim anieem’l mbûlaan, mwam’shaan, babinaan, bapheeng baan, babotsh baan aal’k bân baan ikaam i bunyim bu Ntshièm <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />ekaal’i biket bibwiik to lwool aku, kamotsh a matu mesiyi, ekaal’i mwoony mu yoyoo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esatwoot phweet anset idik di iwa yaan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mataay 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maak 10.32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yish kabokaan bieentsh baan ishieeng baphey mbel a yik’l, kabalwoosaan ane: “Woom’k anyeeny! Telaphet bos a Yelushaleem, ntshiin imbet yilayeem’l mwooy makim maphuun’dj bangaang ba ntshièm idik di Mwân a Mwoot. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Baniekanieem’l a mio mi bât babey, bansèkansèy, bantwokantwoon mishiing, kamotsh bantukantuuny masony. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Bambokambol kodj kamotsh bandiakandiaak. Lasu lanseet abukabuum to iwa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Ek bieentsh kabawok dweey mbè dimotsh mbi; kabawok mbok ambaak atwoot nkwoon mukun mbi, kabayeeph mbè ane Yish esatwoot dweey key mbi.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esabo mwoot awa miish</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mataay 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maak 10.46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Yish antwoolaan akol a Yeliko, ambabaak mwoot awa miish ashik a nkol mu mbok, asalwoom bât biket. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Amwokaan ntshey a bât isiesheem, kawuulaan ane: “Dweey key dinkeph’t?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Kanwoos baan ane: “Yish mun a Nasaleet es’kieshaam.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Kabolaan nwool ane: “Yish! Mwân abol Davidj, mpwok’s mweeng!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Ba bambaak a bos kaphaang’s baan buluung ikaam i mbè ashaal phol. Ek kakasaan abol nwool munoon’l ane: “Mwân abol Davidj, mpwok’s mweeng!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Ngwoon Yish kayeem’taan, kabatomaan ikaam i mbè binaatsh. Ansèm’s mun a miish mawa akolaan, Yish kamuulaan ane: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Usamuk mbè ane nakes yeye?” Kankal’laan ane.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">“Kum,” “Kel mbok a mbè ane namon.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yish kanwoosaan ane: “Tieeng’l miish! Yim’siaa yaphaans.” <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Itaang intshiin, miish maan katieeng’l maan, kamotsh kalaphaan Yish yiesèm’l Ntshièm. Twoong mikim amoniin ngwoon, iyin katetshiin asem’l Ntshièm.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yish baan’i Sakeey</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yish kaying’laan a bol bu Yeliko, kashamaan a buun. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Andwoon, ambabaak mwoot a imbet ikun diin diaan Sakeey. Ambaak kum a babwek minaam, kamotsh ambaak ndiy anen. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Ambakaswoot ikaam imoons i Yish, ek kamon bwaany bumon mbi, ikaam i twoong a bât imbaak andaan; mbok aku mbè ambaak mwoot ankwiy. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Ngwoon, kieenaan mbaang a bos ikaam ibaan a dik di ntey mu sikomool, ikaam ilieen Yish anaph ashaam andaan. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Yish antwoolaan a imbet iku, kasheen’laan miish, kalwoosaan Sakeey ane: “Sakeey, kum a shin bwaas, ikaam i mbè ndedi i nyiing aying’l a mbûlaa alwool.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Ngwoon Sakeey kakumaan a shin bwaas, kanyeyaan i nshaas mubwiik. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Bakim amon baan ngwoon, katetsh baan atieen Yish; besatwoot ane: “Mwoot aku anyetwoos abol mwoot ambey!”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Ek Sakeey kayeem’taan a bos bu Kum, kanwoosaan ane: “Kum, wok, ndekayeek ben a ntaan iteny i biket bieem, mbè namaatol phas ibwiik abol mwoot, nekankas iyin phweet iney.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yish kanwoosaan ane: “Alwool aku, mwoony mwaying’l a ngat a mbûl aku, ikaam i mbè, i ween u mun ilwootsh i Abalapham. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.10. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:10">Mt 18.10</ref>.</char></note>Ikaam’i mbè Mwân a Mwoot ayim’s ikaam iswoot bât bambaak badiim.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkwoon mu phas i ngaang ishieeng</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mataay 25.14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Itaang imbaak bât besawoom’k mwooy maku, Yish kababok’saan nkwoon muku. Ikaam bambaak akol a Yelushaleem, bât bambaphis ane bunyim bu Ntshièm bunaph’dj kasol a itaang intshiin. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Yish kabalwoosaan ane: “Mwoot a ben ilwootsh i budiy ambaak esieyeentsh bos a shin iyiek’dj bu itaan ikaam i biemweek bunyim; amwikadj ambis akun. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />A bos bu mbè el’kieen, amabok ben a ngun baan isheeng mbel, kayeekaan mun mwoot laphas la ngaang lamotsh, kamotsh kabalwoosaan ane: ‘Kel anyeeny bungangaang i phas iku shaang el’miim ikadj.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Ek bât ba shinaan bambakambim’l, katom baan bât ambisaan ikaam itwoot ane: ‘Katamuk’dj mbè mwoot aku aal nyimiit mbi.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Idim i ngwoos kamweek baan bunyim, kiyaan ikadj a shinaan, kabokaan ben a ngun bambaakaan ayeek phas mbel. Ambaak esamuk ayeeph mbè mwoot nkim amon mateem mbadj key i phas ikun. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Mwoot a bukoos kiyaan, kanwoosaan ane: ‘Kum, laphas lamotsh lamaween ampieek lamabot iyeekdj ishieeng.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Kum kanwoosaan ane: ‘Wakel busek,’ ween u mun a ngun ansek; ‘ikaam i mbè umbabaak i ntem musek a biket bikieek, natshikatshik nguph’lanoph a minuung ishieeng.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Mwoot ampieen kiyaan, kanwoosaan ane: ‘Kum, laphas lamabot iyiek’dj itaan.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Kum kalwoosaan wey akun ane: ‘Ween, ndatshik nguph’lanoph a minuung mitaan.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />“Iyek’dj kiyaan, kanwoosaan ane: ‘Kum, laphas laa la ngaang lampieek’dween kaalul; nambaak nalakaan a ishaan nalashwey. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Nambaak nesawok butet, ikaam i mbè ween u mwoot a ya inoon’l, umwaak untol phas yaaph ween mbè kulwoon’dj, amwaak unkun biket biaaph ween mbè kuwoon’dj.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Kum kanwoosaan ane: ‘Ween u mun a ngun isoph, ndelaluum’s to mwooy mesatow to muny mwaa! Umbakayeph ane nde mwoot a yay inoon’l, esatol phas yaaph mbè kanalwoon’dj, kamotsh ndesakun biket biaaph mbè kanawoon’dj. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Ikaam’i yey umbaak watshik phasieem a ilwoontsh? Ngwoon amwiy miim ikadj, unaph kankas i mateem.’<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />“Imbet intshiin kalwoosaan bakun bambaak andaan ane: ‘Ntaam’dj anyeeny laphas lakun, buyeek anyeeny wey akun edi ishieeng.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Kanwoos baan ane: ‘Kum, aan amatamon phas iyiek’dj ishieeng!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.26. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mt 13.12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mak 4.25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Lk 8.18</ref>.</char></note>Kankal’laan ane: ‘Ndes’bulwoos mbè mwoot aku nkim edi iket, bamwekamweek iyek’dj; ek mwoot aku ankim aaph iket bantakantaam’l aal’k ikieek iyaan i yiin. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Ek baphis bieem bambaak abel mbè kandaal’k nyim a baan mbi, yanyeeny i baan ayè, bubadiaak a miish mieem!’”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish ayingl i buum a Yelushalem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mataay 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maak 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoon 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yish amaans’diaan atwoot dweey dikun, ambaak esieyeentsh a bos bu twoong a bât ikaam iphet bos a Yelushaleem. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Intaang intwool baan akolakol i Bet’faaj i Betaniy, a Nkwootsh mu Oliiv, katomaan bieentsh baan baphey ane: <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />“Yaakanyeeny a bol bukun bul a bos bwiin. El’bwiin atwool a bol bukun, butokatotaan mwân a mpuund akaan a mwaan, aaph mbè mwoot mbè motsh katshik abaan mbi. Butuung’l, bwinaatsh ayè. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Mbè mwoot abuwuul ane, busatuung’l ikaam i yey. Bunkal’l ane, Kum edi nyiingaan.”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Bambaakaan atom kieen baan, bamatotaan mbok mintshiin abalwoos’dj Yish. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Ambaak baan basatuung’l mwân a puund, bakumiaan bamabawuul ane: “Busatuung’l ikaam i yey?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Bamabakal’l ane: “Ikaam’i mbè Kum edi nyiingaan,” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />iphontshi kalaat baan mwân a mpuund abol Yish; bamaphweedj mindel mibaan a dik di nyam, kabaans baan Yish a dik diaan. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Ambaak Yish yesheem, bât bamawaadj mindel mibaan a mbok.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Yish ambaak esikwim to Nkwootsh mu Oliiv, twoong mikim a bieentsh baan bambaak i nshaas, katetsh baan asem’l Ntshièm i dweey dinoon’l ikaam i makam’l makim mamwoony baan. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.38. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Ntm 118.26</ref>.</char></note>Bambaak besatwoot ane: “Ntshièm ashaak’s kum akun amwiy a diin di Kum! Nkit’l mwaal a dik, buum abol Ntshièm el membet ma dik di kaany!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Baphal’s biek’dj bambaak aphiing a twoong a bât, kalwoos baan Yish ane: “Ntaang’dj,” “lwoos bieentsh baa bashaal phol!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yish amabakal’l ane: “Ndes’bushaak’s mbè ane, mbè bashaal phol, mbôk insekansem’l!”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish alel ikaam i Yelushalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Yish antwolaan akol a Yelushalem, amonaan bol, kaleelaan idik di buun, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />esatwoot ane: “Tshik mbè umbaak wawok, lasu lakun, unaph’dj amon nkit’l mbony! Ek iphontshi, mwooy makun ma mashaal maswaam a miish maa! <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Ikaam’i mbè matu mel’kiy idik diaa melaal bashaang’dj baa bampik mbaan, bamalèdj lakat, bamadiph a ngat mabieen, bamayim’k biaas bikim kamotsh. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Babwokabwoong’l nkimwaa, ween i bân baa, badiakadiaak bakim bel a ngat, kabelalieem’s mbôk mbè motsh yanyeeng a dik di iyiek’dj mbi. Ikaam’i mbè kuyeeph’dj itaang imbaak Ntshièm anyiyaas mbi!”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish ayeen a Ntuum</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mataay 21.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maak 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-16">Yoon 2.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Yish anyiing’laan a ngat a Ntuum, katetshaan abieeng ben bungangaang, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.46. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Yesh 56.7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Yel 7.11</ref>.</char></note>amabalwoos ane: “A nkaan mu Ntshièm bamaphuun ane: ‘Mbûlieem ilaal mbûl a malwoom.’ Ek bwiin, bwayiphis indiy i bieem banen!”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.47. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 21:37">Lk 21.37</ref>.</char>
    </note>Yish ambaak anwoong’s matu makim a Ntuum. Bakum ba batwootsh banen, akol bayeeph ba mikieetsh, baan’i bakum i minuung bambaak besaswoot mbok andiaak, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />ek kabamon mbok andiaak mbi, ikaam i mbè bât bakim bambaak besamwoom’k i lwook labwiik.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Bunoon’l bu Yish busiy to kweey</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mataay 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maak 11.27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Lasu liek’dj, Yish ambaak esalwoong’s bât kamotsh esashaang’l lashaang lasek a Ntuum. Bakum ba batwootsh akol bayeeph mikieetsh kiy baan i bakom’l akolaan <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />besamuul ane: “Tshik talwoos usakel mwooy maku i bunoon’l key? Nyeeny amayeek bunoon’l bukel ibuun mwooy maku?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yish kabakal’laan ane: “I miim ndedi dweey dibuwuul. Ndwoos anyeeny, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />imbet key yidj mitaam’s mi Yoon, to bol Ntshièm mbè to bât?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Ek katetsh baan abok keny banamieet ane: “Mbè tatwoot ane: ‘To bol Ntshièm,’ el’katawuul ane: ‘Bubeedj ayim’s mwooy ma mabulwoos’dj Yoon idik di yey?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Ek mbè tatwoot ane: ‘To bât,’ bât bakim bel’katawuph’l mbôk ikaam itadiaak, ikaam i mbè bât baku bamayim’s ane, Yoon ambaak ngaang a Ntshièm.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Ngwoon kaneph baan akal’l ane: “Katesayeeph imbet yidj bunoon’l bwaan mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yish amabakal’l ane: “I miim kandel bulwoos imbet yesiy bunoon’l bus’miim ayaat ibuun ngun mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkwoon mu mun a ngun ambey</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mataay 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maak 12.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20.9. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1">Yesh 5.1</ref>.</char>
    </note>Yish kababok’saan nkwoon ane: “Ambabaak mwoot ambaak awoon ntey mwaan mu nviny a ngwoonaan; kamulieem’saan mun a ngun, kieenaan bos a lieen la matu mabwiik. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />A itaang ikun ndwoom, katomaan mwoot abol mun a ngun ikaam i mbè antom’s ikaph i ndwoom’i ntey mwaan. Ek mun a ngun kambolaan busudj, kankasaan mio bwaang. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Kum a ngwoon katomaan kamotsh mun a ngun iyek’dj, ek wey aku kambol baan busudj kamotsh, kantwoon baan mishing kamotsh kambieeng baan mio bwaang. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Katomaan kamotsh mwoot anseet; wey aku kanèm’s baan, kamotsh kampuul baan a buseph. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Mun a ngwoon kadiwuusaan ane: ‘Nakwok’dj akel mbony? Ndel kabatom’s mwânieem a nuung imuk; kat mbè bakwook’dj antshiin!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Ek ben a ngun amwoony baan mwân aku, kadilwoos baan ane: ‘Lieen anyeeny wey elashaal kum bikek a bos bu lieen. Tandiaak anyeeny, ikaam i mbè ngwoon ishaal iyiit!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Ngwoon kambieeng baan a ngwoon, kamotsh kandiaak baan.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Yish kabawuulaan ane: “Mun a ngwoon akwook’dj bakes yey?” <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />“El’kiy anamieet ikaam idiaak ben a ngun bakun, aneph ayeek ben a ngun ibiek’dj ngwoonaan.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Bât amwook baan dweey diku, katwoot baan ane: “Ntshièm kakel’k ngwoon mbi!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20.17. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Ntm 118.22</ref>.</char>
    </note>Ek Yish kabalieenaan miish, kabawulaan ane: “Dweey diku di nkaan mu Ntshièm disalak key?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Imèny ilieem’dj baan abol baphik ba mbûl</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">imaphil imèny i ngaang abwiik.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Mwoot elabwaak adik di imèny ikun ambat biteny, kamotsh mbè imèny iku ibwaak adik di mwoot, inshakanshaas’l.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Naam mwalèy abol Kayis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mataay 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maak 12.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Bayeeph mikieetsh akol batwootsh banen ba Ntshièm kaswoot baan mbok ayaat Yish a itaang intshiin, ikaam i mbè bambaak bayeeph ane nkwoon muku amababok’s baan; ek kawok baan bât butet. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Itaang intshiin, katetsh baan alieen Yish akolakol, katom baan bât akolaan ikaam i mbè bawok mwooy mesaan atwoot, baan bambaak bes’dikel muna bât basek. Bât baku bambaak besamuk awuul Yish dweey ikaam inkotsh, ikaam i mbè bamon bwaany bumpul a mio mi nguph’lanoph. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Ngwoon bât bakun kawuul baan Yish ane: “Ntaang’dj, tesayeeph ane mwooy mesween atwoot baan’i ma mesween alwoong’s me busek, kusaluum’s mwoot mbi, ek usalwoong’s mwooy makwook mesamuk Ntshièm. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Talwoos, nkieetsh musalwoong mbè biit alièm’s Kayis minaam mbè mbony?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Ek mbok aku mbè Yish ambaak esayeeph lanyaany la baan, kabalwoosaan ane: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Ndak anyeeny laphas lamotsh. Iphwa baan’i miin mampuun baan, bi bi nyeeny?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Kakal’l baan ane: “Bi bibol Kayis.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Ngwoon Yish kabalwoosaan ane: “Yeek anyeeny Kayis ibiaan, buyeek Ntshièm ibiaan.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Kabamon mbok angaat a mwooy mabey mbi, a mbok ambaakaan esatwoot a bos bu bât. Ek, mikal’l miaan mimabakam’s kamotsh kashaal baan phol.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muul a dweey di mibuum’dj mi midju</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mataay 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maak 12.18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20.27. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">Bik 23.8</ref>.</char>
    </note>Basadok bakieek, baan besabok miaang ane kwa mibuum’dj mi to iwa mbi, kiy baan akol a Yish, kamuul baan ane: <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.28. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Dtn 25.5</ref>.</char></note>“Ntaang’dj, Moos amatayeek nkieetsh muku mwaphuun ane: ‘Mbè nuung aal i mwân a baan angwa, answool ngaat aaph abot mwân, bi busek mbè mwân a baan akit ngaat akun ikaam i mbè babotiaan bân belaal a diin di mwân inaan amwa.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Ek, imbabaak baluung shaam’l ba ikuun imotsh. Mwân bukoos katweemaan ngaat, ek kawawaan aaph abot mwân. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Wey ampieen kakitaan ngaat a ngweel, iyaan kawawaan aaph abot mwân, <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />i wey anseet kakelaan mbok mintshiin suk wey anshaam’l, kawa baan bakim aaph abot bân. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Mom a mom, ngaat kawawaan iyaan. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Iphontshi lasu lelabuum bât to iwa, nyeeny elatol ngaat akun? Ikaam’i mbè nkim mubaan shaam’l bamanyeeph muna mwam’s a baan.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yish kabakal’laan ane: “Baluung i baat ba nkil muku bes’katweem kamotsh bankas atweem’s bân ba baan, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />ek baluung i baat belasuw makaam ikaam ibuum to iwa, ikaam itwoos a nkil mu yemayeem kabel ditweem’s mbi. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Kabel akas awa kamotsh mbi, baphwakaphwaans i bantshol. Belaphil bân ba Ntshièm, ikaam i mbè ababuum’s to iwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.37. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Eks 3.6</ref>.</char></note>Ek Moos esatwoot dikwook ane, bât baawa babukabuum to iwa. Ek a nkaan musatwoot dweey di ishuung’i tey, esabok Kum mbel ane: ‘Ntshièm abol Abalapham, Ntshièm abol Isak akol Ntshièm a Yakob.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Ntshièm ka Ntshièm a bât bawa mbi, ek Ntshièm a bât ba mwoony, ikaam i mbè idik diaan, bât bakim bedi mwoony a bos bwaan.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Bayeeph ibiek’dj ba mikieetsh kankal’l baan ane: “Ntaang’dj, watwoot busek!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Ikaam kwa mwoot mbè motsh akieek’dj mbokamuul dweey kamotsh mbi.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muul idik di Kilist</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mataay 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maak 12.35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yish kabawuulaan ane: “Bwaany key mbè tatwoot ane Kilist mwân abol Davidj? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.42. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Ntm 110.1</ref>.</char></note>Ikaam’i mbè Davidj esatwoot anamieet a nkaan mu ntshieem ane:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Kum amalwoos Kumieem ane:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">Ya witwoos a lo lieem la ikat<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />shaang el’miim atshik baphis baa a shin mateem maa.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Davidj amambok mbel ane ‘Kum’; bwaany key mbè aan aneph aphil mwânaan?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esayaat bayeeph mikieetsh lo a ito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mataay 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maak 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Itaang imbaak bât bakim besamwoom’k, Yish kalwoosaan bieentsh baan ane: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Bwaal anyeeny i bwaany a bos bu baphuuny mikieetsh, baan besamuk abuung i ntshak itadj, kamotsh besamuk mbè bamabawuum’l i itshiiny a mandiy ma imbwoom, besamuk atwoos a mandiy mabukoos a mambûl ma Ntshièm baan’i mandiy ma bukum a itaang i nshaas; <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />bantaam’l baat bawees baluung bikim bi baan i biin, kamotsh bankel malwoom matadj ikaam i mbè babamon. Ikaam’i mwooy maku bek baluum’s i diish dinoon’l bamon imweny!”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Naam mu ngaat a bweel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Maak 12.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yish amalieen akolaan, kamonaan mbok ambaak badiy besalieem’l minaam mibaan a ngat a ikwoom i minaam a mbûl a Ntshièm, <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />kamonaan kamotsh ngaat a ngweel a ntaan ambaak esabok phasiaan iphey i ngaang mikieek a ikwoom. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Katwotaan ane: “Ikakaam ndes’bulwoos mbè ane, ngaat aku a ngweel amalèy naam musek mwaalek bât baku bakim. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Ikaam’i mbè badiy baku bakim bamaalèy naam mubukal mwaaph i ngaang, ek aan, i ntaan mwaan amalèy bikim bimbaakaan i biin ikaam idia.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esashaang’l mibwoong’dj mi Ntuum</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-8">Mataay 24.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-8">Maak 13.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Bât bakieek aphiing bieentsh baan bambaak besatwoot idik di Ntuum ane, mumbaak mu musek mwaaphik i mbôk i ngaang yaswoong, mwaphik busek akol biket bisek bimbaak alièm’l abol Ntshièm. Ek Yish kabalwoosaan ane: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Itaang yil’kieem’l mbè ane biku bikim bis’bwiin amon, kabilaal kamotsh mbi, mbè mbôk kayilaal a dik di yeek’dj mbi. Mun mbôk mikim yil’kaal yabwees a shin.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maphetsh baan’i buso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mataay 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maak 13.3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Bieentsh kawuul baan Yish kamotsh ane: “Ntaang’dj,” mwooy maku, “melakeph’t itaang key? Ying’t key ilalak mbè itaang ilakeph’t mwooy maku yanyik akolakol?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yish kabakal’laan ane: “Buyeeph anyeeny; mwoot kabuphut’k mbi. Ikaam’i mbè babwiik bel’kiy a diin dieem, bantwoot ane: ‘Miim Kilist!’ Aal’k ane: ‘Itaang yayeem’l!’ Kabubalaph’k mbi. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />El’bwiin awok besatwoot idik di matuum akol loph, kabuwok butet mbi. Ikaam’i mbè bi busek bikeph’t ngwoon, ek kabilaal mom mu nkil muku mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />A mbis akun katwootaan ane: “Bumokamon mal manaany mal mieek’dj mamotsh; bukum bunaany i bukum bweek’dj bumotsh. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Shin inyikanyiing’l bwiik a mal makim, ntshal baan’i maal bikaal akat mal makim, ekaal kamotsh mwooy ma makam’l akol bing’t binoon’l bisokasol to dik. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Ek a bos bu mwooy maku makim, bel kabuyaat ikaam ibuphetsh, bamabulaat a shinangoong ikaam ibuluum’s, kamotsh bamabutshik a mwaat; bamabuyeem a bos bu bakum baan’i banguph’lanoph ikaam ibuluum’s idik dieem. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Mwooy maku makim makekakeph’t ikaam i mbè bwaal mun bitieen bât a bos bu baan. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.14. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Lk 12.11-12</ref>.</char></note>Kabusum’sk mitshwey miin ikaam i mbok el’bwiin alum’l mbi, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />ikaam miinamieet ndek buyeek mwooy baan’i bwaany a mbok a mbè ane, mpisiin mbè motsh kamon’k bwaany bu bukem’k aal’k abuphit’l mbi. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Bel’kabulièm’l abol babotsh biin, babiyiin, bapheeng biin, bayeeph’s biin baan’i bakidj biin kamotsh badiakadiaak bakieek aphiingiin. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Bakim bel’kabubiim’l idik dieem. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Ek kwa laphu mbè lamotsh la ntshwey mwiin leladiim mbi. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Ek Bwaalanyeeny i yintsh, neenganyeeny ntem; ntshiin mbok el’bwiin aphaans mioony miin.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esashaang’l mibwoongdj mi Yelushaleem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mataay 24.15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Maak 13.14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“El’bwiin amon baalèdj Yelushaleem lakat i ituum abol mayol, itaang ikun, buyekayeeph mbè ane iphontshi bel’kamibwoong’l. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Ngwoon, bât belaal a Yudey batshikatshiin bos mikwootsh; bât belaal a Yelushaleem batwey, bât belaal a mal makieek kabelamon mbokaying’l a bol bunen mbi. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.22. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 9:7">Os 9.7</ref>.</char></note> Ikaam’i mbè, matu makun, melaal ‘Matu ma maphetsh’, ikaam i mbè mwooy makim maphuuny’dj baan mel’kayeem’l. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Maphetsh key, a matu makun, ikaam i baat bedi mieem akol ba besanyoom’s bân mabieel! Ikaam’i mbè yil’kaal maphetsh mabwiik, a bol buku kamotsh kaph i Ntshièm yil’kadilak a bos bu bât baku. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Bek badiaak a mbaam mu ituum, bekieen i baan bamatshik a mwaat aphiing a mal makim; i Yelushalem bel kanyak mateem shaang elayeem’l itaang imabaan bayeek.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpwiidj a Mwân a Mwoot</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mataay 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maak 13.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.25. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Yesh 13.10</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 32:7">Eks 32.7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:31">Yel 2.31</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12-13">Mlk 6.12-13</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Yil’kaal bing’t a itaang, a ngwôn akol mieedj. A shin a maan, bât bel’kaal i mitem a dik a minuung mikim, kabel ayeeph mbok akel a bos bu maphaak ma ntshal minen. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Bât bel’kakel muna bamwakawa el’baan abok lakeny la mwooy melakeph’t a shin mikim, ikam’i mbè manoon’l ma dik manyikanyiing’l. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.27. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7.13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Mlk 1.7</ref>.</char></note>A mbis akun, bumokamon Mwân a Mwoot antwool a mashieem, i manoon’l mabwiik akol buum. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Mwooy maku el’maan atetsh akeph’t, busweeng mitshwey kamotsh bwaal i ntem ngon, ikaam i mbè mitwoodj miin mi busow miaanyik akolakol.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lashaang la ntey mu nfiink</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mataay 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maak 13.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />A mbis akun, Yish kabok’saan bieentsh baan nkwoon ane: “Lieen anyeeny ntey mu nfiink aal’k mitey mieek’dj mimotsh. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Es’bwiin amon kas yatetsh mbok amen, busayeeph mbè ane itaang i mbul yanyik akolakol. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Mbok mintshiin, itaang yil’bwiin amon mwooy maku makeph’t, buyeeph anyeeny ane bunyim bu Ntshièm bwanyik akolakol.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />“Ikakaam ndes’bulwoos dikwook, bât ba nkil muku kabelashil bakim a bos bu mbè mwooy maku makim makeph’t. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Dik baan’i shin bishakashaam, ek mwooy mieem kamelashaam mbi.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aalanyeeny busweeng mataang makim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Bwaal anyeeny i manyaang! Ikaam’i mbè kabwaal’k i mpos mu budiey baan i bunywey idik di nshaas mu mwooy ma nkwootsh mbi, ikaam i mbè ane lasu lakun kalubuyiis’k mun bât baaph mbè kabambaak’dj ayeeph mbi <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />ikaam i mbè lasu lakun lel’kayaat bât bakim ba shin a maan muna bôt. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Kabubet’k mbi, lwoom anyeeny Ntshièm itaang iku ikim; ikaam i mbè Ntshièm abuyeek bunoon’l buphaan a mwooy makim melabuyiis, a mbok a mbè buneph ayeem’t a bos bu Mwân a Mwoot.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.37. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 19:47">Lk 19.47</ref>.</char>
    </note>Matu makim Yish ambaak ashaang’l lashaang lasek a Ntuum matu makim; ikwook’l ambaak antow a bol, amwelwoom Ntshièm a Nkwootsh mu Oliiv. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />I bât bakim bambaak bamwiy kosangiees a Ntuum ikaam imwoom’k.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Bumbidj ikaam iyaat Yish</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mataay 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maak 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoon 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.1. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Eks 12.1-27</ref>.</char>
    </note>Matu mambaak mashaal makieek ikaam i nshaas mu maamp maaph lweven, mus’baan abok mbel ane Pasak. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Bakum i batwootsh ba Ntshièm akol bayeeph mikieetsh bambaak besaswoot mbok adiaak Yish, ek bambaak’i butet bu bât.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudaas esaswoot mbok alièm’l Yish</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mataay 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maak 14.10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Ngwoon sataan amayiing’l a ntem mu Yudaas, ambaak i diin di Isakaliot, motsh ambaak aphiing a bieentsh ishieeng baphey. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Yudaas amatow ikaamieswoot bakum ba batwootsh ba Ntshièm akol babek ba Ntuum ikaam iwok’s i baan mbok elaan alièm’l Yish. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Kawok baan nshaas, ambis akun kawook’s baan ikaam imweek phas. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yudaas kayim’saan, atetsh to itaang ikun, katetshaan aswoot mbok alièm’l Yish a busweem abol baan aaph mbè bât bakim kayeeph’dj.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iliees i mom i Pasak ibol a Yish</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mataay 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maak 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoon 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Lasu la nshaas mu maamp maaph i lweven, lanaaph’dj baan adiaak phaang a Pasak, kayeem’l luun. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yish katomaan Petelo akol Yoon ane: “Yaakanyeeny bwetalos bishim bi Pasak ikaam idia.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Bamamuul ane: “Usamuk mbè tienodj akwey?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Kabakal’laan ane: “El’bwiin ayiingil a bol, busakasak’l i nuung asheetsh mbieen a maas. Bunaph anyeeny shaang a mbûl elaan aying’l, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />bulwoos anyeeny kum a mbûl ngo: ‘Ntaang’dj esawuul ane, mbûl a bieentshambaang yil miim adia iliees i Pasak i bieentsh bieem ikwey?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Ngwoon, el’kabulak indodj inen a dik yaalodj i biket bikim; ntshiin imbet yil’bwiin alodj mwooy makim.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Kieen baan, katobaan ataan mbok mintshiin ambaak Yish abalwoos, ngwoon kaneph baan alodj bishim bi Pasak.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bishim bi Kum</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Mataay 26.26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Maak 14.22-25</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Koliint 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Itaang anyeem’liin, Yish kashim’kaan a meens i batom baan. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Kamotsh kabalwoosaan ane: “Namawok nyiing adiayiin a ngon iliees iku a bos bu mbè kanataadj amon maphetsh mbi! <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Ngwoon, ndes’bushaak’s mbè ane, kandel akas adia iliees iku mbi shaang lasu leliy bunyim bu Ntshièm.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />A mbis akun katolaan ikoph, kakasaan lakeeng abol Ntshièm esatwoot ane: “Tolanyeeny ikoph iku kaph’sanyeeny a nkimwiin. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Ikaam’i mbè, ndes’bushaak’s, kandel anyow kamotsh mân ma ndwoom i nviny mbi shaang eliy bunyim bu Ntshièm.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />A mbis akun katolaan diaamp; kakasaan lakeeng abol ntshièm, amabakaph’s a biaas esatwoot ane: “Aku latok lieem lanèy baan idik diin. Kelanyeeny ngwoon ikaam inkan’l.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.20. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Yel 31.31-34</ref>.</char></note>Aman baan adia, kakelaan mbok mintshiin, katolaan ikoph esatwoot ane: “Ikoph iku yin kôt ayeemayeem a makel mieem manswooph idik diin.<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.21. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Ntm 41.9</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Ek, lieenanyeeny, mwoot esampwok’s buphis tesabokiaan lo indiy imotsh a meens ayè! <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Ikakaam, Mwân a Mwoot awakawa mbok mintshiin a bulodj bu Ntshièm, ek maphetsh key ikaam i mwoot amamwok’s buphis!”<verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Bieentsh baan katetsh baan adiwuus ane, nyeeny akus elakel dweey diku.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyeeny mwoot anen a bunyim bu Ntshièm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.24. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:1">Mt 18.1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:34">Mak 9.34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46">Lk 9.46</ref>.</char>
    </note>Bieentsh baan katetsh baan adiwuus a ngon ikaam iyeeph mbè, nyeeny aphiing a baan e mwoot anen. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.25. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:25-27">Mt 20.25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:42-44">Mak 10.42-44</ref>.</char></note>Yish kabalwoosaan ane: “Bakum i bât ba shin itaang bantom’sk bât dweey i ngon ibaan, akol ba bedi bukum a dik di baan besamuk bamababok mbel ane ‘Bât basek.’ <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.26. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mt 23.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mak 9.35</ref>.</char></note>Kabiabusek mbè bwiin bwaal ngo mbi. Ek, mwoot emuna nuung anen aal muna mwa ilieeng, kamotsh wey esakom aal muna muna ngun. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.27. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:12-15">Yn 13.12-15</ref>.</char></note> Ek es’bwiin alieen, nyeeny nuung anen? Ka wey aku ashik a meense? Ek miin, andieengiin nde muna muna ngun.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />“Bwiin, bumashal akolieem a ndieeng maphetsh mieem; <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />ntshiin, mbok akun mbè Taat amampieek bunyim bwaan, i miin ndel’kabuyeek ibuun. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.30. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mt 19.28</ref>.</char></note>Ngwoon a bunyim bweem budiakadia, bunyokanyow kamotsh bushikashim’k a buum bweem ikaam ikom malwootsh ishieeng maphey ma Isaleel.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esatwoot mbok elanton Petelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mataay 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maak 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoon 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Yish kalwoosaan Simoon ane: “Simoon, Simoon! Waal i bwaany! Sak’tieem amabulwoom nkimwiin ikaam i mbè abuso muna baan bansow shaang. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Ek miim, nalwoom’s Ntshièm, ikaam i mbè kudiim’sk yim’siaa mbi. Kamotsh lasu lelween ikadj a miim, neeng bân biin, baal i bunoon’l.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Petelo kanwoos ane: “Kum, ndel akolakol ikaamieniaa a ngat a mwaat kamotsh namwa yaa!”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yish kankal’laan ane: “Petelo, ndes’kalwoos dikwook mbè ane, alwool aku, a bos bu mbè kok kataadj abek mbi, ween untokaton phweet iset ane kandesanyeeph mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phas, Saph baan’i Ngoph’dj</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.35. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:9-10">Mt 10.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-9">Mak 6.8-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3">Lk 9.3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:4">10.4</ref>.</char>
    </note>Yish kalwoosaan bieentsh baan kamotsh ane: “Ambaak miim ndabutom bos a ngun aaph abuyeek mbè phas akol saph aal’k masabaat, bumanyeens i iket mbè imotsh?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Kakal’l baan ane: “Katanyeen iket mbè imotsh mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Ntshiin kabalwoosaan ane: “Ek iphontshi, mbè mwoot aal i phas, ayitol, mbok mintshiin i wey edi saph; mwoot aaph i ngoph’dj, akaph ndel mwaan, aswoom ngoph’dj motsh. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.37. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Yesh 53.12</ref>.</char></note>Ikaam’i mbè bamaaphuun ane: ‘Bamantol muna motsh aphiing biphaang’t,’ bi busek mbè dweey diku diyeem’l idik dieem. Ikaam’i mbè mwooy makim maphuun’dj baan idik dieem mel’kayeem’l.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Bieentsh kanwoos baan ane: “Kum! Ngoph’dj iphey kayingo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Kabakal’laan ane: “Diashil!”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish esalwoom Ntshièm a Nkwootsh mu Oliiv</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mataay 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maak 14.32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yish katowaan a bol, kieenaan bos a Nkwootsh mu Oliiv mbok ambaak ikeleliaan. Bieentsh baan kieen baaniaan. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Antwool baan a indiy iku, kabalwoosaan ane: “Lwoom anyeeny Ntshièm ikaam i mbè kabubwak’k a bilwoong mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Kanephaan atow akol a baan, kieenaan itaan ikieek, kabolaan mayoong’dj a shin. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />Katwootaan ane: “Taat,” “mbè usamuk, ntiees ikoph iku i maphetsh. Ek, kel a imukiaa, kabiaal’k a imukieem mbi.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Ntshiin akun ntshol a to dik kasolaan ikaam ineeng ntem. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Amabomon maphetsh mabwiik, Yish kalwoomaan kamotsh Ntshièm a ngon. Yaangiaan kakaph’diin muna manyaang ma makel mesaswooph a shin.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />A mbis mbè amanalwoom Ntshièm, kakataan a shin kieenaan akol a bieentsh baan. Katowaan bataan babetsh, balèy i maang. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Kabawuulaan ane: “Busabet ikaam i yey? Kat anyeeny a shin bulwoom Ntshièm, ikaam i mbè kabubwak’k a bilwoong bi lakieek mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Besayaat Yish</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mataay 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-49">Maak 14.43-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yoon 18.3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yish abaakaan esatwoot ngwoon, twoong a bât kiyiin, Yudaas motsh aphiing a bieentsh ishieeng baphey ambakienieentsh a bos bu baan. Kiyaan akol a Yish ikaam inyuut. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Ek Yish kamuulaan ane: “Yudaas, usanaph alièm’l Mwân a Mwoot i minyutsh’dj mi munye?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Bât bambaak akol a Yish amwoony baan dweey dinaph’dj akeph’t, kamuul baan ane: “Kum, tabanem’s i ngoph’dj, mbè mbony?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Motsh aphiing a baan kabolaan muna ngun abol kum anen, kambat’laan ito yaan i ikat.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Ek Yish kabalwoosaan ane: “Lieem’l anyeeny akel ngwoon, diashil.” Katolaan ito i mwoot aku kambowaan.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Yish kawuulaan batwootsh banen akol babek ba Ntuum akol bakom’l biidj ikaam ingaat ane: “Busiy i bangoph’dj akol bishok ikaam ingaat muna nde kum a bieem mbony? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.53. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Lk 19.47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21.37</ref>.</char></note>Matu makim namwaak ntshiin a Ntuum, kabutshik answoot ikaam ingaat mbi. Ek iphontshi aku itaangiin kamotsh itaang i manoon’l ma mwim’l ikel ngun mu maan a ndieeng butu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo aton Yish</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mataay 26.57-58</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">26.69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Maak 14.53-54</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">14.66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yoon 18.12-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">18.25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Aman baan ayaat Yish, kieen baaniaan a mbûl abol kum anen. Petelo ambaak esiebalaph a kaany. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Kanem baan katey a ndieeng a laan, Petelo katwoosaan aphiing a bât bambaak bashik akol a tey. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Ngaat muna ngun kamonaan Petelo ashik akol tey, kanieenaan pholoo, katwootaan ane: “Mwoot aku iyaan ambabaak i Yish kamotsh!”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Ek Petelo kantonaan, esanwoos ane: “Ngaat, kandesanyeeph mbi!”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />A mbis itaang ikieek, mwoot iyiek’dj kamonaan, kanwoosaan ane: “I ween u motsh a ndieeng a baan!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Ek Petelo kakal’laan mwoot akun ane: “Nuung, miim kandaaph i baan mbi!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />A mbis itaang imotsh, mwoot iyiek’dj kamotsh katwootaan i yintsh ikim ane: “Ikakaam, mwoot aku ambabaak i Yish, ikaam i mbè muna Ngaleel!”<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Ek petelo kankal’laan ane: “Nuung! Kandeswook mbok esween atwoot mbi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">A itaang intshiin, kok kabekaan. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Kum kakaph’diaan, kalieenaan Petelo pholoo. Itaang intshiin Petelo kakan’laan dweey dimbaak Kum anwoos ane: “A bos bu mbè kok kataadj abek alwool, ween untokanton phweet iset.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Petelo katowaan buseph, kalelaan a ngon.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Besatwoon Yish mishiing, bamambol busudj</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mataay 26.67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Maak 14.65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Bât bambaak besabak Yish, katetsh baan ansey ishiees, bamambol mikaph. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Bamankaan ndel a miish, bamamuul ane: “Shak’l, nyeeny amabol?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Bambaak banwool mwooy mieek’dj mabwiik ikaam intwoon mishiing.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish a bos bu bakom’l inen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mataay 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maak 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yoon 18.19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Butu anyeem buun, nsel mu bakom’l, batwootsh banen akol baphuuny mikieetsh kakwoom’k baan. Kiy baan ilaatsh Yish a bos bu bakum inen. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Kamuul baan ane: “Talwoos, ntshween Kilist mbè mbony?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Kabakal’laan ane: “Mbè ndabulwoos, kabul ampwim’s mbi; <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />mbè nabuwuul dweey, kabulankal’l mbi. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Ek atetsh to iphontshi, Mwân a Mwoot atwokatwoos a lo la ikat la bunoon’l bu Ntshièm.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Bakim bamaakam’l ane: “Mbok ane ween u Mwân a Ntshièm, mbè mbony?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Kakal’laan ane: “Mbok mintshiin antwoot bwiin.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Ngwoon, katwoot baan kamotsh ane: “Kataaph i nyiing mbè mwoot atalwoos mbi! Biitamieet tamawok mwooy ma to muny mwaan!”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yish a bos bu Pilaat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mataay 27.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:14">11.14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maak 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoon 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Nkim mubaan kakat baan, kieen baaniaan a bos bu Pilaat, <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />andaan, katetsh baan mbokanswoong’l ane: “Tamaatotaan mwoot aku esashieeng’s babiyiit, es’bakiny ane kabalieek ilaam i kum mbi kamotsh esatwoot ane ntshaan kum Kilist.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilaat kamuulaan ane: “Ween u Kum a ben Yudey?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yish kankal’laan ane: “Ntshween untwoot weenamieet.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilaat kalwoosaan batwootsh banen i misel mi bât ane: “Kanamwoony mwoot aku i dweey di mbè ta ndiaak mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Ek baan, kaneeng baan dweey di baan ane: “Mwoot aku esaphek’l bât mato i twootshaan! Aabuutsh ben a Yudey bakim! Atetsh to Ngaalel shaang ayè.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish a bos bu Helood</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Amwok Pilaat mwooy maku, kawuulaan ane: “Mwoot aku muna Ngaleel?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Anyeephaan ane, muna yaas’i Helood, kantomaan a bol Helood, ikaam i mbè Helood ambaak a Yelushaleem a matu makun. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Helood kawokaan nshaas amwonyaan Yish, ikaam i mbè ambaak i nyiing amweeph, ambaak amwook nswoos mwaan bukal, kamotsh ambaak i nyiing mbè ankes makam’l. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Helood kamuulaan mwooy mabwiik; ek Yish kankal’l dweey mbè dimotsh mbi. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />A itaang ikun bakum inen baan’i bayeeph mikieetsh bambaak bayeem andaan, besaswoong’l Yish. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Ngwoon Helood i maseleey maan bambaak besansey, bamansesel ambis akun kandiing baan ndel mu phaam. Helood Kakasaan antom abol Pilaat. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Lasu lantshiin Helood baan’i pilaat kakas’baan bukidj bubaan, a bukoos kabambaak awok’s mbi.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bamphuuns Yish iwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mataay 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maak 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yoon 18.39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilaat kabokaan batwootsh banen mbel, bakom’l akol a bât bakim, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />es’balwoos ane: “Bwanyiy i mwoot aku, busanswoong’l ane esaphek’l bât mato. Ndamamuul a bos bwiin, kandesamon i bweph mbè bumotsh bus’bwiin answoong’l. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Helood i yaan kamon i bweph bu mbè bandiaak mbi, ntshiin amaan tatom’siaan. Mwoot aku mbok es’bwiin amon, kaaph i bweph bunkelaan ikaam i mbè bandiaak mbi. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Ngwoos ndel’kambol mikaaph ambis akun baneph anieem’l.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miphuuny mimiakok’s a ntshwoong’l aku 17:</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">A itaang ikim i nshaas, Pilaat ambaak anshaang’l mwoot motsh a mwaat </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(alieen Mak 15.6).</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Ek twoong a bât katetsh baan abok minwool besatwoot ane: “Ndieek anyeeny! Butalieem’s Banaba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />(Banaba ambaak a mwaat ikaam i mbè ambaak adiaak mwoot a bol bukun.)<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Ek Pilaat, ambaak i nyiing ashaang’l Yish, kalwoosaan twoong a bât kamotsh. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Ek bât kabol baan minwool ane: “Mbak anyeeny a ntey mu kek! Mbak anyeeny a ntey mu kek!” <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilaat kabawuulaan phweet anseet ane: “Ankel dweey key dibey? Kanamwoony i dweey dibey dilaan awees mbi. Nambokambol mikaph, namanieem’l.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Ek bât kakas baan aneeng dweey a ngon ane badiaak Yish a dik di ntey mu kek. Mwooy ma baan kambok’l maan latok. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Ngwoon Pilaat kabat’laan ilaang, katwootaan ane, dweey dinwoom baan dikeph’t mbok es’bwiin amuk. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Pilaat kalieem’laan mwoot ambaak baan alwoom a ngat a mbûl a mwaat ambaak baan bayaat ikaam i buphaang’t kamotsh ambaak adiaak mwoot a ituum; ek aan kabayekaan Yish ikaam i mbè bakel mbok ambaak baan amuk.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish a dik di ntey mu kek</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mataay 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maak 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoon 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Mbokun ambaak mayol mielaatsh Yish, kayaat baan nuung a diin di Simoon nshi Sileen, ambaak esiyi to bwaany, kamwiik baan ntey mu kek a inyakiaan, kamulaataan a mbis a Yish.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Twoong minen a bât kanaphiin a mbis, ngwoon baat bambaak besalel bilel, besabok lakeny idik di Yish. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yish kakaph’diaan bos baan, kabalwoosaan ane: “Baat ba Yelushaleem, kabulel’k idik dieem mbi! Ek, lelanyeeny idik diin i bân biin. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Ikaam’i mbè, matu mekiiy mel atwoot bât ane: ‘Nshaas mwaali bikut biaaph mbè kabikwook’dj amon bân mbi, biaaph mbè kabitshik abot mbi, akol bakun baaph mbè kabatshik anyoom’s bân mbi!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.30. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Os 10.8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:16">Mlk 6.16</ref>.</char></note>A mbis akun bât batèkatètsh alwoos mikwootsh minen ane: ‘Tanyaam’k anyeeny!’ I takwootsh takieek ane, ‘Taphweedj anyeeny!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Mbè besakel mwooy maku makim a ntey mu maas ngo, ek el muun awoom bakwook’dj mukel mbony?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Kalaat baan kamotsh biphaang’t bi baluung maphel biphey, ikaam i mbè babadiaak akol a Yish. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Antwool baan a imbet is’baan abok mbel ane: “Ikodj i koph a ntshwey”, mayol kabak baan Yish bikwook a mio akol mateem a dik di ntey mu kek akol biphaang’t biphey, motsh a lo la ikat, iyiek’dj a lo la ikos. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.34. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Ntm 22.18</ref>.</char></note>Yish katwootaan ane: “Taat, bawok’s mweeng, ikaam i mbè kabesayeeph dweey dis’baan akel mbi. Mayol kabok maan mpwiim ikaam iyeeph mbè ane nyeeny elatol mindel miaan.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Kaneph baan adikaph’s banamieet. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.35. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Ntm 22.7</ref>.</char></note>Bât bambaak bayeem bes’balieen. Bandwoong nsel ba ben Yuud bambaak besambos kot, besanwool ane: “Aan ambaak esaphaans ibiek’dj, adiphaans mbè ntshaan Kilist aasol abol Ntshièm!”<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23.36. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:21">Ntm 69.21</ref>.</char>
    </note>I mayol kamotsh kambos maan kot, kiy maan akolaan, kamweek maan mân ma kodj, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />mayol kanwool maan ane: “Mbè u Kum a ben a Yuud, udiphaans wenamieet!”<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Kaphuun baan a dik di ntshwey mwaan ane: “AKU NTSHAAN KUM A BEN A YUUD.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Motsh a ndieeng biphaang’t ambaak abak a ntey mu kek katwoonaan Yish ane: “Kantshween Kilist? Kenephaal adiphaans uneph taphaans i biit!”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Ek aku motsh kaphang’saan esanwool ane: “Kusatshiin Ntshièm mbi? I ween u mun iwa mbok minstshiin i mwoot aku. <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Mpween mwiit tesamon bimweeny bi mwooy mabey mankel biit, ek mwoot aku kaaph i bweph bunkelaan mbi.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Kakasaan atwoot kamotsh ane: “Yish, elween aying’l a bunyim bwaa, umpwiph’l i miim!”<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yish kankal’laan ane: “Ikakaam ndesalwoos mbè ane, alwool aku ween ukaalieem a mpaladiis.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iwa i Yish a ntey mu kek</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mataay 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maak 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoon 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44-45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44-45" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23.44-45. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Eks 26.31-33</ref>.</char>
    </note>Ambaak itaang yatwool a ndieeng a ndieeng mwaany, mwim’l kadiph muun a shin mikim shaang itaang inseet i ikwook’l. Itaang kayem’tiin mbokatieem. Ilieem imbaak yakaan a Ntuum kabaantsh yiin a ndieeng a ndieeng. <verse eid="LUK 23:44-45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.46. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:5">Ntm 31.5</ref>.</char></note>Yish kabokaan dweey dinoon’l ane. “Taat, ndatshik mween mweem a mio miaa.” Atwootaan ngwoon, kawawaan.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Amwoony sès mayol ma Loom dweey diku, kasem’laan Ntshièm, katwootaan ane: “Ikakaam, mwoot aku ambaak mwoot ansek!”<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Bât bakim bambaak amon mwooy maku, kakal baan a mambûl mabaan i buphol, mio batshik a mitshwey. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.49. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:2-3">Lk 8.2-3</ref>.</char></note>Bakidj bakim babol Yish akol baat bambaakiyi yaan to Ngaleel kayeem’t baan kaany ikaam ilieen mwooy mambaakashaam.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baley Yish</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mataay 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maak 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoon 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />Ambabaak mwoot a diin di Yosef, ambaak kom’l anen a ben Yuud. Ambaak mwoot ansek i lwook labwiik, aan kambaak alwoong mwooy mambaak bambèy baan baakel mbi. Ambaakiyi to Alimataay, a nuung mu ben a Yuud, ambaak esakwoong’l bunyim bu Ntshièm. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Yosef kieenaan a bol Pilaat, kanwoomaan ndju mu Yish. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Kamukum’laan to ntey mu kek, ambis akun kamukophaan mbwoon, kamubeyaan a yaan yatshim a ngat a mbôk, a yaan yaaph mbè kabatshik aley mwoot mbi. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Ambaak lasu la mataan, lasu lalodj Nsabat lumbaak akolakol.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Baat bambaakieyeentsh i Yish to Ngaleel, kieen baan i Yosef, bambaak besalieen yaan, kamon baan mbok alieedj baan ndju mu Yish. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.56. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:10">Eks 20.10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:14">Dtn 5.14</ref>.</char></note>A mbis akun, kakal baan bos a bol, kalaam baan mananaans akol sedj a alomat ikaam ibak latok la Yish.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Ek lasu la Nsabat, kabambaak akel ngun mbi, ikaam i mbè ambaak lasu la ikin. Mbok ambaak mikieetsh mi ben a Yuud.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Mibumdj mi Yish</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mataay 28.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maak 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoon 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Ntshiees butu a lasu labiing, baat kieen baan a yaan, bielaatsh mananaans ma sol minoon’l mambaak baan balodj. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Antwool baan, katobaan ataan mbôk imbaak yadiph adik di yaan bamibum’dj a nkol, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />ayiing’l baan a ngat a yaan, kabamon latok la Yish mbi. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Antetsh baan adiwuus banamieet, itaang intshiin kashis baan baluung baphey bading mindel misababadj bayeem a nkol. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Bambaak i butet a mitem, bos baphum’l a shin. Kabalwoos baan ane: “Busaswoot mwoot edi mwoony aphiing midju idik di yey? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.6. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mt 16.21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:18-19">20.18-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mak 8.31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9.31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33-34">10.33-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Lk 9.22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">18.31-33</ref>.</char></note>Kaaph ayè mbi, amabuum. Yiiph’lanyeeny mbok ambaakaan abulwoos a Ngaleel ane: <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />‘Bi busek Mwân a Mwoot banièm’l a mio mi bakedj ba mwooy mabey, bamambak a ntey mu kek, ambuum lasu lanseet.’”<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Baat kayiiph’l baan mwooy matwotsh’diaan, <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />katow baan to yaan kieen baan yelwoos bieentsh ishieeng imotsh akol bât biek’dj. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Ambaak Maliy ma Magadala, Yaan akol Maliy, inaan abol Shaak. Baat biek’dj bambaak i baan, kieen baan yelwoos batom biek’dj. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Ek bieentsh kaphis baan ane, mwooy mambaak atwoot baat, ambaak makuus; kamotsh kabalwoong mbi. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Ngwoon, Petelo kakataan mbaang bos a yaan. Ampum’laan a yaan kamonaan bishaan binameet. Kakalaan a bol bwaan esiekam’dj ikaam i mwooy makun.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbok a bos a Emawus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Maak 16.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Lasu lakun lantshiin, bieentsh baphey bambaakienyeentsh bos a Emawus, bol bumbaak akolakol mateem ishieeng imotsh ma lieen bos a Yelushaleem, <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />bambaak besietwootsh mpween mu baan idik di mwooy makeph’dj baan. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Itaang imbaak baan yetwootsh mwooy makun, kamotsh biebok keny, Yish anamieet kasem’saan akol a baan, kieenaan i baan; <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />bambaak besamon, ek miish mabaan kamambaak atieeng’l ikaam inyeeph mbi. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yish kabawuulaan ane: “Busatwoot dweey key a ndieeng a lieen?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Kayeem’t baan iphwa i buphol bubwiik. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Motsh aphiing a baan, a diin di Keleofas, kamuulaan ane: “U weenamieet a Yelushalem aaph mbè kesayeeph mwooy mankeph’t matu makuwe?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yish kabawuulaan ane: “Dweey key?” Kankal’l baan ane:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">“Kusayeeph mwooy mankeph’s Yish mun a Nazaleet,” “Ambaak ngaang a Ntshièm anoon’l; amabilak a bikelel baan’i mwooy maan a bos bu Ntshièm akol a bos bu bât bakim. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Bakum ba batwootsh biit baan’i bandwoong nsel bamanièm’l ikaam indiaak, bamambak a ntey mu kek. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Tambaak tesabok lakeny mbè ntshaan anaph’dj aphaans Isaleel. Ek alwool aku lasu lanseet to taan ankeph’t mwooy maku. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Kamotsh baat bakieek ba phingiit bamatabaans mitem. Bambaak bayeen a ntshees butu bos a yaan, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />ek kabatotaan ndju mwaan mbi. Amwiy baan ikadj katalwoos baan ane bantshol bamasos, bamabalwoos ane Yish edi mwoony. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Bakieek aphiingiit amween baan bos a yaan, bamatotaan mbok amabalwoos baat bakun, ek kabamon Yish mbi.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Ngwoon Yish kabalwoosaan ane: “Bu bât baaph i lakeny, mitem miin mi bwool ikaam iyim’s mwooy ma mabulwoos bangaang ba Ntshièm! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Kabusayeeph mbè Kilist edi dweey dimon bimweeny biku a bukoos buying’l a buum bwaane?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Katetshaan balwoos mwooy makim mbok mintshiin aphuun’dj baan a nkaan mu Ntshièm, atetsh to mikaan mi Moos suk mikaan mikim mi bangaang ba Ntshièm.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Antwool baan akol bol bumbaak baan yeleph, Yish kakelaan muna mwoot akun ambaak esieyeentsh lieen laan; <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />ek kabamuk anieem’l ikaamieen mbi. Kanwoos baan ane: “Shaaliit, ikaam i mbè butu bwanyikayiil.” Kayiing’laan ikaam ishaal i baan. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Itaang intwoosaan a meens ikaam idia i baan, katolaan diaamp, kalwoomaan Ntshièm esanshaak’s, ambis akun kadibat’laan, kabakaph’saan. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Miish ma baan katieeng’l maan, kanyeeph baan; ek kadiimaan a miish ma baan. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Katetsh baan mbok diwuus banamieet ane: “Mitem miit kamimbak’dj muna misatieem tey ambakaan talwoos dweey di Ntshièm a ndieeng a mboke?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Kakat baan itaang ikun intshiin, kieen baan bos a Yelushaleem. Katobaan ataan bieentsh ishieeng i motsh bakwoom’k a imbet imotsh i bieentsh biek’dj <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />kabalwoos baan ane: “Ikakaam, Kum amabuum to iwa! Simoon amamon!”<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />A mbis akun bieentsh bakun baphey katetsh baan ababos ntshik mu mwooy mamwoony baan a ndieeng a mbok, kamotsh mbok ayeeph’dj baan Yish itaang imbakaan esabat’l diaamp.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish asol abol bieentsh baan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mataay 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maak 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoon 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Bikelel bi Bapostool 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Ambaak baan atwoot kamotsh, Yish anamieet kasolaan aphiing a baan es’balwoos ane: “Nkit’l mwaaliin!”<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Mitem mibaan kabaantsh miin, kawok baan butet bubwiik, ikaam i mbè bambaak besaphis ane bamon ndju. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Ek aan kabalwosaan ane: “Busakam’l idik di yey? Busabok miaang mi yey a mitem miin? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Lieenanyeeny makas mieem akol mateem mieem: ke miime! Mpwaam’dj anyeeny, ndieentsh anyeeny! Ikaam’i mbè mween kamumwaak i latok akol ikodj mbi; ek miim ndedi biin mbok es’bwiin ambon.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Ambaakaan atwoot mwooy makun, ambaak es’balak makas maan i mateem maan. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Idim imbaak baan abel ayim’s, bambabaak i nshaas mubwiik, besakam’l, kabawuulaan ane: “Budi iket idia ayè?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Kamweek baan iteny i swey yawuuph, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />kayitolaan, kayidiawaan a miish mabaan.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />A mbis akun kabalwosaan ane: “Namabulwoos ambaak miim aphiingiin, lienanyeeny mbok ambaak miim nabulwoos mwooy mampuuny’dj baan a mikieetsh mi Moos idik dieem, a mikaan mi bangaang ba Ntshièm akol Bantshieem, bikun bikim bidi dweey diyeem’l.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Ngwoon, kanephaan badiph’l lakeny ikaam i mbè bawok bimpuunydj baan a mikaan mi ikin, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />kabalwosaan ane: “Lienanyeeny mbok ampuuny’dj baan: Kilist amokamon bimweeny, bamandiaak, ambuum to iwa lasu lanseet, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />bashakashaang’l diin diaan a bos bu bât bakim ba shin a maan, atetsh to Yelushalem, ikaam ilwoos mwoot aku nkim mbè akal’l ntem, bamwook’s mweeng mu bweph bwaan. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Bu bitieen bât ba mwooy maku makim. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.49. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:4">Bik 1.4</ref>.</char></note><char style="wj" closed="false">Ndel’k abutom’s bimbaak Taatiem akeliin ilak. Ek bwiin shaalanyeeny a bol bu Yelushaleem shaang el’bwiin ayool tô i bunoon’l bu to dik.”</char><verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yish akal a dik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maak 16.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Bikelel bi Bapostool 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24.50. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Bik 1.9-11</ref>.</char>
    </note>Itaang intwool baan akolakol i Betaniy, andaan kashieen’laan mio miaan a dik kabashaak’saan. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Itaang ikun imbakaan bashaak’s, kanamaan i baan yebaany bos a dik. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Ek baan, aman baan ansem’l, kakal baan bos a Yelushaleem, i nshaas mubwiik a mitem, <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />itaang iku ikim bambaak a Ntuum mu Ntshièm ikaam isem’l kamotsh ashaak’s Ntshièm.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>